<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">- Kuloonaay</book>
  <para style="h">Máciya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Máciya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eyya Máciya naakiice ya</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eyya Máciya naakiice ya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Máciya</para>
  <para style="imt">Waah wa weeyem wa ti púkoo eyye</para>
  <para style="ip">Ayme akiice púkoo eyye? Púkoo eyye pikee pa Máciya akiice yo. Máciya aŋe <char style="w">Asuwif</char>, caacawoo lompo Lewi. Akina hínum <char style="w">asayoola kúncoo</char> ya eti mah ma miti <char style="w">Room</char>. Mah ma miti <char style="w">Israyel</char> ti sempe sa siti Room immiyeniye ti oom caanak. Máciya náayenoonii oonool ti <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka pakati Yéesu Krista (<char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 9:9">9:9</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Teyme naakiice yo? Ta naakiice yo ta pikee pa máamun sitiil áwii puwant áwii ésupak (20-40) pamuusal eket ya eti Yéesu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Peyme naayeniye ta naakiice yo ta? Pikee pa ti saatee ya eti Antiyok niŋ fotom ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Siriya</char>.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ti pakayme naakiice yo? Payenka naakiice yo ka fanfaŋ kayem Pusuwif niŋ Pusuwif pa Pikelecen pa.</para>
  <para style="ip">Weyme uyem hikaw púkoo eyye niŋ heewune ha neekiicee? Pútuun pa píyinananaa-yínanan hínum nii, éfipupoñii akee aŋa afaafakan pakan etempo. Pusuwif pa nkayeno hítuulu an a aŋuu sitiil seemeeŋe, nkasokoo <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa. Ti púkoo eyye, Máciya náayisan nii Yéesu ayem Eenucee ya aŋa nkayaamakoole ya kiteyoo ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>. Náayisan eehuu pínapii ti hipukuyee ha hiteyoo (<char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 1:18-2:23">1:18–2:23</ref></char>), ti eloŋ ya eteyoo (<char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 3:13-4:25">3:13–4:25</ref></char>; <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">17:1-13</ref></char>; <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 21:1-17">21:1-17</ref></char>), ti pakalaŋanaloo (<char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 5:1-7:29">5:1–7:29</ref></char>; <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 10:1-11:1">10:1–11:1</ref></char>; <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 11:2-13:58">11:2–13:58</ref></char>;<char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 18:1-20:28">18:1–20:28</ref></char>; <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 21:23-25:46">21:23–25:46</ref></char>) ti píyisan pa niŋ waah wa weecukantee wa ewwa náahine wa (<char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 8:1-9:38">8:1–9:38</ref></char>; <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 14:13-15:39">14:13–15:39</ref></char>), ti eket ya eteyoo (<char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 26:1-27:66">26:1–27:66</ref></char>) niŋ ti pilito pa piteyoo (<char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 28:1-15">28:1-15</ref></char>). Náayisan lompo nii Yéesu áfaayini hitoonu <char style="w">elemeyu</char> ya eti maamaa ateyoo amansa ya <char style="w">Dawid</char> (<char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 1:1">1:1</ref></char>; <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 21:9">21:9</ref></char>), apiyeno amansa ya pánipani ya ati Israyel. Náayisan lompo nii <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char> káyiniyini pinako ti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> samat nii fa mpíyinanane fa <char style="w">Abraham</char> eeyem ya maama ati Yéesu (<char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 1:1">1:1</ref></char>; <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 2:1-12">2:1-12</ref></char>; <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">8:5-13</ref></char>; <char style="ior"><ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">15:21-28</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="is">Kikee kilim keetaake nafaa</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="k">Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> - cikina ciyem la Pútuun pa mpiyem la amansa ya. Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa cikina ciyem pakan paka púlooŋ keesayane ka Pútuun pa nii pikina piyem amansa ya ateyii. Ta Máciya naakiice ta, asok cáwii ca citi alacana.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="k">Púlunta</char> - ekina eyem dúniyaa ya.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="k">Ayaamakoola</char> - akina ayem an aŋa nákup ti caacaw ca citi Pútuun pa. Ayaamakoola pánipani nasoksok eeha Pútuun pa mpusoke ha.</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="k">Kayine</char> - ekina eyem hitaaku sempe ti pakan payenka ayyem teyii ati hikaw.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">Fa púkoo ya neekiicee fa:</para>
  <para style="io1">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="MAT 1:1-4:11">1:1–4:11</ref>
    </char> Ekéy ya eti Eenucee ya ati Pútuun pa</para>
  <para style="io1">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="MAT 4:12-16:20">4:12–16:20</ref>
    </char> Galilee, Eenucee ya náayisanee ti kilim niŋ ti pawenal</para>
  <para style="io1">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="MAT 16:21-20:34">16:21–20:34</ref>
    </char> Písik Galilee puwant Jerusalem, Eenucee ya káakup ka kiteyoo kiti eket ya eteyoo niŋ pilito pa piteyoo</para>
  <para style="io1">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="MAT 21:1-28:15">21:1–28:15</ref>
    </char> Jerusalem, Eenucee ya naalaakiyee, naamukee, náalitaniyee ti eket ya</para>
  <para style="io1">
    <char style="ior">
      <ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">28:16–28:20</ref>
    </char> Galilee, Eenucee ya kúmpoña ka kiti pinapana pa pakateyoo</para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1" />
  <para style="s">Símaama Yéesu Krista</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1" />Ehe heekiicee ha kiti símaama Yéesu Krista ati miin ma miti amansa ya <char style="w">Dawid</char> ati miin ma miti <char style="w">Abraham</char>.<verse eid="MAT 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2" />Abraham apuke <char style="w">Isaak</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:2">Isaak naapuk <char style="w">Jakob</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:2">Jakob naapuk <char style="w">Juda</char> niŋ ñúnuwoo niŋ pakatuwoo.<verse eid="MAT 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3" />Juda naapuk Peles niŋ Serah, íññaa ateyii ayem Tamal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:3">Peles naapuk Hesilon.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:3">Hesilon naapuk Lam.<verse eid="MAT 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4" />Lam naapuk Aminatap.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:4">Aminatap naapuk Naason.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:4">Naason naapuk Salumon.<verse eid="MAT 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5" />Salumon naapuk Powas, íññaa ateyoo ayem <char style="w">Lahap</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:5">Powas naapuk Yopet, íññaa ateyoo ayem Rut.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:5">Yopet naapuk Yesaay.<verse eid="MAT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6" />Yesaay naapuk amansa ya Dawid.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="MAT 1:6" />
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:6">Dawid naapuk <char style="w">Solomon</char>, íññaa ateyoo ayeniye hínum Uliya aaloo.<verse eid="MAT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7" />Solomon naapuk Lopowam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:7">Lopowam naapuk Apiya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:7">Apiya naapuk Asa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Caacawoo lompo Asaf</char></note><verse eid="MAT 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8" />Asa naapuk Yosafat.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:8">Yosafat naapuk Yeholam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:8">Yeholam naapuk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: Yeholam náayemi maama ati Usiya</char></note> Usiya.<verse eid="MAT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9" />Usiya naapuk Yotam.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:9">Yotam naapuk Ahas.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:9">Ahas naapuk Hesekiya.<verse eid="MAT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10" />Hesekiya naapuk Manase.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:10">Manase naapuk Amon<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Caacawoo lompo Amos</char></note>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:10">Amon naapuk Yosiya.<verse eid="MAT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11" />Yosiya naapuk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: Yosiya náayemi maama ati Yekoniya</char></note> Yekoniya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Caacawoo lompo Yehoyakin</char></note> niŋ pakatuwoo, tempo pakati Babilon nkacoope pakati <char style="w">Israyel</char> ti sempe kapikin ti mah ma miti Babilon.<verse eid="MAT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12" />Ta pakati Israyel nkacoopee ta Babilon, tempo Yekoniya naapuke Salatiyel.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:12">Salatiyel naapuk<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: Salatiyel náayemi maama ati Solopapel</char></note> Solopapel.<verse eid="MAT 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13" />Solopapel naapuk Apiyut.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:13">Apiyut naapuk Eliyakim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:13">Eliyakim naapuk Asol.<verse eid="MAT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14" />Asol naapuk Satok.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:14">Satok naapuk Akim.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:14">Akim naapuk Eliyut.<verse eid="MAT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15" />Eliyut naapuk Eleyasal.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:15">Eleyasal naapuk Matan.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:15">Matan naapuk Jakob.<verse eid="MAT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16" />Jakob naapuk <char style="w">Josef</char>.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 1:16">Josef asaye <char style="w">Mari</char>, íññaa ya ati Yéesu aŋa nkayonkal a <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa.<verse eid="MAT 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17" />Ooto, písik ti Abraham fo ti Dawid sikaay siyema ŋaasuwan niŋ sipaakiil sitaakiye; niŋ písik ti Dawid fo ta pakati Israyel nkacoopee ta Babilon, sikaay siyema ŋaasuwan niŋ sipaakiil sitaakiye; niŋ písik lompo ti oom caanak fo ta Eenucee ya naapukee ta, sikaay siyema ŋaasuwan niŋ sipaakiil sitaakiye.<verse eid="MAT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hipukuyee ha hiti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18" />Ehe fa hipukuyee ha hiti Yéesu Krista nihitaakiye fa. Iññáa ateyoo ayem <char style="w">Mari</char> aŋa áyiin a aŋa nkasok a <char style="w">Josef</char> naaŋaame ya ekop. Pale le niŋ áfaameyiyoo aal inhemool Mari asayaa munow ti sempe sa siti <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char>. <verse eid="MAT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19" />Fiye, Josef eeŋaamoo ya ekop an <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">eecoonoole</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: an eenape</char></note> apan álafiitoo kaasuuwan hátikin pakan paka, ekina ewune náalafiyoo kakatan pakan paka péemiit. <verse eid="MAT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20" />Pale, ta naayeniye ta káamiilool eehuu, <char style="w">maleekoo</char> eti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> néefulii teyoo ti éyawut, neesokoo: “Josef eesoke <char style="w">Dawid</char> maamaa, timpi fe esa Mari, kaatuko ti sempe sa siti Kunuu ka keenape ka naasaye munow. <verse eid="MAT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21" />Afaapuk ciñii cikampaani aakati luwoo caacaw ca Yéesu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ekina eyem: Ateeteyo nafakanfakan</char></note> kaatuko akina afaafakan pakanoo ti umuuyen wa uteyii.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22" />Fiyuu intaakiye ancuk eeha Ateeteyo naasoke ha púlooŋ pínapii ti <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya hitaakiyaa, asok:<verse eid="MAT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23" />
    <char style="qt">“Sincan, ámaacul éemiit áyiin afaasa munow, naapuk cikampaani;</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 1:23">
    <char style="qt">efikaluwoo caacaw ca Emanuwel,”</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:23 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 7:14">Esayi 7:14</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
  </para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:23">ekina eyem “Pútuun pa umpa niŋ unaa.”<verse eid="MAT 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24" />Fiye, ta Josef náayiyoonii ta náahin eeha maleekoo ya eti Ateeteyo neesokoo ha: naasa Mari. <verse eid="MAT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25" />Pale ámiitoo aal fo ta naapuke ta cikampaani ca. Naaluwoo caacaw ca Yéesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2" />
  <para style="s">Hiyoopuyee ha Yéesu hiti keemeya ka picaaŋaŋ pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1" />Yéesu naapukee ti saatee ya eti Betelehem ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Judaay</char> ti caanak ca citi amansa ya <char style="w">Helot</char>. Ta naapukee ta intaako pákayiin keemeya picaaŋaŋ pa, kéefulii pa caanak ca íncifulii pa, nkacol <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>. <verse eid="MAT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2" />Nkayeno kacakan: “Amansa ya ati <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa eepukee ya, peyme naayem? Kaatuko ucukaacuk ecaaŋaŋ ya eteyoo néefulii,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: ucukaacuk ecaaŋaŋ ya eteyoo pa caanak ca íncifulii pa </char></note> núukey hímuluyoo.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3" />Ta amansa ya Helot náasiye ta hilim eehuu, naaliim niŋ lompo pakati Jerusalem púlooŋ. <verse eid="MAT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4" />Naaconcenool ñíhampaatiin <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> púlooŋ niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char>, naacakanii: “Peyme <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa naañaŋee hipuku?” <verse eid="MAT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5" />Nkañahanoo: “Ti saatee ya eti Betelehem ti mah ma miti Judaay. Kaatuko fiye <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya naakiice:<verse eid="MAT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6" />
    <char style="qt">'Awe Betelehem, saatee ti mah ma miti Juda,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">
    <char style="qt">ti kikaw ka pakati Juda aahaŋut káataakaati nafaa;</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:6">
    <char style="qt">kaatuko ti awe hikaw ha naakaakaay éfulii,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:6">
    <char style="qt">aŋa áfaatintiŋan ya pakanam pakati <char style="w">Israyel</char> samat nii afaasa.'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 5:2">2 Samiyel 5:2</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:2">Mika 5:2</ref> </char>
    </note>”<verse eid="MAT 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7" />Fiye, amansa ya Helot náayonkalii ti piyolo keemeya ka picaaŋaŋ pa, náasi teyii teyme fanfaŋ ecaaŋaŋ ya néefulii. <verse eid="MAT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8" />Púful toko, naapoñii kapikaay Betelehem, naasokii: “Nikaay, caniŋesatool pinap añii ya. Emma innicukoo ma, innisokam, inci lompo kati kaayoo hímulu.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9-10" />Ta nkásiye ta pákupal amansa ya, nkakaay. Púful toko, nekacuk ecaaŋaŋ eyya nkacuke ya ta nkayeniye ta éfulii pa caanak ca íncifulii pa. Ta nkacuke ta ecaaŋaŋ ya, nkameeŋ niŋ pásuuma penfakat. Neenowii hátikin fo ta neecole ta la añii ya naayeniye la, neesiiŋo. <verse eid="MAT 2:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11" />Nkanako ti ekumpaan ya, nkacuk añii ya niŋ íññaa ateyoo <char style="w">Mari</char>. Nkákilipo hátikin añii ya kápumuloo. Fiye, nkápankin pínnake pa piteyii nkawufanoo uwun: sanoo, caminkoloŋ éeciita hinoom niŋ munucu méesuume haaw emma nkasok miir.<verse eid="MAT 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12" />Púful toko, Pútuun pa mpúkupananii ti éyawut nii timpi kañoho pati amansa ya Helot. Fiye, nkacoop pikee pítin kapuñoho pati mah ma miteyii.<verse eid="MAT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Katey ka Esipt</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13" />Ta keemeya ka picaaŋaŋ pa nkayete ta, <char style="w">maleekoo</char> eti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> néefulii ti <char style="w">Josef</char> ti éyawut, neesokoo: “Lito, coop añii ya niŋ íññaa ateyoo intey ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Esipt</char>, kaatuko <char style="w">Helot</char> afaaŋes añii ya kati amukoo. Yeno po fo ta inci fasoki ta ñóhoonii.” <verse eid="MAT 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14" />Fiye, Josef naalito naacoop añii ya niŋ íññaa ateyoo naakaay Esipt impisit. <verse eid="MAT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15" />Naayeno po fo ta amansa ya Helot afaaket. Fiyuu intaakiye ancuk eeha Ateeteyo naasoke ha pínapii ti <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya hitaakiyaa, asok: <char style="qt">“Yonkalaayonkal añiinam ápufulii Esipt.”</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 11:1">Hoseya 11:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Helot himuku ha hiteyoo mikampaani ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16" />Púful toko, amansa ya Helot ápipannum nii keemeya ka picaaŋaŋ pa kacaakooloo-caakool, inseeñoo meemak. Tempo naapoñe kapumuk mikampaani ma meetaake ma sitiil súsupak puwano t’etaam, meeyem ma Betelehem niŋ misaatee ma méekinkoole mo ma. Kaatuko afinaafin ti caanak enca keemeya ka picaaŋaŋ pa nkasokoo ta éfulii ya eti ecaaŋaŋ ya. <verse eid="MAT 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17" />Fiyuu eeha <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya Jeremiya naasoke ha nihitaakiye, asok:<verse eid="MAT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18" />
    <char style="qt">“Nkási kaalalapanool ti saatee ya eti Lama,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">
    <char style="qt">pukooŋ niŋ káacoolan kenfakat.</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 2:18">
    <char style="qt">Rasel ayem ti pukooŋ epuukoo,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">
    <char style="qt">álafiit apupuuñanoolee,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 2:18">
    <char style="qt">kaatuko kaneetaat.”</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:18 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 31:15">Jeremiya 31:15</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="MAT 2:18" />
  </para>
  <para style="s">Eñóhoonii ya Naasalet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19" />Pamuusal eket ya eti amansa ya <char style="w">Helot</char>, <char style="w">maleekoo</char> eti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> néefulii ti <char style="w">Josef</char> ti éyawut ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Esipt</char>. <verse eid="MAT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20" />Neesokoo: “Lito, coop añii ya niŋ íññaa ateyoo, iññoho ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Israyel</char>, kaatuko kéelafiye ka himuku añii ya kaketaaket.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21" />Josef naalito, naacoop añii ya niŋ íññaa ateyoo, naañoho ti mah ma miti Israyel. <verse eid="MAT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22" />Pale, ta náasiye ta nii Aakelayos atoone cáwii ca citi paapaa ateyoo Helot ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Judaay</char>, naafe po pikaayu. Fa náakupananee fa ti éyawut, náaful apikaay ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Galilee</char>. <verse eid="MAT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23" />Naakaay apicaakin ti saatee ya eti Naasalet. Fiyuu intaakiye ancuk eeha <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa nkasoke ha hitaakiyaa, nii afaasokee ati Naasalet.<verse eid="MAT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3" />
  <para style="s">Saŋ-Patis kawañal ka kiteyoo pítin pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1" />Sitiil sipimuus, áyiin aŋa nkasok <char style="w">Saŋ</char>-Patis náafulii apiyeno káatuunan ekooŋan eyye ti <char style="w">káahaaŋ ka tes</char> kiti <char style="w">Judaay</char>, <verse eid="MAT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2" />naasok: “Níwunko umuuyen wa utaaluu, kaatuko <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> cílohiyooloh!” <verse eid="MAT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3" />Saŋ ayem aŋa <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya <char style="w">Esayi</char> naasoke ya kiteyoo, asok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">
    <char style="qt">“An oopa ti hiceeku ti káahaaŋ ka tes,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 3:3">
    <char style="qt">'niwañal pítin pa piti Ateeteyo,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 3:3">
    <char style="qt">nicoonanool ñítin ña ñiteyoo.'”</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:3 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 40:3">Esayi 40:3</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="MAT 3:3" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4" />Fiye Saŋ hísool ha hiteyoo henfakat ha eeha nawaso ha, heememanoolee niŋ pahan peeseñate piti puñonkomoo, nacenk ti hiñowuyoo peletoo eti kapaŋ. Nali pukoskos niŋ múkum. <verse eid="MAT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5" />Tempo pakan keemeeŋe nkákeyii teyoo, poko kayem: pakati <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, pakati mah ma miti Judaay púlooŋ niŋ pisaatee pa púlooŋ péekinkoole pa musuu ma miti Jordan. <verse eid="MAT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6" />Nkayeno ewatanoolo umuuyen wa uteyii hátikin pakan paka, Saŋ náahinii <char style="w">pátise</char> ti musuu ma miti Jordan.<verse eid="MAT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7" />Hícump <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Asatusaay">Pusatusaay</char> nkákey pa naayeniye pa íhinu pátise. Pale ta Saŋ naacukii ta, naasokii: “Aluu mifepa emmuu! Ayme ákupanane aluu kati nitey paseeña pa piti Pútuun pa peeyem pa ti ékey? <verse eid="MAT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8" />Níhin waah weenape samat nii enuun eyya nepuk papukal peenape. Fiyuu éfiyisan nii níwunkaawunko umuuyen wa utaaluu. <verse eid="MAT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9" />Timpi nímiilool esokoolo nii: 'Unaa ufakaafak kamma <char style="w">Abraham</char> naayem maamaa ati unaa.' Kaatuko inci pusok aluu, háati ti pínankiin empe Pútuun pa píyiniyini éfulanii epuuk pakati Abraham. <verse eid="MAT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10" />Ehe hinahaane ha nihihintanee ti ñínkonk punuun pa. Enuun óo enuun eepukut papukal peenape, efeefiitee neewantee ti seemak.<verse eid="MAT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11" />“Inci niŋ man inci ínhin aluu pátise píyisan nii níwunkaawunko umuuyen wa utaaluu. Pale, aŋa eeyem ya ti ékey pusonam ahaŋaam sempe, túuniit fala hiwaatu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: kaayekan</char></note> pisamata pa piteyoo. Akina áfaahin aluu pátise niŋ <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> niŋ seemak. <verse eid="MAT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12" />Kaahelu ka kiteyoo unka ti epeesoo kati ákatinool pakak pa niŋ éheeni ya. Naamank pakak pa la ti pileefaan pa piteyoo, pale afaasowan éheeni ya ti seemak seehokiyantoo.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ihínuyee pátise ya eti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13" />Ti oom caanak, Yéesu náaful ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Galilee</char>, naakaay ti musuu ma miti Jordan, naaloh <char style="w">Saŋ</char> ancuk Saŋ áhinoo <char style="w">pátise</char>. <verse eid="MAT 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14" />Pale Saŋ náalafi hipooku, naasokoo: “Inci soolahe áapihinam pátise! Fiye weyme uwune awe ínkey ti inci?” <verse eid="MAT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Kat hipitaako fo, kaatuko fiyuu éfuuhinaa púlooŋ eeha Pútuun pa mpílafiye ha.” Fiye Saŋ naacoon. <verse eid="MAT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16" />Emma Yéesu náahinee ma pátise, náafulii ti man ma. Tokotoko, patiila ímpankino naacuk Kunuu ka kiti Pútuun pa nkúwanoonii samat nii hícuucuuku, nihileeho teyoo. <verse eid="MAT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17" />Tokotoko, hilim níhifulii alacana, nihisok: “Aŋe ayem Añiinam aŋa inci íllafiye ya, teyoo inci intaake pásuumayam.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4" />
  <para style="s">Híluuŋuyee ha hiti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1" />Púful toko, <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkucoop Yéesu ti <char style="w">káahaaŋ ka tes</char>, <char style="w">Seetaani</char> ya kati eŋes híluuŋuyoo. <verse eid="MAT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2" />Naasuŋ hánant hanakan fo kunoom áwii ésupak, ti pikelan peep mpucokoo. <verse eid="MAT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3" />Fiye, Seetaani ya, áluuŋa ya, náakey teyoo, naasokoo: “Páawoo awe yem Añii ya ati Pútuun pa, sok pínankiin empe piyeso kúmpuul!” <verse eid="MAT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4" />Yéesu naañahan yo: “Kiiceekiic ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> nii: <char style="qt">'an ataloŋ niŋ hímpuul lamma, pale niŋ hilim óo hilim héefulii ti putum Pútuun pa.'</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">Kakaman 8:3</ref></char></note>”<verse eid="MAT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5" />Fiye Seetaani ya neecoopoo <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, saatee ya eesampanee ya. Neesiiŋanoo la haŋe la pahaan ti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>. <verse eid="MAT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6" />Nene esokoo: “Páawoo awe yem Añii ya ati Pútuun pa, fúl le cípo t’etaam! Kamma inkiicee nii:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">
    <char style="qt">'Efipusok <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">pumaleekoo</char> etempo pimankooli;</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 91:11">Kícimu 91:11</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:6">
    <char style="qt">pumaleekoo pa éfipiseepini niŋ sipees etempo,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:6">
    <char style="qt">eeha efihiwun ha kooti etikulooŋoolo ti énankiin.'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:6 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 91:12">Kícimu 91:12</ref>
      </char>
    </note>”<verse eid="MAT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7" />Yéesu naañahan yo: “Kiiceekiic lompo nii: <char style="qt">'Aañaŋut puwinko <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa pitii.'</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:16">Kakaman 6:16</ref></char></note>”<verse eid="MAT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8" />Fiye, Seetaani ya neecoopoo ti pisempuc tíntiŋ eehaane meemak. Néeyisanoo cáwii ca citi <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> púlooŋ niŋ hamake etenco, <verse eid="MAT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9" />neesokoo: “Aŋe púlooŋ inci fawufani náakilipiyaa hátikinam ímmulam.” <verse eid="MAT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10" />Yéesu naañahan yo: “Fúl le Seetaani! Kamma inkiicee nii:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 4:10">
    <char style="qt">'Ateeteyo Pútuun pa pitii aññaŋe ékilipo hátikin etempo, apan pikina lamma aññaŋe kaawaaseen.'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:13">Kakaman 6:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>”<verse eid="MAT 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11" />Fiye Seetaani ya neekatan Yéesu. Ta neekatanoo ta, pumaleekoo mpíkey teyoo mpiyankananoo.<verse eid="MAT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Híyaañu ha hiti Yéesu páhin pa piteyoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12" />Ti oom caanak, <char style="w">Saŋ</char> naakulee. Ta Yéesu náasiye ho ta, náaful <char style="w">Judaay</char> apikaay ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Galilee</char>. <verse eid="MAT 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13" />Afiyiit Naasalet pale naacaakin <char style="w">Kafaanawum</char>, pukol han ha hiti Galilee ti mah ma miti Sepulun niŋ Nafatali. <verse eid="MAT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14" />Fiyuu intaakiye ancuk eeha <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya <char style="w">Esayi</char> naasoke ha hitaakiyaa, asok:<verse eid="MAT 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15" />
    <char style="qt">“Mah ma miti Sepulun niŋ Nafatali, ti pítin pa pukol han ha, ti kikee kaapii ka kiti musuu ma miti Jordan meeyem ma ti mah ma miti Galilee,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:15">
    <char style="qt">pa <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char> nkakine pa,</char>
    <verse eid="MAT 4:15" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16" />
    <char style="qt">pakan paka keekine ka ti énimaan kacukaacuk ecaaŋ enfakat;</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 4:16">
    <char style="qt">ti keekine ka ti etaam ya eti hísaalumant ha hiti eket ya, ecaaŋ éfuliyoo.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 9:1-2">Esayi 9:1-2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>”<verse eid="MAT 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17" />Ti oom caanak, Yéesu náayaañ káatuunan apusok: “Níwunko umuuyen wa utaaluu, kaatuko <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> cílohiyooloh.”<verse eid="MAT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaayonkal ka kiti Yéesu pinapanayoo pákayaañ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18" />Púful toko, Yéesu naayeno kasapal ti kantant ka kiti han ha hiti <char style="w">Galilee</char>, naacuk picalafayya pákasupak nkayeno hiwantu cala ya eteyii ti han ha. Payenkuu an niŋ atuwoo, ucawii Simon, aŋa nkasok a <char style="w">Piyeer</char>, niŋ Andre. <verse eid="MAT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19" />Yéesu naasokii: “Nínapaniyam, inci fáhin aluu picalafayya pakan.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20" />Ti poonool, nkatah toko picala pa piteyii nkanapan Yéesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21" />Yéesu ápuful toko, nene acuk akee áyiin niŋ atuwoo nkayeno ti piteen niŋ paapaa ateyii Sepete, ti kaamemanool picala pa piteyii. Ucawii <char style="w">Saak</char> niŋ <char style="w">Saŋ</char>. Yéesu naayonkalii kapinapanoo. <verse eid="MAT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22" />Tokotoko, nkatah toko piteen pa niŋ paapaa ateyii, nkanapan Yéesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanapan ka kiti uyoŋ wa Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23" />Púful toko, Yéesu naakaawool mah ma miti <char style="w">Galilee</char> púlooŋ, naayeno kakalaŋan ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">púluumuma</char> pa piti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa, náatuunan ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>, náakuuñan kéekuuñe ka ti káakuuñu óo káakuuñu niŋ kéehute ka púlooŋ. <verse eid="MAT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24" />Eehuu hiwune kiteyoo nkísiyo ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Siriya</char> púlooŋ, nkácoopii teyoo pakan paka púlooŋ keetaake ka káakuuñu óo káakuuñu: keeyem ka íññiseeña, payenka <char style="w" lemma="Hísaalumant">kísaalumant</char> nkúwuuliye ka, payenka nkanow ka niŋ kéehute ka, Yéesu náakuuñanii. <verse eid="MAT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25" />Fiye uyoŋ weemeeŋe nuunapan Yéesu, kéefulii ti mah ma miti Galilee, Tekapol,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ekina eyem: sisaatee ŋaasuwan seeyem pukol mah ma miti Galilee. Pisaatee piti keeneetaat Pusuwif pale intaako po lompo pakakee Pusuwif.</char></note> <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, <char style="w">Judaay</char> niŋ ti kikee kaapii ka kiti musuu ma miti Jordan.<verse eid="MAT 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5" />
  <para style="s">Kakalaŋan ka ti tíntiŋ ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1" />Ta Yéesu naacuke ta uyoŋ wa, naasilo tíntiŋ ya, naayeno, pinapana pa pakateyoo nkákey teyoo. <verse eid="MAT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2" />Náayaañii kakalaŋan.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="MAT 5:2">Hiyihu</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 5:2">Yéesu naasok:<verse eid="MAT 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3" />“Kayihaayih, poko keeleke ka ti kunuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:3">kaatuko <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> citeyii.<verse eid="MAT 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4" />Kayihaayih, poko keeyem ka ti keeŋoot,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:4">kaatuko efikapuuñanoolee.<verse eid="MAT 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5" />Kayihaayih, poko keewananooliye ka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:5">kaatuko efikasa etaam ya.<verse eid="MAT 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6" />Kayihaayih, poko kéelaakane ka ti waah óo waah ewwa Pútuun pa mpílafiye wa kápihin samat nii keeyem ti peep pálaani mpucokii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:6">kaatuko efikasiitanee.<verse eid="MAT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7" />Kayihaayih, poko keetaake ka paket hikaw ti pakan paka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:7">kaatuko Pútuun pa efipitaak teyii paket hikaw.<verse eid="MAT 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8" />Kayihaayih, poko keeyem ka nii eloŋii púlooŋ eti Pútuun pa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:8">kaatuko efikacuk Pútuun pa.<verse eid="MAT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9" />Kayihaayih, poko kéecoopii ka kásuumaay ka ti pakan paka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:9">kaatuko efikayonkalee epuuk Pútuun pa.<verse eid="MAT 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10" />Kayihaayih, poko keekallanee ka kamma nkáhine eeha Pútuun pa mpílafiye ha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 5:10">kaatuko cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa citeyii.<verse eid="MAT 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11" />“Niyihaayih niŋ kateñalaa aluu, nkakallan aluu, nkacaam kapusok heenaput kiti aluu kamma inci. <verse eid="MAT 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12" />Niŋaañaa inniyeno ti pásuuma, kamma kawun kenfakat nkiyem ti hítuulu aluu alacana. Kaatuko fiyuu nkakallane <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa kéekeyii ka le niŋ aluu éfinikey.”<verse eid="MAT 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakalaŋan ka kiti micempanu ma niŋ ecaaŋ ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13" />Yéesu nene asok: “Aluu niyem micempanu ma miti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>. Pale niŋ micempanu ma míyitanaa, puume pasampe etemmo efipiñahanee? Mitaakut nene nafaa fo hiwantuyee tíkitaaŋ pakan paka nkakakal temmo.<verse eid="MAT 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14" />“Aluu niyem ecaaŋ ya eti púlunta pa. Saatee eelutee ti tíntiŋ eyinaatee hiyolu. <verse eid="MAT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15" />Ti moonool muu, an acaaŋanantoo lampi náawuf teyyo eheem! Pale, nawaŋwaŋ yo ti esafu kati ecaaŋan púlooŋ keeyem ka ti ekumpaan ya. <verse eid="MAT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16" />Fo lompo incuke, ecaaŋ ya etaaluu eñaŋaa hicaaŋu hátikin pakan paka ancuk kacukaa páhin pa pitaaluu peenape pa, nkámul Paapaa ataaluu eeyem ya alacana.”<verse eid="MAT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakalaŋan ka kiti hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17" />Yéesu nene asok: “Timpi cuk aluu nii inci kéyyookey káfulan <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char> niŋ kilim ka kiti <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa. Inci kéyyoot káfulan etenko pale eeha nkasoke ha kati hitaako fanfaŋ. <verse eid="MAT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18" />Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya: Taamanta patiila niŋ t’etaam kácimut, háati cilim ca ceehaŋe ca káafomaati éticicim ti hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha fo ta waah óo waah efuupa pitaako. <verse eid="MAT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19" />Ooto niŋ an átuulut cilim coonool ti hilim ha heesiiŋanee eehe naakalaŋan pakakee paka kápihin moonool muu, oom an afaacokee eehaŋe káataakaati nafaa ti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>. Pale niŋ an átuulaa ho, naakalaŋan pakakee paka kápihin moonool muu, oom an afaacokee eetaake nafaa ti cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa. <verse eid="MAT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20" />Kaatuko inci pusok aluu, niŋ níhinut eeha Pútuun pa mpílafiye ha pihaŋ <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Móyiis niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa, etininako ti cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa.”<verse eid="MAT 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakalaŋan ka kiti káñiken ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21" />Yéesu nene asok: “Nísiyaasi nii símaama unaa kasokeesok nii: 'Timpi muk an ti pásuumayi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13">Efúlii 20:13</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17">Kakaman 5:17</ref></char></note> An óo an eemuke an ti pásuumayoo áfaahinee kíiti.' <verse eid="MAT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22" />Pale inci insok aluu, niŋ an óo an áñikenaa ti áwiyoo an,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: niŋ an óo an áñikenaa ti áwiyoo an haahaw</char></note> áfaahinee kíiti. Niŋ an asokaa áwiyoo an, 'awe likee tom!' afaacoopee ti éhinuma kíiti. Niŋ an asokaa áwiyoo an, 'awe wuyaawuyo', oom an afaawantee ti seemak sa seehokiyantoo sa.<verse eid="MAT 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23" />“Ekina ewune, niŋ áacoopiyoo waah uti kaawaaseen Pútuun pa pati <char style="w">kaaciin</char> ka, toko ínnawuno nii áwiyi an oopa ataake heeseeñoo ti awe, <verse eid="MAT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24" />tah toko oom waah hátikin kaaciin ka, íncaasuumoolii niŋ áwiyi an, niŋ fúlaa toko íññohoonii uwwaaseen kaawaaseen ka kitii Pútuun pa.<verse eid="MAT 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25" />“Niŋ akamooli ayeniyuu hicoopu ti áhina kíiti, ti pítin pa síyool neyoo mpacas. Niŋ ekina tom afaawufani áhina kíiti ya, áhina kíiti ya naawufani ati éwuulu ya, ankulee. <verse eid="MAT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26" />Inci pusoki pánipani ya, áatifulii ti núkuluma ennuu awe peecooyut kaahit ka kikelan ka!”<verse eid="MAT 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakalaŋan ka kiti pihinto niŋ aal eenimiye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27" />Yéesu nene asok: “Nísiyaasi nii kasokeesok nii: 'Timpi hinto niŋ aal eenimiye.'<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:14">Efúlii 20:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:18">Kakaman 5:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28" />Pale inci insok aluu, aŋa asincane aal naataak paleña teyoo, oom an ince ahintiyaa neyoo ti kunuuwoo. <verse eid="MAT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29" />Ooto niŋ níkini náali ninakanuu ti kaamuuyen, lókit no uwwant no. Fisaka áapupuul kaapii koonool ti eniini áawantumee púmpuluŋi ti seemak. <verse eid="MAT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30" />Niŋ epeesi yáali enakanuu ti kaamuuyen, fiit yo uwwant yo. Fisaka áapupuul kaapii koonool ti eniini áakaayum púmpuluŋi ti seemak.”<verse eid="MAT 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakalaŋan ka kiti káfulan aal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31" />Yéesu nene asok: “Kasokeesok lompo nii: 'Aŋa áfulane aaloo añaŋoo lompo kawufan kaahit kéeyisane nii áfulanoofulan.'<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:1">Kakaman 24:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32" />Pale inci insok aluu, áyiin óo áyiin éefulane aaloo, aal a peehaañiit,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fo niŋ pinimo pa picenkutee ti pítin.</char></note> oom áyiin kanakan aaloo ti pahaaño naayaake niŋ aal a animiyaa ti akee. Ayíin eesaye aal éefulanee, ti eloŋ eti pahaaño naayem.”<verse eid="MAT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakalaŋan ka kiti esintoolo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33" />Yéesu nene asok: “Nísiyaasi lompo símaama aluu kasokeesok nii: 'Timpi fúl ti eeha ansintooliye ha.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: Timpi sintoolo ti kincaam</char></note> Pale hín eeha ansintooliye ha hátikin <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char>.'<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:12">Lewitik 19:12</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 30:2">Pafinal 30:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34" />Pale inci insok aluu, timpi sintoolo múk. Timpi sintoolo ti alacana kaatuko po <char style="w">elemeyu</char> ya la Pútuun pa mpiyeno la neeyem. <verse eid="MAT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35" />Timpi sintoolo ti etaam ya kaatuko élempuma woot etempo. Timpi sintoolo ti caacaw <char style="w">Jerusalem</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: púcoonool Jerusalem </char></note> kaatuko saatee ya eti Pútuun pa, Amansa ya enfakat a. <verse eid="MAT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36" />Timpi sintoolo ti hikawi kaatuko aayinaat káhiiniyan niŋ ekina tom kápaaniyan kaahan koonool ti hikawi. <verse eid="MAT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37" />Nisok lamma 'ee' iyyema ee niŋ ekina tom 'haani' iyyema haani. Waah óo waah ewwa ampenane toko ti Eekance ya núufulii.”<verse eid="MAT 5:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakalaŋan ka kiti kánukan ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38" />Yéesu nene asok: “Nísiyaasi kasokeesok nii: 'Níkin, níkin nacooyoo; káaŋiiŋ, káaŋiiŋ nacooyoo.'<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:24">Efúlii 21:24</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:20">Lewitik 24:20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:21">Kakaman 19:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39" />Pale inci insok aluu, niŋ an ayeniyuu íhinu heenaput, timpi kitoo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: timpi núkan</char></note> Niŋ an ahankuu ti kaawiilu káali, ufanoo kikee ka lompo. <verse eid="MAT 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40" />Niŋ an álafiyuu hicoopu kíiti kati acoop hísool ha hitii, ufanoo lompo hísool ha hitii henfakat ha. <verse eid="MAT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41" />Niŋ an óo an atiyanuu ti sempe waah weenapa náahini aapisapal kilomeetal yoonool, sapal neyoo súsupak. <verse eid="MAT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42" />An óo an eeluumuu, uwwunoo. Niŋ an álafiyaa kanahan waah ti awe, timpi pook.”<verse eid="MAT 5:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakalaŋan ka kiti pálafi akamooli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43" />Yéesu nene asok: “Nísiyaasi kasokeesok nii: 'Láfi akinooli,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lewitik 19:18</ref></char></note> innat akamooli.' <verse eid="MAT 5:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44" />Pale inci insok aluu, nílafi pikamool aluu, niluum Pútuun pa heenape payenka nkakallan ka aluu. <verse eid="MAT 5:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45" />Fiyuu, efiniyeno epuuk Paapaa ataaluu eeyem ya alacana. Kaatuko, akina náfulanii caanak ca ti keenape ka niŋ ti keenaput ka; náanupanii etiil ya ti kéehine ka eeha Pútuun pa mpílafiye ha niŋ kéehinut ho ka. <verse eid="MAT 5:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46" />Niŋ nílafiyaa kéelafiye ka aluu, enkeyme kaapuuñanool innikaakaay hitaaku? Háati <char style="w" lemma="Asayoola kúncoo">pisayoola kúncoo</char> nkáhinhin fo! <verse eid="MAT 5:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47" />Niŋ nikicanaa pákawii aluu pakan lamma, weyme ínnihine weetaapala úhinee? Háati <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char> nkáhinhin fo! <verse eid="MAT 5:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48" />Niyeno kéetuuniye samat nii fa Paapaa ati aluu eeyem ya alacana naayem fa éetuuniye.”<verse eid="MAT 5:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6" />
  <para style="s">Kakalaŋan ka kiti kawun keeleke ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1" />Yéesu nene asok: “Nitah kunuu! Inniyeniyaa íhinu eeha Pútuun pa mpílafiye ha, timpi níhin ho hátikin pakan paka kati kacuk aluu. Niŋ hitaakiyaa, etinitaak kaapuuñanool ka kiti Paapaa ataaluu eeyem a alacana. <verse eid="MAT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2" />Ooto niŋ aayeniyaa kawufan salaka an eeleke, timpi sap kámpiis. Fiyuu ñícuf ña nkáhin ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">púluumuma</char> pa niŋ ti ñítin ña, ancuk pakan paka kámulii. Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, kapayaapa hisayu kaapuuñanool ka kiteyii. <verse eid="MAT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3" />Pale awe, niŋ aayeniyaa kawufan salaka, epeesi yaamay timpi émeyi eeha epeesi yáali neeyem ha ti íhinu. <verse eid="MAT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4" />Fiyuu salaka ya etii efeewufanee ti piyolo, Paapaa atii aŋa nacuk a wéehinee wa ti piyolo afaacooyi.”<verse eid="MAT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakalaŋan ka kiti kaluum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5" />Yéesu nene asok: “Niŋ niyeniyaa kaluum timpi níhin samat nii ñícuf ña. Poko nkálafi pisiiŋo niŋ kayeniyaa kaluum ti púluumuma pa niŋ ti híliŋ ha pakan paka kati kacukii. Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, payenkuu kapayaapa hisayu kaapuuñanool ka kiteyii. <verse eid="MAT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6" />Pale awe, niŋ aayeniyaa kaluum, nako ti ékaap ya etii, impank hunkut ha, illuum ti Paapaa atii eeyem a la yoliye la.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: illuum ti Paapaa atii eecukantee ya; niŋ ekina tom, illuum ti Paapaa atii ti piyolo</char></note> Paapaa atii aŋa nacuk ya wéehinee wa ti piyolo afaacooyi.<verse eid="MAT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7" />“Niŋ niyeniyaa kaluum, timpi nitowo ti káakup kenseŋ samat nii <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char>. Cukiicuk nii Pútuun pa éfipisiitanii kamma nkayem ti káakup keemeeŋe. <verse eid="MAT 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8" />Ooto timpi nicuk nii poko, kaatuko Paapaa ataaluu ámeyimeyi eeha innisoolahe ha le niŋ efiniluumoo.<verse eid="MAT 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9" />“Fiye, niŋ niyeniyaa kaluum innisok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:9">'Paapaa atoonii eeyem a alacana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:9">álimaati caacawi cisampanee,<verse eid="MAT 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10" />álimaati <char style="w" lemma="Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa">cáwii</char> ca citii cíkey,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 6:10">álimaati eeha állafiye ha hitaako</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:10">t’etaam samat nii fa iyyem fa alacana.<verse eid="MAT 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11" />Alímaati aawufan unii fíyooy paliyal pa empa nuusoolahe pa.<verse eid="MAT 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12" />Alímaati aaponket unii umuuyen wa utoonii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:12">samat nii fa nuuponket fa lompo umuuyen wa uti keemuuyene ka toonii.<verse eid="MAT 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13" />Timpi katan unii upunow ti híluuŋu ha,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 6:13">pale fakan unii ti Eekance ya.'<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">An ámiit man Máciya lompo akiice fiye: Kaatuko awe taake kayine ka, sempe sa niŋ hamake ha fo cancowiyaaw. Amiin.</char></note><verse eid="MAT 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14" />“Kaatuko niŋ niponketaa pakan paka keemuuyene ka taaluu, Paapaa ataaluu eeyem ya alacana afaaponket aluu lompo. <verse eid="MAT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15" />Pale niŋ niponketut pakan paka keemuuyene ka ti aluu, Paapaa ataaluu lompo ataponket umuuyen wa utaaluu.”<verse eid="MAT 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakalaŋan ka kiti suŋ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16" />Yéesu nene asok: “Niŋ nisuŋaa timpi nímaahan samat nii fa ñícuf ña nkáhin fa, kaatuko ñuhooŋuyii iññikaasitoolo kápiyisan pakan paka nii kasuŋaasuŋ. Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, payenkuu kapayaapa hisayu kaapuuñanool ka kiteyii. <verse eid="MAT 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17" />Pale awe, niŋ aasuŋaa, santaŋ hikawi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yéesu asok: nuc wani</char></note> iññow puhooŋuyi. <verse eid="MAT 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18" />Ancuk áatiyisan pakan paka nii aasuŋaasuŋ. Pale Paapaa atii eeyem a la yoliye la,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: Paapaa atii eecukantee ya; niŋ ekina tom, Paapaa atii afaacuki ti piyolo</char></note> afaacuk. Paapaa atii aŋa nacuk a wéehinee wa ti piyolo afaacooyi.”<verse eid="MAT 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakalaŋan ka kiti hisaanumate hiti alacana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19" />Yéesu nene asok: “Timpi niconcenool hisaanumate ti etaam ya, la cemmek niŋ komoŋ nkápucalool la niŋ la pílipa nkahaat la kápilip. <verse eid="MAT 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20" />Pale niconcenool hisaanumate alacana la innimeya la nii cemmek niŋ komoŋ étikapucalool, la pílipa etikahaat kápilip. <verse eid="MAT 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21" />Kaatuko la hisaanumate ha hitii nihiyem, toko lompo yaani neeyem.”<verse eid="MAT 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakalaŋan ka kiti ñíkin ña, lampi ya eti enii ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22" />Yéesu nene asok: “Ñíkini ñikina ñiyem lampi ya eti eniini. Niŋ ñíkini ñinapaa, eniini púlooŋ efeemeeŋ niŋ ecaaŋ. <verse eid="MAT 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23" />Pale niŋ ñíkini ñinaput, eniini púlooŋ néeniman. Ooto niŋ ecaaŋ ya eeyem ya ti awe énimaan, énimaan ya efeefom.”<verse eid="MAT 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakalaŋan ka kiti ewasoolo ya kúnuul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24" />Yéesu nene asok: “An ayinaat páhin ti ñíhampaatiin pákasupak. Afáalafi oonool a naanat akee ya, niŋ ekina tom naacok piliit oonool a naapook akee ya. Niyinaat ti coonool kaalehanool káyinan Pútuun pa niŋ pálafi mañ.<verse eid="MAT 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25" />“Eehe hiwune inci insok aluu, timpi niwasoolo kúnuul ti eloŋ ya etaaluu, ti waah ewwa efinili niŋ pálaani, niŋ fotom ti sinii aluu, waah ewwa éfinisoolo. Fo eloŋ ya ehaŋut paliyal, enii ya ehaŋut pásooliyal? <verse eid="MAT 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26" />Nisincan pusuwa pa, pusukantoo, pumaañantoo, piconcenoolantoo pamaañal pa ti pileefaan, pale Paapaa ataaluu eeyem a alacana nákuuman po. Fo nihaŋut po nafaa? <verse eid="MAT 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27" />Ayme ti aluu, ti ewasoolo kúnuul, ayina kapenan háati esuuŋut ti eloŋ ya eteyoo?<verse eid="MAT 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28" />“Weyme uwune kati niwasoolo kúnuul ti pásooliyal aluu? Nisincan fa híliilii ha nihiŋant fa. Ihínantoo piseeñ niŋ ekina tom hiliilantoo. <verse eid="MAT 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29" />Pale inci pusok aluu, háati amansa ya <char style="w">Solomon</char> niŋ hisaanumate ha hiteyoo fiye púlooŋ ásankinantoo samat nii hikina. <verse eid="MAT 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30" />Niŋ Pútuun pa púsoolaa fiyuu káaheeni enkuu, keeyem ka le fíyooy, kacom nkuwantee ti seemak, faala aluu, puume conko étipusool aluu? Aluu pakati káyinan keefomut!<verse eid="MAT 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31" />“Ooto timpi niwasoolo kúnuul ti hisoku: Weyme nuukaakaayaa hili? Weyme nuukaakaayaa pálaani? Weyme nuukaakaayaa púsoolo? <verse eid="MAT 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32" />Kaatuko <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char>, poko nkaŋes waah ewwuu. Pale Paapaa ataaluu eeyem a alacana ámeyimeyi nii nisoolahaa-soolah aŋuu púlooŋ. <verse eid="MAT 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33" />Níyaañ niŋes fala <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> niŋ eeha mpílafiye ha, ínnihinaa fo, waah ewwe púlooŋ efuuwufanee aluu.<verse eid="MAT 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34" />“Ooto timpi niwasoolo kúnuul hiti kacom, kaatuko kacom efeetaak kúnuul eteeho. Hinoom óo hinoom hitaakaataak kúnuul eteeho hak.”<verse eid="MAT 6:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7" />
  <para style="s">Kakalaŋan ka kiti káahinaati an kíiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1" />Yéesu nene asok: “Timpi níhin kíiti pakan, ancuk Pútuun pa étipihin aluu kíiti. <verse eid="MAT 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2" />Kaatuko Pútuun pa éfipihin aluu kíiti samat nii fa ínnihin fa kíiti pakan paka, efipiniik aluu niŋ eniiku eyya inniniike ya pakan paka. <verse eid="MAT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3" />Weyme uwune annincuk cíheeni ca ceeyem ca ti níkin atii ya, awe péepannumut hifiin ha heeyem ha ti níkini? <verse eid="MAT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4" />Puume ayyina hisoku atii ya, 'Atoomuu, túulam inci púfulani cíheeni ca ceeyem ca ti níkini' awe pataakal hifiin ti níkini? <verse eid="MAT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5" />Awe nícuf! Yáañ fúlan hifiin ha ti níkini, tempo áafayini hicuku picaaŋ cataŋ aakati yíni káfulan cíheeni ca ceeyem ca ti níkin atii ya.<verse eid="MAT 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6" />“Timpi niwufan weesampanee wa piyen pa, niŋ ekina tom éfipiyesoonii mpitaatulool aluu; timpi niwant pínankiin pa péeciita pa hinoom pícalukun pa, niŋ ekina tom efipikakalool po.”<verse eid="MAT 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakalaŋan ka kiti piŋiino kaluum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7" />Yéesu nene asok: “Niluum, efipuwun aluu, niŋes efinilaŋan, niwenken éfipipankin aluu. <verse eid="MAT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8" />Kaatuko, an óo an eeluume afaawunee, an óo an eeŋese afaalaŋan, an óo an eewenkene áfaapankinee.<verse eid="MAT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9" />“Ayme ti aluu afaawufan añiinoo énankiin niŋ aluumoo hímpuul? <verse eid="MAT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10" />Niŋ ekina tom, naawufan añiinoo epululoola niŋ aluumoo yoon? <verse eid="MAT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11" />Niŋ aluu keenaput ka nimeya kawun waah weenape epuuk aluu, puume Paapaa ati aluu eeyem ya alacana atahaŋ naawufane waah weenape keeluumoo wo ka.<verse eid="MAT 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12" />“Ooto níhin pakan paka samat nii fa ínnilafiye fa púlooŋ kati nkáhin aluu: eehuu hiyem pakalaŋanal pa piti <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char> niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa.”<verse eid="MAT 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakalaŋan ka kiti putum pa peekoke pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13" />Yéesu nene asok: “Ninako ti putum pa peekoke pa, kaatuko putum pa peeweñe pa empa mpucoop pa ti púpuco, pítin etempo mpúsuum pikaayu, keemeeŋe nkanako tempo. <verse eid="MAT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14" />Pale putum pa piti eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya pukokaakok apan pítin pa peehiiŋe pa po mpíciiti, pakan keemeeŋut nkalaŋan po.”<verse eid="MAT 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakalaŋan ka kiti enuun niŋ papukal eteyyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15" />Yéesu nene asok: “Nitah kunuu ti keeneetaat ka <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pánipani. Nkákeykey ti aluu pucuk nii písaacii, pale saanii samat nii siti piyen elampa. <verse eid="MAT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16" />Ti pawenalii efinikiiwii. Fo an nacutcut papukal wiiñ ti halalanc niŋ fotom sootoo ti punuun piti pícankun? <verse eid="MAT 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17" />Fo lompo incuke, enuun óo enuun eenape nepukpuk papukal peenape, pale enuun eenaput nepuk papukal peenaput. <verse eid="MAT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18" />Enuun eenape eyinaat hipuku papukal peenaput, enuun eenaput lompo eyinaat hipuku papukal peenape. <verse eid="MAT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19" />Enuun óo enuun eepukut papukal peenape efeefiitee neewantee ti seemak sa. <verse eid="MAT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20" />Fiyuu, efinikiiw ti pawenalii keeneetaat ka piyaamakoola pánipani.<verse eid="MAT 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21" />“Pakan paka tom púlooŋ payenka nkasokam ka 'Ateeteyo, Ateeteyo' efikanako <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>, pale aŋa náhin a eeha Paapaa atoom eeyem a alacana náalafiye ha. <verse eid="MAT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22" />Ti hinoom ha hikelan ha, pakan keemeeŋe efikasokam: 'Ateeteyo, Ateeteyo, ti caacawi nuuyaamakoole, ti caacawi nuuyaane <char style="w" lemma="Hísaalumant">kísaalumant</char> ka, ti caacawi lompo núuhine hícump weecukantee.' <verse eid="MAT 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23" />Fiye inci fasokii: 'Taapala méyi aluu, nihaasiyam aluu píhina pa heenaput ha!'”<verse eid="MAT 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakalaŋan ka kiti aluta eecohatiye niŋ eecohatiit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24" />Yéesu nene asok: “Ooto, an óo an éesiye pakalaŋanalam apan náahin po, afaanakool nii an eecohatiye eelute ekumpaan ya eteyoo ti énankiin. <verse eid="MAT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25" />Etiil ya neenup, ésaacin ya néekey, hiyam ha nihisap meemak ti ekumpaan ya, pale enowut kaatuko esiiŋanee-siiŋan ti énankiin. <verse eid="MAT 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26" />Pale an óo an aŋa násiitan a pakalaŋanalam apan áhinut po, anakoolaa-nakool nii esoŋ eelute ekumpaan ya eteyoo ti esiya peewakut t’etaam. <verse eid="MAT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27" />Etiil ya neenup, ésaacin ya néekey, hiyam ha nihisap meemak ti ekumpaan ya. Neenow neehancaloolo púlooŋ cew.”<verse eid="MAT 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28" />Ta Yéesu naapaye ta kakalaŋan enkuu púlooŋ, uyoŋ wa ínnimii ti pakalaŋanaloo, <verse eid="MAT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29" />kamma naakalaŋanii niŋ sempe, cukut nii <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana pa pakateyii pakati hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char>.<verse eid="MAT 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8" />
  <para style="s">Káakuuñanee ka kiti áyiin ati kanuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1" />Púful toko, Yéesu náawanoonii ti tíntiŋ ya, kayoŋ kenfakat nkinapanoo. <verse eid="MAT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2" />Tokotoko, áyiin ati <char style="w">kanuk</char> naalohoo, náakilipo hátikinoo naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, áayiniyaamyini kaakuulan, niŋ áalafiyaa.” <verse eid="MAT 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3" />Yéesu náañaakanii epeesoo, náalikoo naasokoo: “Inci láfilafi, kuul!” Tokotoko, áyiin a naakuul ti kanuk ka kiteyoo. <verse eid="MAT 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4" />Fiye Yéesu naasokoo: “Timpi sok eehe an. Pale kaay cáayisanoolo <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">awaaseena ya ati Pútuun pa</char>, niŋ fúlaa toko uwwaaseen kaawaaseen ka enka <char style="w">Móyiis</char> naasoke ka,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:1-32">Lewitik 14:1-32</ref></char></note> áapiyisan pakan paka nii aakuulanee-kuulan.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káyinan ka kiti áhampaatiin asoocaali ati Room</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5" />Púful toko, Yéesu naanako ti saatee ya eti <char style="w">Kafaanawum</char>, áhampaatiin asoocaali naalohoo naaŋiiniyoo, <verse eid="MAT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6" />naasok: “Ahámpaatiin, amiikan a atoom oopa ahintiye t’enuuf áhutaahut, náayemi ti kúnuul kenfakat.” <verse eid="MAT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Inci fakaay ínkuuñanoo.” <verse eid="MAT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8" />Pale áhampaatiin a asoocaali ya naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, inci túuniit aapinako ti ekumpaan ya etoom. Pale sok hilim hoonool lamma, amiikan a atoom áfaakuuñanee. <verse eid="MAT 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9" />Kaatuko inci himuumam ti sipees áhampaatiin iyyem, pusoocaali lompo nkáyemi ti sipeesam. Niŋ inci sokaa aŋe 'kaay', naakaay; insok aŋe 'kéy', náakey. Insok amiikan a atoom 'hín fiye', náahin fo.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10" />Ta Yéesu náasiye ta eehe, ínnimoo, naasok keeyeniyoo ka kanapan: “Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, inci taapala cuk káyinan ka kenfakat enke ti pakati <char style="w">Israyel</char>. <verse eid="MAT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11" />Inci pusok aluu, keemeeŋe éfikafulii ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> púlooŋ, kápikey hili ha henfakat ha niŋ <char style="w">Abraham</char>, <char style="w">Isaak</char> niŋ <char style="w">Jakob</char> ti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>. <verse eid="MAT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12" />Pale epuuk ya pakati cáwii ca efikawantee tíkitaaŋ ti énimaan. Toko efitaak pukooŋ niŋ kaafincool úŋiiŋ.”<verse eid="MAT 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13" />Fiye Yéesu naasok áhampaatiin asoocaali ya: “Kaay! Hitaako samat nii fa áyyinane fa.” Ti oom waati amiikan a ateyoo náakuuñanee.<verse eid="MAT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakuuñanee ka kiti keemeeŋe ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14" />Púful toko, Yéesu naakaay lati ekumpaan ya eti <char style="w">Piyeer</char>. Naatook aasonoo aal naahintiye kaatuko pasowe-enii naataake. <verse eid="MAT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15" />Yéesu náalikoo ti epees, pasowe-enii ya mpúful. Piyeer aasonoo náalitoonii, naawas Yéesu apili.<verse eid="MAT 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16" />Oom nkániim, nkácoopii ti Yéesu hícump pakan payenka <char style="w" lemma="Hísaalumant">kísaalumant</char> nkinakiye. Yéesu naayaan kísaalumant ka niŋ hilim ha hiteyoo, náakuuñan kéekuuñe ka púlooŋ. <verse eid="MAT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17" />Fiyuu intaakiye ancuk eeha <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya <char style="w">Esayi</char> naasoke ha hitaakiyaa, asok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 8:17">
    <char style="qt">“Naatiyo úkuuñu wa utuunaa,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 8:17">
    <char style="qt">náafulan ñíseeña ña ñutuunaa.”</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:17 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 53:4">Esayi 53:4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="MAT 8:17" />
  </para>
  <para style="s">Kéelafiye ka kanapan Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18" />Púful toko, Yéesu naacuk kayoŋ ka kéekiipooloo ka, naasok pinapana pa pakateyoo kakaay ti kikee kaapii ka kiti han ha. <verse eid="MAT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19" />Akee <char style="w">akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char> naalohoo naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, inci fanapani pan óo pan pa ankaakaay.” <verse eid="MAT 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Piyen elampa ya pitaakaataak uyeen, pusuwa pa mpitaak ñáawuunu, pale inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, taakut la fanaŋ hikawam.” <verse eid="MAT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21" />Akee ti pinapana pa naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, túulam pícaahokii fala paapaa atoom.” <verse eid="MAT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22" />Pale Yéesu naasokoo: “Napanam, inkat keekete ka kapuhok pakateyii keekete ka.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaasiiŋan ka kiti Yéesu hítaapanu eyam ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23" />Púful toko, Yéesu náayuuko ti piteen pa, pinapana pa pakateyoo nkanapool neyoo. Nkayeno kaafiitan han ha. <verse eid="MAT 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24" />Tokotoko, hítaapanu eyam néesapii ti han ha, kúsuu ka nkiyeno kaameeŋan piteen pa man. Pale Yéesu naayeno hiŋotu. <verse eid="MAT 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25" />Pinapana pa nkalohoo nkáyiyaloo, nkasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, fakan unii, efuuketaa!” <verse eid="MAT 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Weyme uwune innife? Aluu pakati káyinan keefomut!” Fiye naalito, naafet ti hiyam ha niŋ han ha, nihipilan niit. <verse eid="MAT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27" />Poko púlooŋ ínnimii, nkasok: “An puume uwwe? Háati hiyam ha niŋ han ha níhisiyoo!”<verse eid="MAT 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakuuñan pákayiin pákasupak pakati kísaalumant</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28" />Púful toko, Yéesu naaciŋ ti kikee kaapii ka kiti han ha, ti mah ma miti Katala.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Náasiyaa Katala, ekina eyem pakan paka pakati saatee ya eti Katala. Pikee pakiical pa piti Kilek mpusok Katala, pale pikee pa lompo mpusok Kelasa. Kelasa niŋ Katala pisaatee peekufut ti mah emmuu.</char></note> Pákayiin pákasupak nkáfulii pati kúhokuma ka, nkapaakoolanoo. Pákayiin paka payenkuu <char style="w" lemma="Hísaalumant">kísaalumant</char> kúwuuliyii. Nkayeno pákayiin keehiñe meemak, háati an áhaañiyantoo himuusu oom pítin.<verse eid="MAT 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29" />Tokotoko, nkayeno hiceeku kapusok: “Weyme állafiye toonii, Añii ya ati Pútuun pa? Fo áakeyyookey aakati kallan unii le niŋ waati ya éfeetuuno?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30" />Inhemool koolee enfakat eti pícalukun neeyeno kaahoon pílaaŋii. <verse eid="MAT 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31" />Kísaalumant ka nkiŋiino Yéesu, nkusokoo: “Niŋ aayaanaa unii, katan unii upunako ti koolee ya eti pícalukun pa.” <verse eid="MAT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32" />Yéesu naañahan ko: “Nikaay!” Fiye nkúfulalii ti pákayiin paka pákasupak paka, nkinakalo ti pícalukun pa. Tokotoko, koolee ya púlooŋ néeliiŋoonii mpacas patiila cítintiŋ ca, neenow ti han ha, néeseem.<verse eid="MAT 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33" />Pákayiin paka keeyeniye ka efaas koolee pícalukun pa, nkatey, nkakaay ti saatee ya nkakaman eehuu púlooŋ niŋ heetaakiye ha lompo payenka kísaalumant ka nkúwuuliye ka. <verse eid="MAT 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34" />Fiye saatee ya púlooŋ néefulii epicaapaakoolan Yéesu. Ta nkacukoo ta, nkaŋiiniyoo apikatan mah ma miteyii.<verse eid="MAT 8:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9" />
  <para style="s">Káakuuñan áyiin éehute</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1" />Púful toko, Yéesu náayuuko ti piteen, naafiitan han ha, naakaay ti saatee ya eteyoo. <verse eid="MAT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2" />Tempo, pakakee pákayiin nkácoopii teyoo áyiin éehute, eehintiye ti kahun. Ta Yéesu naacuke ta káyinan ka kiteyii, naasok éehute ya: “Añiinam, mukut! Umuuyen wa utii uponketee!”<verse eid="MAT 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3" />Fiye, pakakee ti <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char> ta nkásiye ta Yéesu naasoke eehuu, nkasokoolo: “Ayíin a aŋe oopa ti kateñal Pútuun pa!”<verse eid="MAT 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4" />Pale Yéesu náameyi eeha nkayeniye ha káamiilool, naasokii: “Weyme uwune innitaak pámiiloolal peenaput empuu ti saan aluu? <verse eid="MAT 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5" />Weyme uhaŋe pásuum hisoku: 'Umuuyen wa utii uponketee,' niŋ ekina tom hisoku 'Lito inkaay?' <verse eid="MAT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6" />Fiye fáyisan aluu nii inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, taakaataak kayine t’etaam kiti kaaponket umuuyen wa.” Fiye naasok éehute ya: “Lito! Coop kahun ka kitii, iyyet t’enuuf.”<verse eid="MAT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7" />Ayíin a naalito, naayet t’enuuf. <verse eid="MAT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8" />Ta kayoŋ ka kenfakat ka nkucuke ta eehuu, nkimeeŋ niŋ ewatate,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: ínnimii</char></note> nkúmul Pútuun pa peewufane pa pakan kayine enkuu.<verse eid="MAT 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaayonkal ka kiti Máciya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9" />Yéesu náaful toko naakaay. Ti pikaayu pa piteyoo, naacuk áyiin aŋa nkasok Máciya, naayeniye ti ésayuma kúncoo ya. Yéesu naasokoo: “Nápaniyam.” Máciya naalito naanapanoo.<verse eid="MAT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10" />Púful toko, Yéesu naakaay hili káciim pati ekumpaan ya eti Máciya. Hícump <char style="w" lemma="Asayoola kúncoo">pisayoola kúncoo</char> niŋ pumuuyena nkákey nkali niŋ Yéesu niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo. <verse eid="MAT 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11" />Ta <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa nkacuke ta eehuu, nkasok pinapana pa pakati Yéesu: “Weyme uwune akalaŋana ataaluu nali niŋ pisayoola kúncoo ya niŋ pumuuyena pa?” <verse eid="MAT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12" />Yéesu ápisi eehuu, naasokii: “Pakan paka tom keeyem ka kásuumaayii kasoolahe ákuuñana, pale kéekuuñe ka. <verse eid="MAT 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13" />Canikalaŋ <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>, hisok: <char style="qt">'Paket hikaw inci íllafiye pale neetaat uwaaseen.'</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hoseya 6:6</ref></char></note> Kaatuko inci kéyyoot kaayonkal <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">keecoonoole</char> ka, pale pumuuyena pa.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kacakan ka kiti suŋ ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14" />Púful toko, <char style="w">Saŋ</char>-Patis pinapana pa pakateyoo nkákey ti Yéesu nkacakanoo: “Unii niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa nuuloomloom suŋ. Weyme uwune pinapana pa pakatii kasuŋantoo?” <verse eid="MAT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Fo pakan kéeyonkaliyee pahaaño piti esa éfikayini esampoolo loho asaya ya oopa neyii? Caanak unca ti ékey ta asaya ya áfaafulanee teyii, tempo efikasuŋ.<verse eid="MAT 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16" />“An apapantoo cifaal céeyeeni ti hísool heemaamane, kaatuko niŋ hísool ha hiñowee, cifaal ca céeyeeni ca eficitosi, incihaŋ toko incihaace hísool ha heemaamane ha.<verse eid="MAT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17" />“Fo lompo incuke, an ánuŋantoo pucoma wiiñ ti upaŋ weemaamane. Niŋ áhinaa fo, upaŋ wa éfuufap, wiiñ ya neeniiso, upaŋ wa núupucaloolo. Pale pucoma wiiñ ti upaŋ wéeyeeni nénuŋee, ancuk wiiñ ya niŋ upaŋ wa étuupuco.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Amáacul eekete niŋ aal éekuuñe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18" />Ta Yéesu naayeniye ta káakup eehuu, akee ti ñíhampaatiin <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa náakey, náakilipo hátikinoo, naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, añiinam ámaacul akete féefiye. Pale kéy aapinaŋ epeesi teyoo, afaayeno kaloŋa.” <verse eid="MAT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19" />Yéesu naalito naakaay neyoo niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo.<verse eid="MAT 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20" />Tempo, akee aal eeyeniye hicuku etaam eefiitantoo fo sitiil ŋaasuwan niŋ súsupak, náakey puson Yéesu, náalik hileelu hísool ha henfakat ha hiteyoo. <verse eid="MAT 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21" />Kaatuko asokoolaa-sokoolo: “Niŋ inci líkaa hísool ha henfakat ha hiteyoo lamma, éfikuuñanee.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22" />Yéesu naayeso, apucukoo naasokoo: “Añiinam, mukut! Káyinan ka kitii kúkuuñanuu.” Tokotoko aal a náakuuñanee.<verse eid="MAT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23" />Fiye Yéesu naakaay, naanako lati ekumpaan ya eti áhampaatiin Asuwif a, naacuk kayoŋ ka ti esampoolo meemak niŋ keeyeniye ka hisapu úmpiis hak kápuco ka. <verse eid="MAT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24" />Naasokii: “Níful le. Amáacul a aketut pale hiŋotu naayaake.” Pale nkayeniyoo caalenken. <verse eid="MAT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25" />Ta kayoŋ ka nkúfulanee ta tíkitaaŋ, Yéesu naanako ti ékaap ya, náasik epees ámaacul a. Amáacul a náalitoonii. <verse eid="MAT 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26" />Eehuu níhisiyo ti mah ma púlooŋ.<verse eid="MAT 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakuuñan ka pákayiin pákasupak kéefuume</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27" />Yéesu náaful toko, naayeno pikaayu, úfuumafuum úsupak nkayeniyoo kanapan, nkaceek kapusok: “Añii ya ati <char style="w">Dawid</char>, taak paket hikaw toonii!”<verse eid="MAT 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28" />Ta Yéesu naanakiye ta páhantuwa, kéefuume ka nkákey teyoo. Naacakanii: “Fo níyinanaayinan nii inci yíniyini íhinu eehuu?” Nkañahanoo: “Ee, Ahámpaatiin.”<verse eid="MAT 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29" />Fiye náalik ñíkinii naasokii: “Hitaako samat nii fa ínniyinane fa.” <verse eid="MAT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30" />Ñíkinii íññipankino. Yéesu náakupananii meemak ti hisoku: “Nitah kunuu, timpi nisok ho an.” <verse eid="MAT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31" />Pale poko nkakaay, nkayeno káakup kiti Yéesu ti mah emmuu púlooŋ.<verse eid="MAT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32" />Emma nkakaaye ma, pakakee nkácoopii ti Yéesu áyiin eeyinaat káakup kamma <char style="w">hísaalumant</char> níhiwuuliyoo. <verse eid="MAT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33" />Fiye Yéesu naayaan hísaalumant ha, áyiin a náayaañ káakup. Kayoŋ ka kenfakat ka ínnim ko, nkusok: “Waah weecuke fiye utaapala ucukee ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Israyel</char>.” <verse eid="MAT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34" />Pale <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa nkasok: “Ti caacaw ca citi áhampaatiin a ati kísaalumant ka innayaan kísaalumant ka.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaamaañ keefome pale pumaaña keemeeŋut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35" />Púful toko, Yéesu naakaawool ti pisaatee pa niŋ misaatee ma púlooŋ, naayeno kakalaŋan ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">púluumuma</char> pa piti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa, náatuunan ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>, náakuuñan káakuuñu óo káakuuñu niŋ kéehute ka púlooŋ. <verse eid="MAT 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36" />Ti oom kaakaawool, Yéesu naacuk uyoŋ wa, naataak paket hikaw tewwo kamma nkaliiñooliye kayinaat kayankanan faŋii, samat nii písaacii peetaakut afaasa.<verse eid="MAT 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37" />Fiye, naasok pinapana pa pakateyoo: “Kaamaañ ka kufomaafom pale pumaaña pa kameeŋut. <verse eid="MAT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38" />Ooto niluum <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> ati kaamaañ ka apupoñ pumaaña kapikaay kaamaañ ka kiteyoo.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10" />
  <para style="s">Kúmpoña ka kiti pupoñapoñ pa ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1" />Púful toko, Yéesu naayonkal <char style="w" lemma="Apoñapoñ">pupoñapoñ</char> pa pakateyoo ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka, naawufanii kayine kiti hiyaanu <char style="w" lemma="Hísaalumant">kísaalumant</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: kísaalumant keekuulut</char></note> niŋ kiti káakuuñan káakuuñu óo káakuuñu niŋ kéehute ka púlooŋ. <verse eid="MAT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2" />Ehe ucaw wa uti pupoñapoñ pa ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka: Ayáañ a ayem Simon, aŋa nkasok a lompo <char style="w">Piyeer</char>, niŋ atuwoo Andre; <char style="w">Saak</char> añii ya ati Sepete niŋ atuwoo <char style="w">Saŋ</char>; <verse eid="MAT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3" /><char style="w">Filip</char> niŋ Paatolomaay, Tomas niŋ Máciya, <char style="w">asayoola kúncoo</char> ya; Saak ati Alifaay niŋ Tate. <verse eid="MAT 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4" />Simon aŋa nkasok a Selot<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: ati Kanaan. Ti caanak ca citi Yéesu, Selot eyem kayoŋ ka keeyeniye ka esuum kiti mah ma miteyii. </char></note> niŋ Judas Iskaliyot éefule ya ti Yéesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5" />Pupoñapoñ pa ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka payenke Yéesu naapoñe, naasokii káhin eehe: “Timpi nikaay ti pisaatee pa piti <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char>, timpi ninako lompo ti pisaatee pa piti <char style="w">Samali</char>. <verse eid="MAT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6" />Pale nikaay ti pakati <char style="w">Israyel</char> keecuke ka nii písaacii péecime. <verse eid="MAT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7" />Innikaayaa teyii, nítuunanii nii: <char style="w">Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> cílohiyooloh. <verse eid="MAT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8" />Níkuuñan kéekuuñe ka, innilitan keekete ka, innikuulan keetaake ka <char style="w">kanuk</char>, inniyaan kísaalumant ka. Nisayaasa haahaw; niwufan lompo haahaw.<verse eid="MAT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9" />“Timpi nicoop sanoo, kótifoloo tom, niŋ ekina tom mañ ti pícipa pa piti aluu. <verse eid="MAT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10" />Timpi nicoop lompo epootak eti kaakaawool, hísool hísupiyenu tom, pisamata tom, hikasap tom, kaatuko áhina añaŋaa hitaaku paliyaloo.<verse eid="MAT 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11" />“Niŋ ninakiyaa ti saatee niŋ ekina tom cisaatee, niŋesatool aŋa afaawanan aluu, inniyeno lateyoo fo ta éfiniful ti oom saatee. <verse eid="MAT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12" />Niŋ ninakiyaa oom ekumpaan, innisok: 'Kásuumaay kiyeno ti ekumpaan eyye.' <verse eid="MAT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13" />Niŋ pakati ekumpaan ya kawananaa aluu, kaluum ka kiti aluu kiti kásuumaay ka efikisayanee; niŋ kawananut aluu, kásuumaay ka éfikuñohoonii ti aluu. <verse eid="MAT 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14" />Niŋ an awananut aluu niŋ fotom ásiitanut kilim ka kitaaluu, nihank haafol ha ti woot aluu nípiyisanii nii Pútuun pa efipisapii, ínniful ti ekumpaan ya niŋ fotom saatee ya. <verse eid="MAT 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15" />Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, hinak eeha Pútuun pa mpikaakaay íhinu kíiti ya, kúnuul ka kiti pakati saatee eyyuu efikihaŋ kiti pakati saatee ya eti Sotom niŋ eti Komola.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pakan paka pakati Sotom niŋ pakati Komola kakancaakanc hínum meemak, ekina ewune Pútuun pa mpúpucalool pisaatee pa piteyii (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 18:17-19:27">Púcook 18:17–19:27</ref></char>) </char></note><verse eid="MAT 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16" />“Nísiitan! Inci pupoñ aluu samat nii písaacii ti pututa piyen elampa. Ooto nicohato samat nii pupululoola, niyeno pakati kásuumaay samat nii kúcuucuuku. <verse eid="MAT 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17" />Níwasum! Kaatuko efikawufan aluu éhinuma kíiti ya, nkasap aluu niŋ kisawut ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">púluumuma</char> pa piteyii. <verse eid="MAT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18" />Efikacoop aluu lompo hátikin pakati kikaw ka niŋ pumansa pa kamma inci, ancuk kati nitaak káasiiŋuma kiti kakaman inci yem ayme hátikinii niŋ hátikin keeneetaat ka Pusuwif. <verse eid="MAT 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19" />Niŋ kacokaa aluu, timpi niwasoolo kúnuul fa innikaakaay káakup niŋ fotom eeha innikaakaay hisoku, kaatuko ti oom caanak efiniwufanee eeha efinisok. <verse eid="MAT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20" />Kaatuko aluu tom nikaakaay káakup pale Kunuu ka kiti Paapaa ati aluu éfikukupii pínapii ti aluu.<verse eid="MAT 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21" />“Púnu áfaaful ti atuwoo, niŋ fotom atu náaful ti púnuwoo kati amukee, paapaa náaful ti añiinoo; epuuk efikayeso ti pupukayii kati kamukee. <verse eid="MAT 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22" />Pakan paka púlooŋ efikanat aluu kamma inci, pale aŋa afaamukut a fo ti pikelan, afaafakanee. <verse eid="MAT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23" />Niŋ kakallanaa aluu ti saatee, nitey ti ekee saatee. Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, etinipa kaafiitanool pisaatee pa piti Israyel le niŋ inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, fákey.<verse eid="MAT 10:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24" />“Akalaŋa ahaŋut akalaŋana ya ateyoo, amiikan ahaŋut áhampaatiin a ateyoo. <verse eid="MAT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25" />Tempaatempo akalaŋa apucuk nii akalaŋana ya ateyoo, amiikan naacuk nii áhampaatiin a ateyoo. Niŋ kayonkalaa inci, ati hikaw ha ati ekumpaan ya Pelesepul,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pelesepul énaati eti pukumpaan pa piti pakati Kanaan. Pale le ekina eyem <char style="w">Seetaani</char> ya.</char></note> puume nkakaakaay kaayonkal keekine ka ti ekumpaan ya!<verse eid="MAT 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26" />“Ooto timpi nifeyii, kaatuko waah óo waah wéewufaloolee éfuuwufinee, waah óo waah weeyolee éfuumeyyee. <verse eid="MAT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27" />Eeha inci insok ha aluu ti énimaan, nisok ho ti hanakan palaw; weepuusanoolee ti kaanuu aluu, nítuunan ho ti kíliŋ ka. <verse eid="MAT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28" />Timpi nife payenka nkamuk ka enii ya apan kayinaat himuku yaan ya. Pale, nife aŋa eeyina ya hípucu yaan ya niŋ enii ya ti seemak.<verse eid="MAT 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29" />“Fo kanoomanantoo múculuculu músupak kaahit koonool? Pale háati coonool cinowantoo ti etaam Paapaa taaluu peecoonut. <verse eid="MAT 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30" />Pale aluu, háati wan wa weeyem wa ti hikaw aluu púlooŋ ufineefin. <verse eid="MAT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31" />Ooto timpi nife, nihaŋaahaŋ nafaa meemak múculuculu meemeeŋe.<verse eid="MAT 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32" />“An óo an eesayanaam hátikin pakan paka, inci lompo fasayanoo hátikin Paapaa atoom eeyem a alacana. <verse eid="MAT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33" />Pale an óo an eepookaam hátikin pakan paka, inci lompo fapookoo hátikin Paapaa atoom eeyem a alacana.<verse eid="MAT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34" />“Timpi nímiilool nii inci kéyyookey écoopii kásuumaay t’etaam ya. Inci kéyyoot écoopii kásuumaay pale káakuntu. <verse eid="MAT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35" />Kaatuko inci kéyyookey káakatinool</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 10:35">
    <char style="qt">áyiin niŋ faafoo,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 10:35">
    <char style="qt">aal niŋ íññaa ateyoo,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 10:35">
    <char style="qt">aal niŋ aasonoo aal.</char>
    <verse eid="MAT 10:35" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36" />
    <char style="qt">An akamooloo afaakin ti ekumpaan ya eteyoo.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:36 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mika 7:6</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="MAT 10:36" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37" />“An óo an éelafiye faafoo niŋ fotom íññaa ateyoo pihaŋ inci, oom an átuuniit piyeno anapanayam, an óo an éelafiye añiinoo akampaani niŋ fotom añiinoo ámaacul pihaŋ inci, oom an átuuniit piyeno anapanayam. <verse eid="MAT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38" />Aŋa eecoonutam kanapan fo álafi eket ti <char style="w">kuluwaa</char>,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:38 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: Aŋa eecooput kuluwaa ya eteyoo naanapanam</char></note> oom an átuuniit piyeno anapanayam. <verse eid="MAT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39" />An óo an eefakane eloŋ ya eteyoo áfaapuul teyyo, an óo an éepuule eloŋ ya eteyoo kamma inci, afaafakan yo.<verse eid="MAT 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40" />“An óo an eewanane aluu, inci naawanane, an óo an eewananaam, aŋa éepoñiyaam ya naawanane. <verse eid="MAT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41" />An óo an eewanane <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> kamma naayem ayaamakoola, oom an afaapuuñanoolee samat nii ayaamakoola. An óo an eewanane an <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">eecoonoole</char> kamma naayem eecoonoole, oom an afaapuuñanoolee samat nii an eecoonoole. <verse eid="MAT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42" />An óo an eewune háati elontoŋ eti man meemone akee ti kéetinee ka ti pinapana pa pakatoom kamma naayem anapanayam, inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, oom an afaataak kaapuuñanool ka kiteyoo.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11" />
  <para style="s">Pinapana pakati Saŋ-Patis pati Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1" />Púful toko, Yéesu naapa kawun kunuu pinapana pa pakateyoo ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka. Fiye, naakaay kakalaŋan niŋ káatuunan ti pisaatee pa piteyii.<verse eid="MAT 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2" />Inhemool <char style="w">Saŋ</char>-Patis naayeno ti ékuluma, náasi eeha <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa naayem ha ti íhinu, fiye naapoñ pinapana pa pakateyoo <verse eid="MAT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3" />kapica kacakanoo: “Fo awe yem Aŋa eeyem ya ti ékey? Niŋ ekina tom, fo uñaŋaa hítuulu akee?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Niñoho nica nikaman Saŋ eeha ínnisiye ha niŋ eeha innicuke ha: <verse eid="MAT 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5" />kéefuume ka unka ti hicuku, payenka nkanow ka niŋ efank unka ti pikaayu, pakati <char style="w">kanuk</char> ka nkakuulanee, keecotiye ka unka ti hísiyu, keekete ka nkálitaniyee, ekooŋan ya éesuume ya néetuunanee keeleke ka. <verse eid="MAT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6" />Ayihaayih, aŋa eepookut a hitaaku káyinan kamma inci.”<verse eid="MAT 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7" />Ta pinapana pa pakati Saŋ-Patis nkakaaye ta, Yéesu náayaañ káakup ti kayoŋ ka kiti Saŋ, naasokii: “Weyme innikaaye pati <char style="w">káahaaŋ ka tes</char> kaasincan? Fo haasuwa eeha eyam ya nesapalool? <verse eid="MAT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8" />Niŋ fotom, weyme innikaaye po hicuku? Ayíin eewasiye wañ weewalla? Haani! Payenka nkawaso ka wañ weewalla, unka ti pukumpaan pa piti pumansa pa. <verse eid="MAT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9" />Ooto weyme innikaaye po hicuku? <char style="w">Ayaamakoola</char>? Ee ayaamakoola! Inci pusok aluu nii ahaŋaahaŋ ayaamakoola. <verse eid="MAT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10" />Saŋ akina ayem aŋa <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> nihikiice ya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:10">
    <char style="qt">'Inci fápoñii ati ekooŋan ya atoom apunowi hátikin,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:10">
    <char style="qt">kati awañali pítin pa.'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Malaki 3:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="MAT 11:10" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11" />“Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, taakut an aŋa aal naapuke eehaŋe Saŋ-Patis; pale aŋa éetinee ya ti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> ahaŋoohaŋ. <verse eid="MAT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12" />Písik ti caanak ca citi Saŋ-Patis fo fíyooy, cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa inciyeniyee kátaakoolan,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa inciyeno pikaayu hátikin niŋ sempe</char></note> apan pakan keehiñe nkálafi co hicoopu ti sempe. <verse eid="MAT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13" />Kaatuko piyaamakoola pa púlooŋ niŋ lompo <char style="w">Móyiis</char> ti <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char>, kayaamakoolaa-yaamakool heekaakaay ha pitaako fo ti caanak ca citi Saŋ. <verse eid="MAT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14" />Niŋ nicoonaa ho kasayan, akina ayem ayaamakoola ya <char style="w" lemma="Elí ayaamakoola ya">Elí</char> eeñaŋe ya ékey. <verse eid="MAT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15" />An óo an eetaake kaanuu, ásiitan.<verse eid="MAT 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16" />“Niŋ weyme inci iyyina kaakufumool <char style="w">ekaay</char> ya eti fíyooy? Enakoolaa-nakool nii epuuk keeyeniye ti híliŋ nkayeno kaaceeceekool:<verse eid="MAT 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17" />'Uhapaahap<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yéesu asok: usapaasap aluu kámpiis</char></note> aluu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">nikiiyut,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 11:17">nuucook aluu kícimu kiti keeŋoot,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 11:17">nisampooliit.'<verse eid="MAT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18" />“Kaatuko Saŋ ákeyyookey aliyantoo, alaanantoo, nkasok: '<char style="w">Hísaalumant</char> hiyem neyoo.' <verse eid="MAT 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19" />Inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, ínkey pilli, illaan nkasok: 'Nisincan! Aŋuu an eekase, núkumana, áwii ati <char style="w" lemma="Asayoola kúncoo">pisayoola kúncoo</char> niŋ pumuuyena.' Pale ecohato ya eti Pútuun pa, éyisaneeyisan ti páhinal eteyyo nii tooñaa.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pisaatee péeyinanut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20" />Ti pisaatee pa, pa Yéesu náahine pa hícump weecukantee, pakan paka káwunkiit umuuyen wa uteyii. Púful toko, Yéesu náayaañ kawatan oom pisaatee. Naasok: <verse eid="MAT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21" />“Kúnuul efikiyeno ti aluu pakati saatee ya eti Kolasin, kúnuul efikiyeno ti aluu pakati saatee ya eti Petesayit. Kaatuko waah weecukantee Pútuun pa mpíhine ti pisaatee pa piti aluu. Niŋ eehuu hitaakiye ti pisaatee pa piti Til niŋ Siton,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pisaatee pa piti Kolasin niŋ Petesayit <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char>, pale Til niŋ Siton kaneetaat Pusuwif. Nisincan kahooŋu mah.</char></note> anti kafiyo nkáwunkiye umuuyen wa uteyii, nkayeno niŋ kúsool kiti pupootak niŋ emaamoolo píiha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ti káyisan ewatanoolo enfakat eti umuuyen wa uteyii, pakan paka nkawaso wañ weesañate uti pahan pifil, niŋ emaamoolo píiha. (Jonas 3:5-9)</char></note> kápiyisan ewatanoolo ya eteyii. <verse eid="MAT 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22" />Pale inci pusok aluu, hinak eeha Pútuun pa mpikaakaay íhinu kíiti ya, kúnuul ka kiti aluu efikihaŋ kiti pakati Til niŋ Siton.<verse eid="MAT 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23" />“Aluu pakati saatee ya eti <char style="w">Kafaanawum</char>, fo éfiniseepinee alacana? Haani, efiniwananee pati keekete ka. Kaatuko niŋ weecukantee wa wéehinee wa lati aluu úhineehin hínum ti saatee ya eti Sotom,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pakan paka pakati Sotom kakancaakanc hínum meemak, ekina ewune Pútuun pa mpúpucalool saatee ya eteyii (<char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 18:17-19:27">Púcook 18:17–19:27</ref></char>) </char></note> anti eloŋ toko fo fíyooy. <verse eid="MAT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24" />Pale inci pusok aluu, hinak eeha Pútuun pa mpikaakaay íhinu kíiti ya, kúnuul ka kiti aluu efikihaŋ kiti pakati Sotom.”<verse eid="MAT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eyékunoolo ti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25" />Ti oom caanak, Yéesu naasok: “Inci múluu Paapaa, <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> ati patiila niŋ t’etaam, kamma ayyole eehe keecohatiye ka niŋ kéesuume ka kunuu, pale íyyisan ho keewananooliye ka nii epuuk kenkilis. <verse eid="MAT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26" />Ee Paapaa, kaatuko fiye állafiye hipitaako ti pásuum pa pitii.<verse eid="MAT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27" />“Paapaa atoom awufanaamufan waah wa púlooŋ. An ámiit Añii ya fo Paapaa ya, an lompo ámiit Paapaa ya fo Añii ya niŋ payenka Añii ya náalafiye ka káyisanoo.<verse eid="MAT 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28" />“Aluu púlooŋ keeyoke ka innitiyo pínapi, níkey ti inci, inci fawufan aluu éyekunoolo. <verse eid="MAT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29" />Nitiyo pitiyo pa piti pakalaŋanal pa putoom, innikalaŋ ti inci, kaatuko inci eewananooliye yaanam néeneeni, innitaak éyekunoolo. <verse eid="MAT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30" />Kaatuko waah ewwa inci inkalaŋanale wa aluu úciitaat hítuulu, pitiyo pa putoom mpúwiini.”<verse eid="MAT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12" />
  <para style="s">Yéesu Ateeteyo ati hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1" />Hikee hinoom hiti kayeno kiti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa, Yéesu naayeno kaafiitanool ukit weesukee tewwo waah weenakoole nii uli. Peep mpucok pinapana pa pakateyoo nkayeno kaasuutal ulat wa kapili. <verse eid="MAT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2" />Ta pakakee ti <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa nkacuke ta eehuu, nkasok Yéesu: “Sincan! Pinapana pa pakatii unka ti íhinu héehinantee ha ti <char style="w">hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</char>.”<verse eid="MAT 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3" />Fiye, Yéesu naañahanii: “Fo nikalaŋut eeha <char style="w">Dawid</char>, amansa ya, náahine ha akina niŋ pákawiyoo ta peep pa mpucokii ta? <verse eid="MAT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4" />Anakaanako ti <char style="w" lemma="Ekúut ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa">ékuut ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char> náacoopii kúmpuul ka keesampanee ka. Akina niŋ pákawiyoo nkali ko, ántuŋ kúmpuul enkuu <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> lamayii kóŋ kañaŋe ko hili. <verse eid="MAT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5" />Niŋ ekina tom, fo nikalaŋut ti <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char> nii, ti hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka puwaaseena pa keeyem ka ti páhin ti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa, nkalecatan-lecatan hinoom ha apan kamuuyenut? <verse eid="MAT 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6" />Inci pusok aluu nii, waah weehaŋe ekumpaan ya enfakat ya uwwa le. <verse eid="MAT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7" /><char style="w">Hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> hisok: <char style="qt">'Paket hikaw inci íllafiye pale neetaat uwaaseen.'</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Hoseya 6:6</ref></char></note> Niŋ nímeyiyaa eehuu eeha nihisoke, anti níhinaati kíiti keemuuyenut ka. <verse eid="MAT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8" />Kaatuko inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, yem <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> ati hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakuuñan ti hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9" />Yéesu ápuful toko, naakaay naanako ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">éluumuma</char> ya eti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa. <verse eid="MAT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10" />Intaako toko áyiin ati epees éehute. Intaako toko lompo pakakee pakan kéelafiye hinooku Yéesu. Ekina ewune nkacakanoo: “Fo cooneecoon káakuuñan ti <char style="w">hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</char>?” <verse eid="MAT 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11" />Naañahanii: “Niŋ akee ti aluu ataakaa sáacii eenowe ti kaayeen ti hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka, fo átacaafulanii yo? <verse eid="MAT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12" />Ñiyema puume an naahaŋe hitaaku nafaa sáacii! Ooto cooneecoon íhinu heenape ti hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka.”<verse eid="MAT 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13" />Fiye naasok áyiin a: “Pántin epeesi.” Ayíin a náapantin yo, neeñoho toko pitempo tak samat nii ekee ya. <verse eid="MAT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14" />Pale <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa keeyeniye ka toko nkáful, nkayeno piteŋenool fa efikamuk Yéesu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu, amiikan a aŋa Pútuun pa mpimamale ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15" />Yéesu náameyi nii <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa kálafiyoolafi himuku, ekina ewune náaful toko. Kayoŋ kenfakat nkinapanoo, náakuuñan kéekuuñe ka púlooŋ. <verse eid="MAT 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16" />Naakitii káakup kiteyoo ti pakakee paka.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: Naakitii hisoku pakakee paka akina ayem ayme</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17" />Fiyuu intaakiye ancuk eeha <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya <char style="w">Esayi</char> naasoke ha hitaakiyaa, asok:<verse eid="MAT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18" />
    <char style="qt">“Ehe amiikan a atoom aŋa inci immamale ya,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">
    <char style="qt">aŋa inci íllafiye ya, teyoo inci intaake pásuumayam.</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 12:18">
    <char style="qt">Inci fawas Kunuu ka kutoom teyoo,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:18">
    <char style="qt">náatuunan písii pa púlooŋ kiti kíiti ya etoom <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">eecoonoole</char> ya.</char>
    <verse eid="MAT 12:18" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19" />
    <char style="qt">Atáñakalool niŋ pakan paka niŋ fotom hiceeku;</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:19">
    <char style="qt">an átasi hilimoo ti kíliŋ ka.</char>
    <verse eid="MAT 12:19" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20" />
    <char style="qt">Atafiit kampiip kéeŋantii keeŋonciye;</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">
    <char style="qt">atahok lompo lampi éetaahe.</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 12:20">
    <char style="qt">Atáyekuno íhinu eehuu púlooŋ fo ta áfaahin ta pucoonool pa pipiheek.</char>
    <verse eid="MAT 12:20" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21" />
    <char style="qt">Ti caacawoo písii pa púlooŋ éfipihin cíki.”</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 42:1-4">Esayi 42:1-4</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="MAT 12:21" />
  </para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu niŋ Pelesepul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22" />Púful toko, nkácoopii ti Yéesu áyiin éefuume ayinaat lompo káakup kamma <char style="w">hísaalumant</char> níhiwuuliyoo. Yéesu náakuuñanoo, áyiin a náayaañ káakup naalompo acuk. <verse eid="MAT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23" />Kayoŋ ka kenfakat ka púlooŋ ínnim ko, nkusok: “Fo aŋe Añii ya ati <char style="w">Dawid</char> tom?” <verse eid="MAT 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24" />Pale ta <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa nkásiye ta eehuu, nkasok: “Ayíin a aŋe ti caacaw Pelesepul, áhampaatiin a ati kísaalumant ka innayaan kísaalumant ka.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25" />Pale, Yéesu náameyi pámiiloolalii, naasokii: “Cáwii óo cáwii céetaakoolanooliye eficinow, saatee óo saatee niŋ fotom ekumpaan éetaakoolanooliye etesiiŋo. <verse eid="MAT 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26" />Fiye niŋ <char style="w">Seetaani</char> ya eyaanaa Seetaani ya, ooto kátaakoolan faŋ eteyyo neeyaake, puume cáwii eteyyo éficiyini pisiiŋo? <verse eid="MAT 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27" />Fiye, niŋ ti caacaw Pelesepul inci niyyaan kísaalumant ka, pinapana pa pakati aluu ti caacaw pakayme nkayaan ko? Ooto, efikayeno píhina aluu kíiti. <verse eid="MAT 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28" />Pale iyyema ti Kunuu ka kiti Pútuun pa inci niyyaan kísaalumant ka, ooto, <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> cícoliyoocol ti aluu. <verse eid="MAT 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29" />Niŋ fotom, puume an naayina pinako ekumpaan eti áyiin eetaake sempe, náalip waahoo, fo niŋ áyaañaa apicenk oom áyiin ati sempe? Púful toko conko afaakoos ekumpaan ya eteyoo.<verse eid="MAT 12:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30" />“An eeneetaat niŋ inci, apookaampook, an eeyankananutam kaaconcenool, nahancalool-hancalool. <verse eid="MAT 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31" />Ooto inci pusok aluu: Kaamuuyen óo kaamuuyen niŋ kateñal óo kateñal éfikiyiniyee kaaponket, pale eeteñale <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> ataponketee. <verse eid="MAT 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32" />An óo an eesoke heenaput ti inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, áfaayiniyee kaaponket, pale an óo an eesoke heenaput ti Kunuu ka keenape ka ataponketee, neetaat ti eloŋ eyye niŋ fotom eekaakaay ya ékey.<verse eid="MAT 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33" />“Niŋ aasokaa nii enuun ya eenape, sok lompo papukal eteyyo peenape, niŋ fotom, niŋ aasokaa nii enuun ya enaput, sok lompo papukal eteyyo pinaput. Kaatuko ti papukal eteyyo nekiiwee. <verse eid="MAT 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34" />Aluu mifepa emmuu! Puume aluu keenaput ka inniyina hisoku waah weenape? Kaatuko heemeeŋe ha ti yaan an, hikina nákup. <verse eid="MAT 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35" />An eenape, náfulaniifulan ti yaanoo waah weenape. Pale an eenaput, náfulaniifulan ti yaanoo waah weenaput. <verse eid="MAT 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36" />Inci pusok aluu, ti hinoom ha hiti kíiti ya, pakan paka efikakaman heewune ha nkasok kilim ka púlooŋ keetaakut ka nafaa. <verse eid="MAT 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37" />Kaatuko ti kilim ka kitii áafahinee kíiti nii eemuuyenut niŋ fotom eemuuyene.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Píyisan pa piti ayaamakoola ya Jonas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38" />Púful toko, pakakee <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char>, nkasok Yéesu: “Ahámpaatiin, úlafilafi áapiyisan unii píyisan péeyisane nii Pútuun pa púpoñiyuu.” <verse eid="MAT 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39" />Naañahanii: “Aluu <char style="w">ekaay</char> eenaput apan innipook hicoku ti Pútuun pa. Fo hiŋes píyisan péeyisane nii Pútuun pa púpoñiyaam inniyaake? Háati poonool étiniyisanee, fo ínfulaa píyisan pa piti <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya Jonas.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:39 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta infiyye yoon enfakat neemelan Jonas ayaamakoola ya ati Pútuun pa. Pumuus kunoom káhaaciil yoon ya néenuusiyoo ti kantant ka kaloŋayoo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JON 1:17">Jonas 1:17</ref></char>).</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40" />Kaatuko samat nii Jonas fa naayeniye fa ti munow yoon ya enfakat ya hanakan hánant fo kunoom kíhaaciil, fo lompo inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, fayeno hanakan hánant páhantuwa etaam ya fo kunoom kíhaaciil. <verse eid="MAT 12:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41" />Ta infiyye, Jonas náatuunan <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> pakati Ninew, nkáwunko umuuyen wa uteyii. Fiye, heeyem ha le hihaŋaahaŋ Jonas. Ekina ewune, ti hinoom ha hiti kíiti ya, pakati Ninew efikasiiŋo hátikin ekaay eyye nkáhin yo kíiti. <verse eid="MAT 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42" />Fo lompo incuke, amansa ya aal a ati Sepa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amansa ya aal a ati Sepa, akina ayem amansa aal éefulii ti mah meeyem pa caanak ca íncifulii pa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 10:1-13">1 Pumansa 10:1-13</ref></char>)</char></note> náafulii ti mah méelaaŋee láaŋ ápikey peti amansa ya <char style="w">Solomon</char> káasiitan ecohato ya eteyoo. Fiye, heeyem ha le hihaŋaahaŋ amansa ya Solomon. Ekina ewune, ti hinoom ha hiti kíiti ya, amansa ya aal a ati Sepa afaasiiŋo hátikin ekaay eyye náahin yo kíiti.<verse eid="MAT 12:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43" />“Niŋ <char style="w">hísaalumant</char> hífulaa ti an, nihimuusool-muusool ti <char style="w">káahaaŋ ka tes</char> ti hiŋes éyekunooluma. Niŋ hílaŋaniyoot, <verse eid="MAT 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44" />nihisokoolo: 'Túulam, inci puñoho pati aŋa inci ínfulii ya.' Ti éñohoonii eteeho, nihitook ékinuma ya ñaanii, neeneeŋee, neememanoolee pitempo tak. <verse eid="MAT 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45" />Fiye, nihikaay, níhicoopii kikee kísaalumant isak niŋ kúsupak keehaŋe ho pakanc, nkinako nkikin toko. Kúnuul ka kikelan ka kiti an a aŋuu nkihaŋ páciite kíyaañ ka. Fo lompo facuk ti ekaay ya eenaput eyye.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu niŋ miin ma miteyoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46" />Yéesu ti káakup niŋ kayoŋ ka kenfakat ka, íññaa ateyoo niŋ pakatuwoo nkácolii, nkasiiŋo tíkitaaŋ kápilafi káakup neyoo. <verse eid="MAT 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47" />Akee ti kayoŋ ka naasok Yéesu: “Ehe íññaa atii niŋ pakatuwi nkasiiŋiye tíkitaaŋ, kápilafi káakup naawe.”<verse eid="MAT 12:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Ayme ayem íññaa atoom? Pakayme kayem pakatuwam?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49" />Naaluuñan pinapana pa pakateyoo, naasok: “Payenke kayem íññaa atoom niŋ pakatuwam. <verse eid="MAT 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50" />An óo an aŋa náhin eeha Paapaa atoom eeyem a alacana náalafiye ha, oom an ayem atuwam, ahoopam niŋ íññaa atoom.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13" />
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu hiti kiti ataha piyooseen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1" />Ti oom hinoom, Yéesu náaful ti ekumpaan ya naakaay ti kantant ka kiti han ha hiti <char style="w">Galilee</char>, naayeno. <verse eid="MAT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2" />Kayoŋ kenfakat nkuconcoolo teyoo neewun náayuuko ti piteen naayeno, pakan paka púlooŋ nkasiiŋo ti kantant ka. <verse eid="MAT 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3" />Fiye Yéesu naasokii hícump waah niŋ kícantiitu, naasok: “Nísiitan! Taakaataak akee áyiin aŋa eekaaye etah piyooseen. <verse eid="MAT 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4" />Akina ti kaawiisan etukal ya, ekee etukal ya neenowal ti pítin pa; pusuwa pa mpíkey mpili yo. <verse eid="MAT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5" />Ekee ya neenowal ti etaam eti pínankiin la taakut hícump esiya. Néeŋantii mpacas kamma esiya ya neetosa. <verse eid="MAT 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6" />Pale ta pisiya pa mpúlumii ta, paŋantal pa mpusuucan kamma mpitaakut ñínkonk ñéesuna. <verse eid="MAT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7" />Ekee etukal ya neenowal ti pícankun, néeŋantii pícankun pa mpikincool yo. <verse eid="MAT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8" />Pale ekee etukal ya neenowal ti etaam eenape, eyyuu néeŋantii neepuk ulant: ukee ulant wa núupukii keme (100), ukee wa áwii éhaaciil (60) niŋ ukee wa áwii niŋ ŋaasuwan (30). <verse eid="MAT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9" />An óo an eetaake kaanuu, ásiitan.”<verse eid="MAT 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Heewune ha Yéesu nákup niŋ kícantiitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10" />Fiye, Yéesu pinapana pa pakateyoo nkalohoo, nkacakanoo: “Weyme uwune ánninkup pakan paka niŋ kícantiitu?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11" />Naañahanii: “Aluu niwufaneewufan kameye ka kiti heeyolee ha ti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>, pale poko kawufanutee ho. <verse eid="MAT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12" />Kaatuko an óo an eetaake afaapenanee, naataak fo muus. Pale, an óo an eetaakut, háati caahinkilis ya eyya naataake ya efeesayee teyoo. <verse eid="MAT 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13" />Ekina ewune inci ínkup neyii niŋ kícantiitu, kaatuko</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:13">nkasincan-sincan pale kacukantoo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:13">Nkásiitan, pale kásiyantoo niŋ fotom kámeyiyantoo.<verse eid="MAT 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14" />“Fiyuu intaakiye samat nii <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya <char style="w">Esayi</char> fa naasoke fa, asok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">
    <char style="qt">'Efínisiitan pitempo tak, pale étinisi;</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:14">
    <char style="qt">efinisincan pitempo tak, pale etinicuk.</char>
    <verse eid="MAT 13:14" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15" />
    <char style="qt">Kaatuko pakan paka payenke kapankaapank kunuuwii,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="qt">nkacot unuuwii,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="qt">nkámif ñíkinii.</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="qt">Káhinaahin eehuu ancuk timpi kacuk niŋ ñíkinii,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="qt">timpi kási niŋ unuuwii,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="qt">timpi kámeyi lompo niŋ kunuuwii,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:15">
    <char style="qt">étikayesoonii lipe ti inci Pútuun pa, inci kati kúuñanii.'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:15 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Esayi 6:9-10</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="MAT 13:15" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16" />“Pale aluu, niyihaayih kaatuko ñíkin aluu iññicukcuk, unuu aluu núusi. <verse eid="MAT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17" />Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, hícump piyaamakoola niŋ hícump pakan <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">keecoonoole</char> kálafilafi hínum hicuku eeha innicuke ha pale kacukut ho, nkálafi hísiyu eeha ínnisiye ha pale kásiit ho.”<verse eid="MAT 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káacenkin ka kiti hícantiitu ha hiti ataha piyooseen pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18" />Yéesu nene asok: “Nísiitan eeha hícantiitu ha hiti ataha piyooseen pa nihisoke ha: <verse eid="MAT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19" />Samat nii etukal ya eenowale ya ti pítin pa fa néefulanee fa, fo lompo incuke ti payenka nkási ka ekooŋan ya eti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>, apan ecaaŋutii, <char style="w">Seetaani</char> ya néekey, néelamut heesukee ha ti saanii. <verse eid="MAT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20" />Samat nii etukal ya eenowale ya ti etaam ya eti pínankiin pa, fo lompo incuke ti payenka nkási ka ekooŋan ya, ince kahaaŋ nkasayane yo niŋ pásuuma. <verse eid="MAT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21" />Pale páawoo kataakut ñínkonk, kafiyyantoo. Niŋ páciite púcoliyoo niŋ fotom nkakallanee kamma ekooŋan ya, ince kahaaŋ puñoho puson ti káyinan ka kiteyii. <verse eid="MAT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22" />Samat nii etukal ya eenowale ya ti pícankun pa, fo lompo incuke ti payenka nkási ka ekooŋan ya, pale ti eloŋ ya eteyii káamiilool ka niŋ kincaakool ka kiti hisaanumate ha nihikincool ekooŋan ya, neewun etepuk. <verse eid="MAT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23" />Pale, samat nii etukal ya eenowale ya ti etaam ya eenape ya, fo lompo incuke ti payenka nkási ka ekooŋan ya nkámeyi yo. Payenkuu nkápukii keme (100), pakakee paka áwii éhaaciil (60) niŋ fotom pakakee paka áwii niŋ ŋaasuwan (30).”<verse eid="MAT 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu hiti uli niŋ haasuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24" />Yéesu naasok kayoŋ ka hikee hícantiitu, naasokii: “<char style="w">Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> cinakoolaa-nakool nii an eesuke etukal eenape ti kaakit ka kiteyoo. <verse eid="MAT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25" />Pale an óo an ti hiŋotu, akamooloo náakey naasuk haasuwa ti uli wa, naakaay. <verse eid="MAT 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26" />Ta uli wa núuŋantii ta núupukii, haasuwa ha lompo níhifulii.<verse eid="MAT 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27" />“Ati kaakit ka, pimiikan pa pakateyoo nkakaay teyoo, nkasokoo: 'Ahámpaatiin, fo etukal eenape tom ansuke ti kaakit ka kitii? Ooto peyme haasuwa ha níhifulii?' <verse eid="MAT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28" />Naañahanii: 'Akamool áhine eehuu.' Pimiikan pa nkasokoo: 'Fo áalafilafi upuca úfosin haasuwa ha?'<verse eid="MAT 13:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29" />“Naañahanii: 'Haani, kaatuko inniyeniyaa káfosin haasuwa ha, níyiniyini káanupinool uli wa neeho. <verse eid="MAT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30" />Nikat ho hípiyankoolii niŋ uli wa fo ti kaamaañ ka. Ti oom waati, inci fasok pumaaña pa: "Níyaañ nínupin haasuwa ha innicenk ho ti kikant kati hisowee; innipayaa inniconcoolan uli wa innicoop wo ti pileefaan pa putoom."'”<verse eid="MAT 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kícantiitu kiti fa cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa eficihancaloolo fa pan óo pan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31" />Yéesu naasok kayoŋ ka hikee hícantiitu, naasokii: “<char style="w">Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> cinakoolaa-nakool nii ekoon sootoo eyya an naacoope naasuk yo ti kaakit ka kiteyoo. <verse eid="MAT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32" />Ekoon sootoo ehaŋa káafomaati ti etukal ya púlooŋ, pale niŋ éŋantiyoo ehaŋa pafom waah óo waah ti kankaŋ ya. Niŋ éyenooniyoo enuun, pusuwa pa mpíkey mpúwuun ti unaay eteyyo.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33" />Yéesu naasokii hikee hícantiitu, naasokii: “Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa cinakoolaa-nakool nii leweñoo eyya aal naacoope naanakanool yo niŋ efol eemeeŋe, fo hímaaf ha púlooŋ híkuntii.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34" />Yéesu náakup enke púlooŋ ti kayoŋ ka kenfakat ka niŋ kícantiitu, asokutii waah weeneetaat niŋ hícantiitu. <verse eid="MAT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35" />Fiyuu intaakiye ancuk eeha <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya naasoke ha hitaakiyaa, asok:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 13:35">
    <char style="qt">“Inci fákup neyii niŋ kícantiitu,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 13:35">
    <char style="qt">inci fakaman heeyolee ha kápiliŋ ta <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> mpiliilee ta.”</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:35 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 78:2">Kícimu 78:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="MAT 13:35" />
  </para>
  <para style="s">Káacenkin ka kiti hícantiitu ha hiti uli wa niŋ haasuwa ha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36" />Púful toko, Yéesu náaful ti kayoŋ ka kenfakat ka naanako ti ekumpaan ya. Pinapana pa pakateyoo nkakaay teyoo, nkasokoo: “Cénkin unii hícantiitu ha hiti haasuwa ha heeyem ha ti kaakit ka.”<verse eid="MAT 13:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37" />Naañahanii: “Aŋa eesuke ya etukal ya eenape ya ayem inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>. <verse eid="MAT 13:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38" />Kaakit ka kiyem <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>; etukal ya eenape ya eyem pakan paka pakati cáwii ca. Haasuwa ha hiyem pakan paka pakati <char style="w">Seetaani</char> ya; <verse eid="MAT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39" />akamool a eesuke ya haasuwa ha ti uli wa ayem Seetaani ya. Waati ya eti kaamaañ ka eyem pikelan caanak ence; pumaaña pa kayem <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">pumaleekoo</char> pa.<verse eid="MAT 13:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40" />“Samat nii fa nkánupine fa haasuwa ha nkasowan ho ti seemak, fo lompo efitaako ti pikelan caanak ence. <verse eid="MAT 13:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41" />Inci, Añii An, fapoñ pumaleekoo pa putoom, éfipunupin ti <char style="w" lemma="Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa">cáwii</char> ca citoom keekaakaay ka púlooŋ kanakan an ti kaamuuyen niŋ payenka nkáhin ka heenaput. <verse eid="MAT 13:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42" />Efipuwantii ti seemak séeceeke meemak, toko efitaak pukooŋ niŋ kaafincool úŋiiŋ. <verse eid="MAT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43" />Tempo, <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">keecoonoole</char> ka efikamiñal samat nii caanak ti cáwii ca citi Paapaa ateyii. An óo an eetaake kaanuu, ásiitan.”<verse eid="MAT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kícantiitu kiti hisaanumate heeyolee niŋ pínankiin péeciita hinoom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44" />Yéesu nene asok pinapana pa pakateyoo: “<char style="w">Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> cinakoolaa-nakool nii hisaanumate heeyolee ti kaakit. Ayíin naalaŋan ho, nene ayol ho, naameeŋ niŋ pásuuma. Naakaay naacaanooman waah óo waah ewwa naataake, naanoom kaakit ka.<verse eid="MAT 13:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45" />“Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa lompo cinakoolaa-nakool samat nii fiye: anoomana eeyem ti hiŋes pínankiin péeciita hinoom, <verse eid="MAT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46" />ta naacuke ta énankiin éeciita hinoom meemak, naakaay naacaanooman waah óo waah ewwa naataake, naanoom yo.”<verse eid="MAT 13:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu hiti cala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47" />Yéesu nene asok pinapana pa pakateyoo: “<char style="w">Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> cinakoolaa-nakool samat nii fiye: cala eewantee ti kaatii, néecokii yoon óo yoon. <verse eid="MAT 13:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48" />Ta neemeeŋe ta, picalafayya pa nkáñakii yo ti kantant ka. Fiye nkayeno kapiyesal soon sa, nkawas seenape sa ti usekeyu, pale nkawant seenaput sa. <verse eid="MAT 13:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49" />Fiyuu efitaako ti pikelan caanak ence. <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">Pumaleekoo</char> pa éfipikey mpíkatinool keenaput ka niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">keecoonoole</char> ka. <verse eid="MAT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50" />Efipuwant keenaput ka ti seemak séeceeke wám, toko efitaak pukooŋ niŋ kaafincool úŋiiŋ.”<verse eid="MAT 13:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51" />Yéesu naacakan pinapana pa pakateyoo: “Fo nísiyaasi eehuu púlooŋ?” Nkañahanoo: “Ee.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52" />Nene asokii: “Ooto akalaŋana óo akalaŋana ati hiti Pútuun pa éeyenoonii anapana ati cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa, anakoolaa-nakool nii ati ekumpaan aŋa náfulanii ti pileefaan pa piteyoo waah wéeyeeni focaa lompo weemaamane.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hipookuyee ha hiti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53" />Ta Yéesu naapaye ta hisoku kícantiitu enkuu, náaful toko apikaay. <verse eid="MAT 13:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54" />Apucol ti saatee ya eteyoo, náayaañ kakalaŋan ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">éluumuma</char> ya eti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa fo ínnimii, nkasok: “Peyme áyiin a aŋe naataake ecohato eyye niŋ sempe siti íhinu weecukantee? <verse eid="MAT 13:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55" />Fo akina tom ayem añii ya ati apempeŋa ya? Fo íññaa ateyoo tom ayem <char style="w">Mari</char>? Fo pakatuwoo tom kayem <char style="w">Saak</char>, Josef, Simon niŋ Judas? <verse eid="MAT 13:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56" />Fo pakahoopoo kaneetaat le niŋ unaa? Ooto peyme áyiin a aŋe naameya eehuu púlooŋ?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57" />Ekina ewune nkapookoo káyinan. Pale Yéesu naasokii: “<char style="w">Ayaamakoola</char>, pan óo pan námakiyanee fo niŋ fúlaa lati saatee ya eteyoo niŋ ti miin ma miteyoo.”<verse eid="MAT 13:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58" />Yéesu áhinut toko hícump weecukantee kamma káayinanaati ka kiteyii.<verse eid="MAT 13:58" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14" />
  <para style="s">Eket ya eti Saŋ-Patis</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1" />Ti oom caanak <char style="w">Helot</char> Antipas, ati hikaw ha ati <char style="w">Galilee</char>, náasi kiti Yéesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2" />Naasok pimiikan pa pakateyoo: “Aŋe <char style="w">Saŋ</char>-Patis, álitaniyee ti keekete ka! Ekina ewune naataak sempe siti íhinu weecukantee.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3" />Helot asokaasok eehuu kaatuko akina apoñe kapucok Saŋ, nkacenkoo nkawantoo ti núkuluma. Ahínaahin eehuu kamma Helotiya, atuwoo Filip aaloo, aŋa naalame ya apisayoo. <verse eid="MAT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4" />Kaatuko Saŋ nasoksok Helot nii <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char> hicoonutoo apisayoo. <verse eid="MAT 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5" />Helot náalafi himuku Saŋ, pale naafe kayoŋ ka kamma nkacoke nii Saŋ <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char>.<verse eid="MAT 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6" />Fiye, Helot, ti hinoom ha hiti pahaaño pa piti hipukuyee ha hiteyoo, ámaacul a ati Helotiya naayeno ekii hátikin kéeyonkaliyee ka hili. Helot ínsuumoo meemak. <verse eid="MAT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7" />Eehuu hiwune, náayinananoo ti esintoolo nii afaawufanoo waah óo waah ewwa naacakane. <verse eid="MAT 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8" />Amáacul a íññaa ateyoo, Helotiya, náatunkoo apusok: “Hikaw Saŋ-Patis inci íllafiye aapuwufanam le ti epulaatu.”<verse eid="MAT 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9" />Amansa ya naameeŋ niŋ páciite, pale kamma eeha náayinananoo ha ti esintoolo hátikin payenka náayonkalii ka hili, fiye naawufan hilim kápihin eeha ámaacul a naacakane ha. <verse eid="MAT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10" />Naapoñ kapifiit hikaw Saŋ ti núkuluma na. <verse eid="MAT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11" />Hikawoo níhicoopiyee ti epulaatu, nkawufan ho ámaacul a, akina lompo naacoop ho pati íññaa ateyoo.<verse eid="MAT 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12" />Pinapana pa pakati Saŋ nkákey kapucoop ehunuŋ ya eteyoo, nkahokoo. Púful toko nkakaay kapusok Yéesu heetaakiye ha.<verse eid="MAT 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakuumanee ka kiti pákayiin síwuli isak (5,000)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13" />Ta Yéesu náasiye ta eket ya eti <char style="w">Saŋ</char>, náayuuko ti piteen apikaay pa kemane lamayoo. Pale kayoŋ ka kenfakat ka ta nkísiye ta eehuu, nkinapanoo niŋ woot kúpufulii ti pisaatee.<verse eid="MAT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14" />Ta Yéesu naaciŋe ta, naacuk kayoŋ kenfakat; naataak paket hikaw teyii, náakuuñan kéekuuñe ka pakateyii.<verse eid="MAT 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15" />Cípiniimo, pinapana pa pakateyoo nkákey teyoo, nkasokoo: “Le láaŋaalaaŋ, apan unca ti hicoku. Katan kayoŋ ka kipikaay ti misaatee ma hinoom faŋii paliyal.” <verse eid="MAT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16" />Pale Yéesu naañahanii: “Túuniit kapikaay, aluu faŋ aluu niwufanii kapili.” <verse eid="MAT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17" />Nkañahanoo: “Kúmpuul isak niŋ soon súsupak lamma nuutaakaa le.” <verse eid="MAT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18" />Naasokii: “Nícoopii ko le.”<verse eid="MAT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19" />Fiye, Yéesu naasok kayoŋ ka kiyeno ti píheeni pa. Naacoop kúmpuul ka isak ya niŋ soon sa súsupak sa, náahaafin patiila, naanimpan Pútuun pa. Naafiit kúmpuul ka, naawufan ko pinapana pa, poko nkápaacinool ko kayoŋ ka kenfakat ka. <verse eid="MAT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20" />Pakan paka púlooŋ nkali fo kasiit tuk. Fiye, pinapana pa nkayesal mífiitiin paliyal pa peetowiye pa fo kameeŋan síyya ŋaasuwan niŋ súsupak. <verse eid="MAT 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21" />Keeliye ka kayema máamun pákayiin síwuli isak (5,000), pakaal paka niŋ epuuk ya kafinutee.<verse eid="MAT 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kasapal ka ñoota kiti Yéesu ti han ha péeseemut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22" />Emma nkapaye ma, Yéesu naasok pinapana pa pakateyoo káyuuko ti piteen pa kapunowoo hátikin ti kikee kaapii ka kiti han ha. Akina naatowo puson ápikatinool niŋ kayoŋ ka. <verse eid="MAT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23" />Ta naapaye ta píkatinool niŋ kayoŋ ka, naasilo lamayoo tíntiŋ ya kaluum. Incicok, naaloŋ po lamayoo kóŋ. <verse eid="MAT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24" />Tempo, piteen pa umpa pílaaŋe kantant ka. Mpiyeno ti kaalic, kúsuu ka nkiyeno po kayokan.<verse eid="MAT 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25" />Cílapum, Yéesu naawawantan pinapana pa pakateyoo apiyeno kasapal ti man ma. <verse eid="MAT 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26" />Ta nkacukoo ta ti kasapal ti man ma, nkafe meemak nkasok: “Aŋuu áfulaful!” Nkayeno kaaceeceekool kamma ewatate. <verse eid="MAT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27" />Pale tokotoko Yéesu naasokii: “Timpi niliim! Aŋe inci, timpi nife!”<verse eid="MAT 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28" />Fiye <char style="w">Piyeer</char> naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, niŋ pánipani awe, sokam píkey ti awe ti man ma.” <verse eid="MAT 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Kéy!” Fiye Piyeer náayuukino ti piteen pa, naasapal ti man ma apuwant pati Yéesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30" />Pale ta naacuke ta hiyam ha henfakat ha, naafe, náayaañ híseemu náaceekii apusok: “Ahámpaatiin, fakanam!” <verse eid="MAT 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31" />Tokotoko Yéesu naañaakan epeesoo naacokoo, naasokoo: “Awe ati káyinan keefomut! Weyme uwune antaak kunuu kúsupak?”<verse eid="MAT 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32" />Ta nkáyuukiye ta ti piteen pa, hiyam ha nihipilan niit. <verse eid="MAT 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33" />Keeyeniye ka púlooŋ ti piteen pa nkákilipo hátikinoo, nkasok: “Pánipani awe yem Añii ya ati Pútuun pa.”<verse eid="MAT 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakuuñan ka kiti Yéesu kéekuuñe Kennesalet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34" />Ta nkafiitan ta han ha, nkaciŋ ti mah ma miti Kennesalet. <verse eid="MAT 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35" />Pakan paka pakati luu nkakiiw Yéesu, nkapoñ hilim ti misaatee ma púlooŋ méekinkoolii ma. Pakan paka, nkácoopii teyoo kéekuuñe ka púlooŋ. <verse eid="MAT 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36" />Nkaŋiiniyoo apikatan kéekuuñe ka kápilik hileelu hísool ha henfakat ha hiteyoo lamma, kéelike ho ka púlooŋ nkákuuñanee.<verse eid="MAT 14:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15" />
  <para style="s">Waah ewwa nuuwas an káakuulaati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1" />Púful toko pakakee <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char> nkáfulii <char style="w">Jerusalem</char> kápikey ti Yéesu. Nkacakanoo: <verse eid="MAT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2" />“Weyme uwune pinapana pa pakatii kátuulantoo cosaan ya eti símaama unaa? Kaatuko kañowantoo sipeesii pinap<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false"><char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa kataakaataak káyinan enke nii: niŋ an álikaa waah weekuulut, sipeesoo etisikuul; niŋ álikaa paliyal, etipukuul; niŋ aliyaa paliyal peekuulut, eniinoo púlooŋ etekuul. Ekina ewune, Pusuwif pa nkataak cosaan eti puñowu sipeesii káliyum kati éfulan káakuulaati ka.</char></note> káliyum.”<verse eid="MAT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Weyme uwune cosaan ya etaaluu neewun nítuulantoo <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Pútuun pa? <verse eid="MAT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4" />Kaatuko Pútuun pa pusok: <char style="qt">'Nápiyan paapaa atii niŋ íññaa atii.'</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Efúlii 20:12</ref></char></note> Mpusok lompo: <char style="qt">'an óo an éekupe heenaput ti paapaa ateyoo niŋ fotom íññaa ateyoo añaŋee himuku.'</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 21:17">Efúlii 21:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5" />Pale aluu nisok nii, an áyiniyini hisoku paapaa ateyoo niŋ fotom íññaa ateyoo: 'Pelut! Inci yinaati kayankanan. Kaatuko waah ewwa inci iññaŋuu wa kawufan, ukina inci uwwufane Pútuun pa.' <verse eid="MAT 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6" />Ti eehuu innisoke nii añaŋut kánapiyan paapaa ateyoo niŋ fotom íññaa ateyoo. Fiyuu ínnituulut <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> kamma cosaan ya etaaluu. <verse eid="MAT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7" />Aluu ñícuf! <char style="w">Ayaamakoola</char> ya <char style="w">Esayi</char> tooñaa naasoke ta naayaamakoole ta kiti aluu, apusok:<verse eid="MAT 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8" />
    <char style="qt">Payenke niŋ kipinii nkánapiyanam,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:8">
    <char style="qt">pale saanii sílaaŋaamlaaŋ.</char>
    <verse eid="MAT 15:8" />
  </para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9" />
    <char style="qt">Nkátuulamtuul kenseŋ,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 15:9">
    <char style="qt">kaatuko eeha nkakalaŋan ha, kilim keesiiŋanee kiti pakan.”</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 29:13">Esayi 29:13</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="MAT 15:9" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10" />Fiye Yéesu náayonkalii kayoŋ ka, naasokii: “Nísiitan eehe kati nísi. <verse eid="MAT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11" />Neetaat waah ewwa nuunako wa ti putum an nuuwasoo káakuulaati, pale waah ewwa núufulii wa ti putumoo, ukina nuuwasoo káakuulaati.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12" />Fiye pinapana pa pakateyoo nkalohoo, nkasokoo: “Fo áameyimeyi nii Pufalisaay pa seeñiiseeñ ti eeha ansoke ha?” <verse eid="MAT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13" />Naañahanii: “Enuun óo enuun eyya Paapaa atoom eeyem a alacana naasukut éfeelupinee. <verse eid="MAT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14" />Nikatii po; úfuumiin uyem ti kátintiŋan úfuumiin. Niŋ káafuumiin átintiŋanaa áwiyoo káafuumiin, efikanow poko t’ésupakii ti kaayeen.”<verse eid="MAT 15:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15" />Fiye <char style="w">Piyeer</char> naasok Yéesu: “Cénkin unii eeha ansoke ha kayoŋ ka.” <verse eid="MAT 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16" />Yéesu naasok: “Fo niloot nímeyi ho lompo? <verse eid="MAT 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17" />Fo nímiit nii waah óo waah weenakiye ti putum an ti munow nuukaay, púful toko núufulii ti enii ya? <verse eid="MAT 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18" />Pale eeha níhifulii ha ti putum an, ti yaanoo níhifulii, aŋe newasoo káakuulaati. <verse eid="MAT 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19" />Kaatuko ti yaan pámiiloolal peenaput mpúfulii: himuku, pihinto niŋ aal ati an niŋ fotom aal eenimiye naahinto niŋ akee áyiin, casupoolat, káalipu, hinooku, niŋ kateñal. <verse eid="MAT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20" />Eehuu nihiwas an káakuulaati, pale hili peeñowut sipees etewas an káakuulaati.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káyinan kiti aal ati Kanaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21" />Yéesu náaful toko, naakaay ti mah ma miti Til niŋ Siton. <verse eid="MAT 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22" />Intaako akee aal ati Kanaan eekine ti mah emmuu, náakey teyoo ti hiceeku, naasokoo: “Ateeteyo, Añii ya ati <char style="w">Dawid</char>, taak paket hikaw ti inci! Añiinam ámaacul <char style="w">hísaalumant</char> híwuuliyoo níhiyemiyoo ti kayokan meemak.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23" />Pale Yéesu añahanutoo háati poonool. Fiye pinapana pa pakateyoo nkalohoo, nkasokoo: “Yaan aal a aŋuu, kaatuko áyekuniit kanapan unaa ti hiceeku.”<verse eid="MAT 15:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24" />Yéesu naañahan aal a: “Inci ti pakati <char style="w">Israyel</char> lamma ímpoñiyee, ti keecuke ka teyii nii písaacii péecime.” <verse eid="MAT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25" />Pale aal a náakey náakilipo hátikinoo, naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, káluma yankananam!” <verse eid="MAT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Naput aapucoop paliyal pa piti epuuk ya uwwant po piyen pa.” <verse eid="MAT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27" />Aal a naañahanoo: “Ahámpaatiin, eehuu páni. Pale, háati piyen pa mpilili mífiitiin paliyal pa emma ummunowal ma t’etaam taapul ya eti áhampaatiin a atempo.” <verse eid="MAT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Aaluu, káyinan ka kitii kenfakat! Hitaako samat nii fa állafiye fa.” Ti oom káasiiŋuma, añiinoo náakuuñanee.<verse eid="MAT 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakuuñan ka kiti keemeeŋe ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29" />Púful toko, Yéesu náaful toko, naayeno kasapal ti kantant ka kiti han ha hiti <char style="w">Galilee</char>. Fiye, naasilo ti tíntiŋ, naayeno. <verse eid="MAT 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30" />Kayoŋ kenfakat nkíkey teyoo, nkícoopoolii kéehute ka, kéefuume ka, payenka nkanow ka niŋ efank, púmumune pa niŋ hícump pakakee kéekuuñe. Nkayenanii hátikin wootoo, náakuuñanii. <verse eid="MAT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31" />Kayoŋ ka ínnimii ta nkacuke ta púmumune pa ti káakup, kéehute ka nkákuuñanee, payenka nkanow ka niŋ efank ti pikaayu niŋ kéefuume ka nkacuk. Fiye, nkámul Pútuun pa piti <char style="w">Israyel</char>.<verse eid="MAT 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakuumanee ka kiti pákayiin síwuli sipaakiil (4,000)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32" />Púful toko, Yéesu naayonkal pinapana pa pakateyoo, naasokii: “Inci taakaataak paket hikaw ti kayoŋ enke, kaatuko unka le niŋ inci fo kunoom kíhaaciil, apan kataakut waah ewwa efikali. Láfiitii hiyaanu niŋ peep, timpi kanowal ti pítin pa.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33" />Pinapana pa pakateyoo nkañahanoo: “Le láaŋaalaaŋ, peyme éfuutaakiyaa hícump paliyal úpukuumanaa kayoŋ ka kenfakat enke?” <verse eid="MAT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34" />Yéesu naacakanii: “Kúmpuul kiyema puume innitaake?” Nkañahanoo: “Kiyema isak niŋ kúsupak niŋ moon menkilis caahinkiŋ.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35" />Fiye, Yéesu naasok kayoŋ ka kiyeno t’etaam. <verse eid="MAT 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36" />Naacoop kúmpuul ka isak niŋ kúsupak ka niŋ moon ma. Naasok Pútuun pa apalaka, naafiit ko, naawufan ko pinapana pa, poko nkawufan ko kayoŋ ka kenfakat ka. <verse eid="MAT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37" />Pakan paka púlooŋ nkali fo kasiit tuk. Fiye, nkayesal mífiitiin paliyal pa peetowiye pa fo kameeŋan usekeyu isak niŋ úsupak. <verse eid="MAT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38" />Keeliye ka kayema pákayiin síwuli sipaakiil (4,000), pakaal paka niŋ epuuk ya kafinutee.<verse eid="MAT 15:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39" />Púful toko, Yéesu náakatinool niŋ kayoŋ ka, náayuuko ti piteen pa apikaay ti mah ma miti Makatan.<verse eid="MAT 15:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16" />
  <para style="s">Kacakan píyisan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1" />Púful toko, pakakee <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Asatusaay">Pusatusaay</char> nkákey ti Yéesu kápilafiyoo puwinko. Nkasokoo áyisanii píyisan péeyisane nii Pútuun pa púpoñiyoo. <verse eid="MAT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2" />Naañahanii: “Niŋ cicokaa innicuk picaaŋaŋ pa ti útiŋu wa innisok nii etenup.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: Niŋ cíniimiyaa, innisok, kacom étikuuteen kamma útiŋu wa núucunke</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3" />Pale niŋ cicokaa nicukut picaaŋaŋ pa, innisok nii efeenup fíyooy.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: Mpucom mic, innisok: Fíyooy hiyam ha efihisap, kaatuko útiŋu wa úcunkaacunk núufeyanani </char></note> Níyiniyini káacenkin nípimeyi heekaakaay pitaako niŋ nisincanaa patiila. Weyme uwune niyinaat káacenkin píyisan pa piti caanak ence, kati nímeyi heekaakaay ha pitaako? <verse eid="MAT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4" />Aluu <char style="w">ekaay</char> eenaput apan innipook hicoku ti Pútuun pa. Fo hiŋes píyisan péeyisane nii Pútuun pa púpoñiyaam inniyaake? Háati poonool étiniyisanee, fo píyisan pa piti Jonas.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ta infiyye yoon enfakat neemelan Jonas <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya ati Pútuun pa. Pumuus kunoom káhaaciil yoon ya néenuusiyoo ti kantant ka kaloŋayoo (Jonas 1:17)</char></note><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:39">Máciya 12:39</ref>; <ref loc="INT 11:29">Luk 11:29</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 16:4">Fiye, Yéesu naatahii toko naakaay.<verse eid="MAT 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Leweñoo ya eti Pufalisaay pa niŋ eti Pusatusaay pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5" />Púful toko, Yéesu niŋ pinapana pa nkafiitan ti kikee kaapii ka kiti han ha, nkafiil hicoopu kúmpuul. <verse eid="MAT 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6" />Yéesu naasokii: “Nitah kunuu! Níwasum leweñoo ya eti <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa niŋ eti <char style="w" lemma="Asatusaay">Pusatusaay</char> pa.” <verse eid="MAT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7" />Pinapana pa nkayeno piteŋenool, nkasok: “Akúpaakup fiyuu kamma núucoopooliyootaa kúmpuul.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8" />Yéesu náapannum eeha nkayem ha ti káakup, naasokii: “Aluu pakati káyinan keefomut! Weyme inniyem ti piteŋenool kamma innitaakut kúmpuul? <verse eid="MAT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9" />Niloot nímeyi fala! Fo nínawuniit ta inci ínkuumane ta pákayiin síwuli isak ya (5,000) niŋ kúmpuul isak, niŋ síyya siyema puume inniyesale ti pútowontiin pa? <verse eid="MAT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10" />Fo nínawuniit ta inci ínkuumane ta pákayiin síwuli sipaakiil sa (4,000) niŋ kúmpuul isak niŋ kúsupak, niŋ usekeyu puume inniyesale ti pútowontiin pa? <verse eid="MAT 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11" />Puume ínnimiit nii inci neetaat ti káakup naaluu kiti kúmpuul? Pale níwasum leweñoo ya eti Pufalisaay pa niŋ eti Pusatusaay pa.” <verse eid="MAT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12" />Fiye pinapana pa nkápannum nii ákuputii kiti káwasum leweñoo eti kúmpuul pale kiti káwasum pakalaŋanal pa piti Pufalisaay pa niŋ Pusatusaay pa.<verse eid="MAT 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káyisan ka kiti Piyeer ayme ayem Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13" />Púful toko, Yéesu naakaay ti mah ma miti Sesaale Filipoy. Ta naacole ta po, naacakan pinapana pa pakateyoo: “Ti pakan paka, inci <char style="w">Añii An</char> yem ayme?” <verse eid="MAT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14" />Nkañahanoo: “Pakakee paka kasok awe yem <char style="w">Saŋ</char>-Patis, pakakee nkasok awe yem <char style="w">Elí ayaamakoola ya</char>, pakakee lompo nkasok awe yem ayaamakoola ya Jeremiya niŋ fotom akee ti piyaamakoola pa keefiyye ka.” <verse eid="MAT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15" />Naacakanii: “Pale ti aluu, ayme innisoke inci iyyem?” <verse eid="MAT 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16" />Simon <char style="w">Piyeer</char> naacoop hilim ha, naasokoo: “Awe yem <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa, Añii ya ati Pútuun pa peeyem pa kaloŋa.”<verse eid="MAT 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17" />Fiye Yéesu naasokoo: “Simon añii ya ati Saŋ,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: Jonas</char></note> aayihaayih kaatuko Paapaa atoom eeyem a alacana áyisanuu ho. Aakalaŋut eehuu ti an.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: aakalaŋut eehuu ti faŋi.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18" />Inci pusoki eehe; awe yem Piyeer.” (Ekina eyem énankiin). “Apan ti énankiin eyyuu inci fasiiŋan éyeniin ya eti kéeyinane ka, apan sempe sa siti eket ya etisiheekii. <verse eid="MAT 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19" />Inci fawufani púkululuma pa piti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>, waah óo waah ewwa ampooke pe t’etaam ya, Pútuun pa pipayaapa mpupooke wo alacana; niŋ lompo waah óo waah ewwa ancoone pe t’etaam ya, Pútuun pa pipayaapa mpucoone wo alacana.” <verse eid="MAT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20" />Fiye Yéesu náakupanan pinapana pa pakateyoo timpi kasok an nii akina ayem Eenucee ya.<verse eid="MAT 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakup Yéesu kiti eketoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21" />Písik ti oom caanak, Yéesu náacook káyisan pinapana pa pakateyoo heekaakaayoo ha pitaako. Naasokii: “Fo inci kaay <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, incuk kúnuul kenfakat ti sipees ñíhampaatiin ña pakati pakan paka, <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char>. Apan famukee, ti hinoom ha íhaaciyenu ha inci fálitaniyee ti eket ya.” <verse eid="MAT 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22" /><char style="w">Piyeer</char> naacoopoo ti kaapii náayaañ pafet teyoo, naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, etihitaako! Eehuu hiyinaati pitaako!” <verse eid="MAT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23" />Pale Yéesu náayesoonii naasok Piyeer: “<char style="w">Seetaani</char>, fúl le ti inci! Awe hifitu pítin pa putoom ayyaake; pámiiloolali piti pakan kenseŋ pale pineetaat pámiiloolal piti Pútuun pa.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Páciite pa piti kanapan ka kiti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24" />Fiye Yéesu naasok pinapana pa pakateyoo: “Niŋ an álafiyaam kanapan afaapook himuumoo, naanapanam fo álafi eket ti <char style="w">kuluwaa</char>.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: naakanto kuluwaa ya eteyoo</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25" />Kaatuko aŋa éelafiye kafakan eloŋ ya eteyoo áfaapuul yo, pale aŋa éepuule eloŋ ya eteyoo kamma inci, afaafakan yo. <verse eid="MAT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26" />Empeyme panap piyem toko an kati ataak hisaanumate ha hiti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> púlooŋ náapuul eloŋ ya eteyoo? Niŋ fotom niŋ weyme an naayina hititu eloŋ ya eteyoo? <verse eid="MAT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27" />Kaatuko inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, fákey niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">pumaleekoo</char> pa putoom ti hamake ha hiti Paapaa atoom,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: inci Añii An fákey ti hamake ha hiti Paapaa atoom niŋ pumaleekoo pa piteyoo </char></note> incooy an óo an ti páhinaloo. <verse eid="MAT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28" />Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, pakakee ti keesiiŋiye ka le etikaket peecukut inci, Añii An, ti ékey samat nii amansa.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17" />
  <para style="s">Hamake ha hiti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1" />Kunoom isak niŋ hoonool kupumuus, Yéesu naacoopool <char style="w">Piyeer</char>, <char style="w">Saak</char> niŋ atuwoo <char style="w">Saŋ</char>. Naasilo neyii patiila tíntiŋ kati kayeno po lamayii. <verse eid="MAT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2" />Hátikinii pacuk Yéesu mpiyeso, puhooŋuyoo mpimiñal tas samat nii caanak ca, wañ wa uteyoo núuhiini samat nii ecaaŋ. <verse eid="MAT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3" />Tokotoko, <char style="w">Móyiis</char> niŋ <char style="w">Elí ayaamakoola ya</char> nkáfulii teyii, nkayeno kákupat niŋ Yéesu.<verse eid="MAT 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4" />Piyeer naasok Yéesu: “Ahámpaatiin, napaanap unii úpuyemi le. Niŋ áalafiyaa, inci insiiŋan múkuut míhaaciil, coonool citii, coonool citi Móyiis, coonool citi Elí.” <verse eid="MAT 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5" />Akina ti káakup, tokotoko káatiŋu kiti ecaaŋ nkúfulii nkíkimpitoolii. Fiye, hilim níhifulii ti káatiŋu ka nihisok: “Aŋe ayem Añiinam, aŋa inci íllafiye ya; teyoo inci intaake pásuumayam. Nísiitanoo!”<verse eid="MAT 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6" />Ta pinapana pa nkásiye ta eehuu, nkafe meemak fo nkanowale ñuhooŋuyii t’etaam. <verse eid="MAT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7" />Pale Yéesu naalohii, náalikii, naasokii: “Nilito! Timpi nife!” <verse eid="MAT 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8" />Ta nkáhaafine ta, kacukut an, fo Yéesu lamma. <verse eid="MAT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9" />Ta nkayeniye ta éwanoonii ti tíntiŋ ya, Yéesu náakupananii, naasokii: “Timpi nisok an eeha innicuke ha, fo ta inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, fálitaniyee ti eket ya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10" />Fiye, pinapana pa pakateyoo nkacakanoo: “Weyme uwune <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti Móyiis nkasok nii, fo Elí átikin áñohoonii le niŋ <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa áfaakey?” <verse eid="MAT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Pánipani, fo Elí ákey apimemanool waah óo waah.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 4:5-6">Malaki 4:5-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12" />Pale inci pusok aluu nii, Elí ákeyyookey, pakan paka kakiiwutoo, pale nkáhinoo waah óo waah ewwa nkálafiye. Fo lompo nkakaakaay kaakallan inci, Añii an.” <verse eid="MAT 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13" />Fiye pinapana pa nkápannum nii Yéesu kiti Saŋ-Patis naayemii ti káakup ta náakupii ta kiti Elí.<verse eid="MAT 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakuuñan akampaani ati hísaalumant</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14" />Púful toko, Yéesu niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo pákahaaciil paka nkáwanoonii t’etaam tíntiŋ ya, kayoŋ kenfakat nkiyeniyii hítuulu. Akee áyiin naaloh Yéesu, náakilipo hátikinoo, <verse eid="MAT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15" />naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, taak paket hikaw ti akampaani ya atoom, nanownow náayemi ti ñíyoka ñenfakat. Naloomloom enow ti seemak niŋ fotom ti musuu. <verse eid="MAT 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16" />Cóopiyoocoop ti pinapana pa pakatii, pale kayinaatoo káakuuñan.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17" />Yéesu naasok: “Oo! Aluu <char style="w">ekaay</char> ya eenaput ya apan nitaakut káyinan. Fo teyme inci fayeno niŋ aluu? Fo teyme famukutool niŋ aluu? Nícoopii akampaani ya le ti inci.” <verse eid="MAT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18" />Yéesu naafet ti <char style="w">hísaalumant</char> ha, níhiful ti akampaani ya. Ti oom káasiiŋuma, akampaani ya náakuuñanee.<verse eid="MAT 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19" />Eehuu hipimuus, pinapana pa nkákey ti Yéesu lamayii, nkacakanoo: “Weyme uwune uyinaat hiyaanu hísaalumant ha?” <verse eid="MAT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20" />Naañahanii: “Kamma káyinan ka kitaaluu nkufomut. Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, niŋ nitaakaa káyinan keefomut nii ekoon sootoo, níyiniyini hisoku tíntiŋ eyye, 'Fúl le, inkaay pa,' apan éfeeful. Waah etuuheek aluu.” <verse eid="MAT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21" />[<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">An ámiit man Máciya lompo akiice fiye: Pale, hísaalumant eehuu ti kaluum niŋ suŋ lamma níhiful.</char></note>]<verse eid="MAT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Púsupiyenu káakup Yéesu kiti eketoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22" />Púful toko, pinapana pa nkaconcoolo nantoonool ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Galilee</char>, Yéesu naasokii: “Inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, fawufanee ti sipees pakan. <verse eid="MAT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23" />Apan efikamukam, ti hinoom ha híhaaciyenu ha fálitaniyee ti eket ya.” Kamma eehuu, pinapana pa pakateyoo nkayeno ti páciite penfakat.<verse eid="MAT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kúncoo ya eti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24" />Púful toko, Yéesu niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo nkacol ti saatee ya eti <char style="w">Kafaanawum</char>. <char style="w" lemma="Asayoola kúncoo">Pisayoola kúncoo</char> ya eti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char> nkákey ti <char style="w">Piyeer</char>, nkacakan: “Fo áhampaatiin a ataaluu nacooycooy kúncoo ya eti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayíin óo áyiin <char style="w">Asuwif</char> añaŋaa cooy kúncoo eyye poonool ti etiil ya. Ekina eyem cooy eti kunoom kúsupak kiti áhina. Mañ emmuu nkacoop kapimankool ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa eeyem ya <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25" />Piyeer naañahanii: “Ee, nacooycooy.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Ta Piyeer naañohiye ta ti enuuf, Yéesu náatikin ákup neyoo, naasokoo: “Simon, eeheyme ámmiiloole ti eehe? Ayme akaakaay cooy kúncoo óo kúncoo pumansa pa pakati <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>? Fo epuukii niŋ fotom pakakee paka?”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: Fo pakanii niŋ fotom <char style="w" lemma="Akaawoola">ekaawoola</char>? </char></note> <verse eid="MAT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26" />Piyeer naañahanoo: “Pakakee paka.” Yéesu naasokoo: “Ooto epuukii etikacooy kúncoo. <verse eid="MAT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27" />Pale kati máalaahaatiyaa pisayoola kúncoo ya, kaay pati han ha uwwant ésallii ya etii. Coop yoon eyya áafatikin ya cókii, ŋáapin putum eteyyo, aafatook toko mañ. Cóopii mo incooy kúncoo ya etaanii.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18" />
  <para style="s">Eemaka ya ti cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1" />Ti oom káasiiŋuma, Yéesu pinapana pa pakateyoo nkákey teyoo, nkacakanoo: “Ayme ahaŋe pamake ti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>?” <verse eid="MAT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2" />Yéesu náayonkalii teyoo ciñii, naasiiŋan co ti pututayii. <verse eid="MAT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3" />Naasokii: “Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, etininako ti cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa taamanta niyesanut ínniyenoonii nii epuuk kenkilis. <verse eid="MAT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4" />Ooto an óo an eewananooliye samat nii ciñii ence, oom an ayem eehaŋe ya pamake ti cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa. <verse eid="MAT 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5" />An óo an eewanane ciñii samat nii ence ti caacawam, inci naawanane.”<verse eid="MAT 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kanakanee ti kaamuuyen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6" />Yéesu nene asok: “Niŋ an anakanaa akee ti kéetinee ka kéeyinane ka ti inci apunow ti kaamuuyen,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: ápuful ti káyinan ka ti inci</char></note> fisaka apicenkee ti ekun énankiin enfakat, náaseemanee ti pututa kaatii ka. <verse eid="MAT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7" />Kúnuul efikiyeno ti pakan paka pakati <char style="w">púlunta pa</char>, kamma waah wa ewwa nuunakanii wa ti kaamuuyen! Waah ewwuu fo utaako, pale kúnuul efikiyeno ti aŋa éfuunapii ya teyoo! <verse eid="MAT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8" />Niŋ epeesi niŋ fotom kooti kinakanuu ti kaamuuyen, fiit ko uwwant ko. Fisaka aapinako ti eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya niŋ epees yoonool niŋ fotom koot koonool le niŋ aafawantee ti seemak seehokiyantoo niŋ sipees súsupak niŋ fotom woot úsupak. <verse eid="MAT 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9" />Niŋ níkini ninakanuu ti kaamuuyen, lókit no uwwant no. Fisaka aapinako ti eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya niŋ níkin noonool le niŋ aafawantee ti seemak seehokiyantoo niŋ ñíkin ñúsupak.”<verse eid="MAT 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu hiti sáacii eelinciye</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10" />Yéesu nene asok: “Nitah kunuu timpi nítinan ti akee ti kéetinee ka kéeyinane ka ti inci. Inci pusok aluu, <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">pumaleekoo</char> pa piteyii peeyem pa alacana umpa tan óo tan hátikin Paapaa atoom eeyem a alacana. <verse eid="MAT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11" />[<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">An ámiit man Máciya lompo akiice fiye: Kaatuko inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, kéyyookey kafakan keelinciye ka.</char></note>]<verse eid="MAT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12" />“Eeheyme ínnimiiloole ti eehe? Niŋ áyiin ataakaa sísaacii keme (100), yoonool neelinco, fo atakat áwii epaakiil niŋ kaat niŋ sipaakiil sa (99) ti mítintiŋ ma, apikaay hiŋes yoonool ya eelinciye ya? <verse eid="MAT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13" />Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, niŋ álaŋaniyoo yo, afaataak pásuuma teyyo pihaŋ áwii epaakiil niŋ kaat niŋ sipaakiil sa (99) seelinciit sa. <verse eid="MAT 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14" />Fo lompo incuke, Paapaa ataaluu eeyem a alacana álafiit háati akee ti kéetinee ka kéeyinane ka ti inci ápicim.”<verse eid="MAT 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hilaahu hiti ani ti káyinan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15" />Yéesu nene asok: “Niŋ ani ti káyinan amuuyenaa ti awe,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: Niŋ ani ti káyinan amuuyenaa</char></note> kaay teyoo aluu t’ésupak aluu nípicoonool, uwwatanoo. Niŋ ásiitanuu, ooto áañahaniyoo-ñahan. <verse eid="MAT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16" />Pale niŋ ásiitanuti, coop akee niŋ fotom pakakee pákasupak iññoho teyoo neyii ancuk kati taako samat nii fa <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> nihisoke fa, nii: <char style="qt">waah óo waah éfuuhinee kíiti pínapii ti eeha keetantake pákasupak niŋ fotom pákahaaciil nkasoke ha.</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 19:15">Kakaman 19:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17" />Niŋ oom an aloŋaa naapooke káasiitan, coop hilim ha pati éyeniin ya eti kéeyinane ka. Niŋ apookaa lompo káasiitan kéeyinane ka, incokoo samat nii éeyinanut niŋ fotom <char style="w">asayoola kúncoo</char>.<verse eid="MAT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18" />“Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, waah óo waah ewwa innipooke t’etaam ya, Pútuun pa pipayaapa mpupooke wo alacana; niŋ lompo waah óo waah ewwa innicoone t’etaam ya, Pútuun pa pipayaapa mpucoone wo alacana.<verse eid="MAT 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19" />“Inci pinene sok aluu pánipani ya, niŋ pákasupak ti aluu t’etaam ya kásiyoolaa ti waah, nkaluum wo Paapaa atoom eeyem a alacana, afaawufanii wo. <verse eid="MAT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20" />Kaatuko la pákasupak niŋ fotom pákahaaciil nkaconcooliye ti caacawam, inci oopa ti pututayii.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu hiti amiikan eeponketantoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21" />Fiye <char style="w">Piyeer</char> naaloh Yéesu, naasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, niŋ anam ti káyinan atowiyaa ti kaamuuyen ti inci, ñiyema puume inci iññaŋoo kaaponket? Fo ñiyema isak niŋ ñésupak?” <verse eid="MAT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Haani! Neetaat ñiyema isak niŋ ñésupak, pale fo ñiyema áwii éhaaciil niŋ kaat niŋ ñésupak (77).<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: sikeme sipaakiil niŋ áwii epaakiil niŋ ŋaasuwan (70 x 7 = 490)</char></note><verse eid="MAT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23" />“Ooto <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> cinakoolaa-nakool nii amansa éelafiye pimiikan pa pakateyoo kapucooyoo aŋa nkayekanoo ti nikopu. <verse eid="MAT 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24" />Ti cooy ñikopu eññuu, nkácoopiyoo akee áyiin teyii eeyekanoo nikopu sipootak sanoo síwuli ŋaasuwan (10,000). <verse eid="MAT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25" />Páawoo ayinaat cooy oom nikopu, amansa ya naasok anoomanee niŋ aaloo niŋ epuukoo niŋ waah óo waah ewwa naataake kati acooy nikopu na. <verse eid="MAT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26" />Fiye, amiikan a náakilipo hátikinoo, naaluumoo: 'Káluma ponket, mukut niŋ inci, facooyi waah óo waah.' <verse eid="MAT 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27" />Amansa ya naataak paket hikaw ti amiikan a aŋuu, naaponketoo nikopu na, naakatoo apikaay.<verse eid="MAT 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28" />“Pale, ta amiikan a náafule ta hátikin amansa ya, naacuk akee ti pákawiyoo pimiikan eeyekanoo nikopu niti mañ hak keme. Naaŋoonoo naakulucoo, naasokoo: 'Cooyam aŋa ayyekanaam a!' <verse eid="MAT 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29" />Awíyoo amiikan náakilipo hátikinoo, naaluumoo: 'Mukut niŋ inci, inci facooyi.' <verse eid="MAT 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30" />Pale naapook, naacaawantoo ti ékuluma fo ta afaacooy ta nikopu na niteyoo.<verse eid="MAT 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31" />“Ta pákawiyoo pimiikan pa nkacuke ta heetaakiye ha, ínciitiyii meemak, nkakaay kapikaman amansa ya heetaakiye ha. <verse eid="MAT 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32" />Fiye Amansa ya náayonkalii amiikan a, naasokoo: 'Awe amiikan eenaput! Inci ponketuuponket nikopu na nitii púlooŋ kamma alluumaam. <verse eid="MAT 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33" />Fo aañaŋut lompo hitaaku paket hikaw ti áwiyi amiikan samat nii fa inci intaake fa paket hikaw ti awe?' <verse eid="MAT 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34" />Amansa ya náañiken, naacoopoo ti ékuluma apikallanee, fo ta afaacooy nikopu na niteyoo púlooŋ.<verse eid="MAT 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35" />“Fiyuu lompo Paapaa atoom eeyem a alacana áfaahin an óo an ti aluu taamanta aaponketut ani ti káyinan púfulii ti yaani.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19" />
  <para style="s">Kakalaŋan kiti káfulan aal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1" />Fiye, ta Yéesu naapaye ta hisoku kilim enke púlooŋ, náaful ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Galilee</char> naakaay ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Judaay</char> meeyem ma ti kikee kaapii ka kiti musuu ma miti Jordan. <verse eid="MAT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2" />Kayoŋ kenfakat nkinapanoo, toko náakuuñan kéekuuñe ka teyii.<verse eid="MAT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3" />Pakakee <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> nkalohoo kati kakuucoo, nkacakanoo: “Fo cooneecoon áyiin kati áfulan aaloo ti fan óo fan?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Fo nikalaŋut ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> nii, ti púcook pa Pútuun pa piliilaaliil pakan áyiin niŋ aal.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Púcook 1:27</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:2">5:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5" />Nihisok lompo: <char style="qt">'Ekina ewune áyiin nakatan faafoo niŋ íññaayoo naananf aaloo, poko t’ésupakii nkáyenoonii oonool.'</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:24">Púcook 2:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6" />Insok aluu, eehuu hiwune kaneetaat nene pakan pákasupak pale oonool. Ooto eeha Pútuun pa mpinanfoole, an timpi ákatinool.”<verse eid="MAT 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7" />Pufalisaay pa nkacakanoo: “Ooto weyme uwune <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char> nihisok nii, niŋ áyiin áfulanaa aaloo awufanoo kaahit kéeyisane nii áfulanoofulan?”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:1">Kakaman 24:1</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Móyiis akataakat aluu kati nífulan pakaal aluu kamma ekun aluu neeyanke, pale eehuu hitaakiit púcook pa. <verse eid="MAT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9" />Inci pusok aluu eehe: áyiin óo áyiin éefulane aaloo, aal a peehaañiit,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">fo niŋ pinimo pa picenkutee ti pítin</char></note> naasa akee aal, oom áyiin ti eloŋ eti pahaaño naayem.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10" />Pinapana pa pakati Yéesu nkasokoo: “Iyyema eehuu hiyem ti pututa áyiin niŋ aal, ooto fisaka timpi sa.” <verse eid="MAT 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11" />Yéesu naañahanii: “An óo an tom ayina kasayan hilim eehe, pale payenka Pútuun pa mpuwufane ho ka lamma. <verse eid="MAT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12" />Kaatuko taakaataak payenka ammeya nii kasayut kamma nkapukee fo, pakakee paka pakan káhinii fo, pakakee paka poko kapooke esa kamma <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>. Eeyina kasayan eehe añaŋaa ho kasayan.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu niŋ epuuk ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13" />Púful toko, pakan nkácoopii epuuk kenkilis ti Yéesu kati anaŋ sipeesoo teyii naaluumii. Pale pinapana pa nkafet ti kéecoopii ka epuuk ya. <verse eid="MAT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14" />Yéesu naasokii: “Nikatan epuuk ya kápikey ti inci, timpi nikitii. Kaatuko <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> citi keecuke ka nii poko.” <verse eid="MAT 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15" />Naanaŋ sipeesoo ti epuuk ya, fiye naakaay.<verse eid="MAT 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usaanum niŋ cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16" />Púful toko, akee áyiin náakey ti Yéesu, naacakanoo: “Ahámpaatiin, eeheyme heenape inci iññaŋe íhinu pitaak eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya?” <verse eid="MAT 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Weyme uwune ancakanam kiti heenape? Pútuun pa kóŋ pinape. Náalafiyaa pinako ti eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya, túul <char style="w" lemma="Hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">kilim ka keesiiŋanee ka</char>.” <verse eid="MAT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18" />Ayíin a naacakanoo: “Enkeyme kilim?” Yéesu naañahanoo: “Timpi muk an ti pásuumayi, timpi hinto niŋ aal eenimiye, timpi líp, timpi caam aapunook akinooli. <verse eid="MAT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19" />Nápiyan paapaa atii niŋ íññaa atii,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Efúlii 20:12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Kakaman 5:16-20</ref></char></note> íllafi akinooli samat nii fa állafiye fa faŋi.”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lewitik 19:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20" />Kahiineen ka nkusokoo: “Eehuu púlooŋ inci íntuule. Weyme nene inci iññaŋe íhinu?” <verse eid="MAT 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21" />Yéesu naasokoo: “Niŋ áalafiyaa an éetuuniye, kaay caanooman hitaaku ha hitii púlooŋ uwwufan mañ ma keeleke ka, aafataak hisaanumate alacana, náafulaa toko ínkey, innapanam.” <verse eid="MAT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22" />Ta kahiineen ka nkísiye ta eehuu, nkikaay ínciiti ko meemak kaatuko hitaaku ha hiteyoo henfakat.<verse eid="MAT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23" />Fiye Yéesu naasok pinapana pa pakateyoo: “Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, cíiticiiti usaanum apinako ti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>! <verse eid="MAT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24" />Pinene sok aluu, fo ñonkomoo éfeeyini pinako ti káfuun saakilaŋ? Haani! Pale pinako pa piti usaanum ti cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa efipihaŋ páciite.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25" />Ta pinapana pa nkásiye ta eehuu, ínnimii meemak nkasok: “Ooto ayme conko áfaayiniyee kafakan?” <verse eid="MAT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26" />Yéesu naasincanii naasokii: “Eehuu an nihiheeke, pale waah uheekut Pútuun pa.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27" />Fiye, <char style="w">Piyeer</char> naacoop hilim ha, naasokoo: “Sincan, unii ukatanaakatan waah óo waah nuunapani. Weyme conko efuutaak?” <verse eid="MAT 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, niŋ Pútuun pa píhinaa waah óo waah úpuyenoonii wéeyeeni, inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, iyyeno ti <char style="w">elemeyu</char> ya etoom eemaka ya, aluu keenapanaam ka efiniyeno lompo ti silemeyu ŋaasuwan niŋ súsupak, kati ínnihin kíiti miin ma ŋaasuwan niŋ músupak ma miti <char style="w">Israyel</char>. <verse eid="MAT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29" />An óo an eekatane enuuf, ñúnu niŋ pakatu, pakahoop, paapaa, íññaa,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: íññaa, aal</char></note> epuuk niŋ fotom ukit kamma inci, afaahaŋ naasaye ñiyema keme, afaawufanee eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya. <verse eid="MAT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30" />Pale hícump keeyem ka hátikin éfikakelanii, hícump kéekelanii ka efikayeno hátikin.”<verse eid="MAT 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20" />
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu hiti píhina ti kaakit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1" />Yéesu nene asok: “<char style="w">Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> cinakoolaa-nakool nii áyiin ati kaakit éefule nuulap apikaay hiŋes píhina kati káhin ti kaakit ka kiteyoo. <verse eid="MAT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2" />Náasiyool niŋ píhina pa ti cooy eyya nkacooy ya áhina hinoom ha, naapoñii kapikaay ti kaakit ka kiteyoo.<verse eid="MAT 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3" />“Mpucom pa, náaful tíkitaaŋ naacuk pakakee keesiiŋiye ti híliŋ ha keeyeniit íhinu waah. <verse eid="MAT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4" />Naasokii: 'Aluu lompo nikaay páhin ti kaakit ka kutoom, inci facooy aluu fa iññaŋee fa.' <verse eid="MAT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5" />Fiye nkakaay.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:5">“Caanak ca ti hikaw niŋ sitalaŋ síhaaciil hátikin, nene áful náahin moonool muu. <verse eid="MAT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6" />Nkániim ka náaful, nene acuk pakakee keesiiŋiye. Naacakanii: 'Weyme uwune ínniyemi le ti pisiiŋo hinoom ha púlooŋ péehinut waah?'<verse eid="MAT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7" />“Nkañahanoo: 'Kaatuko an acooput unii páhin.' Naasokii, 'Aluu lompo nikaay páhin pati kaakit ka kutoom.'<verse eid="MAT 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8" />“Cípiniimo, ati kaakit ka naasok áhampaatiin a ati píhina pa pakateyoo: 'Yónkalii píhina pa incooyii cooy ya eteyii, yáañ ti keekelane ka ékey puwant ti kéetikine ka ékey.'<verse eid="MAT 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9" />“Píhina pa keecoopee ka páhin nkániim ka nkákey, an óo an teyii naasa cooy eyya nkacooy ya áhina hinoom ha. <verse eid="MAT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10" />Ta kéeyaañe ka kacoopee páhin nkákeyii ta esa cooy ya eteyii, nkámiilool nii efikasa pihaŋ toko. Pale, an óo an teyii lompo naasa cooy eyya nkacooy ya áhina hinoom ha. <verse eid="MAT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11" />Ta nkasaye ta cooy ya eteyii, nkáyaañ káakumutool ti ati kaakit ka. <verse eid="MAT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12" />Nkasokoo: 'Píhina pa keekelanee ka ti hicoopu páhin, waati yoonool lamma nkáhine, háati fo ancooyii samat nii fa ancooye fa unii keekete ka páhin ti hinoom ha púlooŋ ti pisiya cay.'<verse eid="MAT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13" />“Pale ati kaakit ka naañahan akee teyii, naasokoo: 'Awíyam, inci hínuti heeñaŋut. Fo úsiyoolutaa nii inci facooyi ti cooy eyya nkacooy ya áhina hinoom? <verse eid="MAT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14" />Coop cooy ya etii inkaay. Inci láfiye cooy eekelanee ya ti hicoopu páhin samat nii fa inci uwwufanuu fa. <verse eid="MAT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15" />Fo inci yinaat íhinu héesuumaam niŋ mañ ma mutoom? Niŋ fotom, fo aataakaataak paheeka kamma inci ínsuumanana?'”<verse eid="MAT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16" />Yéesu naakelan káakup ka kiteyoo, naasok: “Fiyuu keekelane ka efikayeno hátikin, keeyem ka hátikin éfikakelanii.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Píhaaciyenu káakup Yéesu kiti eketoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17" />Púful toko, Yéesu naayeno pisilo <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, naacoop ti kaapii pinapana pa ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka lamayii, ti pítin pa naasokii: <verse eid="MAT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18" />“Nísiitan, unaa unka ti pisilo Jerusalem. Inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, fawufanee ti sipees <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char>. Efíkahinam kíiti kati mukee. <verse eid="MAT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19" />Nkawufanam <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char> kápipalahoolam nkalenkenam, nkasapam niŋ kisawut, nkapempeŋam ti <char style="w">kuluwaa</char>. Ti hinoom ha híhaaciyenu ha fálitaniyee ti eket ya.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaluum kiti íññaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20" />Fiye, Sepete aaloo naakaay ti Yéesu niŋ epuukoo pákayiin, náakilipo hátikinoo, naaluumoo kayankanan.<verse eid="MAT 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21" />Yéesu naacakanoo: “Iññáayuu, weyme állafiye?” Iññáa ya naañahanoo: “Niŋ aayeniyaa amansa, káluma kat epuukam pákasupak paka kapiyeno look, akee ti epeesi yáali, akee ti epeesi yaamay.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22" />Yéesu naasok epuukoo: “Nímiit eeha inniyem ha ti kacakan. Fo níyiniyini pálaani elontoŋ ya eti kúnuul ka eyya inci inkaakaay ya pálaani?” Nkañahanoo: “Ee, úyiniyini.”<verse eid="MAT 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23" />Yéesu naasokii: “Pánipani efinilaan ti elontoŋ ya etoom, pale iyyema piyeno look ti epeesam yáali niŋ fotom epeesam yaamay, eehuu inci tom fawufan ho. Paapaa atoom amemanoole úyenuma ewwuu payenka naamamale ka.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24" />Ta pakakee pinapana pa ŋaasuwan ya nkásiye ta eehuu, inseeñii ti pákasupak paka. <verse eid="MAT 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25" />Fiye Yéesu náayonkalii poko púlooŋ nantoonool, naasokii: “Nímeyimeyi nii pakati kikaw ka niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakati <char style="w">keeneetaat ka Pusuwif</char> nkálafi káyisan nii kataakaataak sempe niŋ kayine ti pakan paka pakateyii. <verse eid="MAT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26" />Hikina tom hiñaŋe ti aluu. Pale an óo an ti aluu éelafiye piyeno eemaka ya, añaŋaa piyeno áhina ya ataaluu. <verse eid="MAT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27" />An óo an ti aluu lompo éelafiye piyeno áyaañ a, añaŋaa piyeno amiikan a ataaluu. <verse eid="MAT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28" />Fo lompo inci <char style="w">Añii An</char>, kéyyoot kati taak pimiikan, pale kati yeno amiikan, uwwufan eloŋam kati yihan hícump.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káakuuñan ka kiti púfuumafuum pákasupak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29" />Púful toko, Yéesu niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo nkayeno hífulu saatee ya eti Jeriko, kayoŋ kenfakat nkinapanoo. <verse eid="MAT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30" />Fiye, púfuumafuum pákasupak nkayeno ti kanaac pítin pa. Ta nkásiye ta nii Yéesu ayem ti himuusu, nkayeno hiceeku kapusok: “Ateeteyo, Añii ya ati <char style="w">Dawid</char>, taak paket hikaw toonii!” <verse eid="MAT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31" />Kayoŋ ka nkifet teyii nkusokii kafatan, pale nkahaŋ toko nkáceekii: “Ateeteyo, Añii ya ati Dawid, taak paket hikaw toonii!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32" />Yéesu naasiiŋo naayonkalii, naasokii: “Weyme ínnilafiye inci píhin aluu?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33" />Nkasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, káluma, pánkin ñíkin unii.” <verse eid="MAT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34" />Yéesu naataak paket hikaw teyii, náalik ñíkinii. Tokotoko ñíkinii íññipankino, nkanapan Yéesu.<verse eid="MAT 20:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21" />
  <para style="s">Pinako pa piti Yéesu Jerusalem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1" />Púful toko, Yéesu niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo nkalohan <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>. Nkacol pukol cisaatee ca citi Petifake la ti cítintiŋ ca enca nkasok ca Olif. Yéesu naapoñ pákasupak ti pinapana pa pakateyoo, <verse eid="MAT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2" />naasokii: “Nikaay ti cisaatee ca ceeyem ca hátikin aluu. Emma inninako ma efinitook fáli eecenkee toko niŋ kaafuun eteyyo. Níkopinii po ínnicoopiyam po. <verse eid="MAT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3" />Niŋ an acakanaa aluu weyme inniyem ti íhinu, niñahanoo: 'Ahámpaatiin a asoolahe po,' tokotoko afaakatan aluu nipicoop po.”<verse eid="MAT 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4" />Fiyuu intaakiye ancuk eeha <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya naasoke ha hitaakiyaa, asok:<verse eid="MAT 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5" />
    <char style="qt">“Sok pakati <char style="w">Siyon</char>,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">
    <char style="qt">'Nisincan, amansa ya ataaluu oopa ti ékey ti aluu,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:5">
    <char style="qt">eewananooliye, naalapo ti fáli,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:5">
    <char style="qt">niŋ ti cífali, kaafuun fáli.'”</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:5 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 62:11">Esayi 62:11</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Sakaliya 9:9</ref></char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="MAT 21:5" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6" />Pinapana pa pákasupak paka nkakaay nkáhin eeha Yéesu naasokii ha. <verse eid="MAT 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7" />Nkácoopii fáli ya niŋ kaafuun eteyyo, nkalemp kúsool ka kiteyii kenfakat ka tempo, Yéesu naayeno tenko. <verse eid="MAT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8" />Kayoŋ kenfakat nkitanal kúsool ka kenfakat ka kiteyii ti pítin pa, pakakee paka nkafiital minaay ti punuun pa nkanaŋal mo ti pítin pa. <verse eid="MAT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9" />Kayoŋ ka keenowoo ka hátikin niŋ keeyemoo ka ti kanapan nkayeno hiceeku:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">“Hosanna!<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Naasokaa “hosanna” ekina eyem “úmulaa Pútuun pa”.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">Umúlaa Añii ya ati <char style="w">Dawid</char>!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">
    <char style="qt">Alímaati <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa pisampan éekeyii ya ti caacaw etempo!</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:9 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:26">Kícimu 118:26</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">Hosanna!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:9">Umúlaa Pútuun pa piti patiila!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10" />Ta Yéesu naanakiye ta Jerusalem, saatee ya púlooŋ neeliiñool, nkacakan: “Aŋuu ayme?” <verse eid="MAT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11" />Kayoŋ ka keeyeniye ka niŋ Yéesu nkiñahan: “Aŋe Yéesu, ayaamakoola ya éefulii ya ti saatee ya eti Naasalet eti mah ma miti <char style="w">Galilee</char>.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu lati ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12" />Fiye Yéesu naanako ti hank ha hiti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>, naayaan pakan paka púlooŋ keeyeniye ka kaanooman niŋ hinoomu toko. Naahalapal pitaapul pa piti <char style="w" lemma="Afáliŋa mañ">púfaliŋa mañ</char> ma niŋ kúkon ka kiti punoomana kúcuucuuku ka. <verse eid="MAT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13" />Naasokii: “Kiiceekiic ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> nii: <char style="qt">'Ekumpaan ya etoom efeeyonkalee ekumpaan éluumuma,'</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:7">Esayi 56:7</ref></char></note> pale aluu inniyesan yo <char style="qt">'éyolowuma pikanca'</char>!<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 7:11">Jeremiya 7:11</ref></char></note>”<verse eid="MAT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14" />Kéefuume ka niŋ payenka nkanow ka niŋ efank nkákey ti Yéesu ti hank ha hiti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya, náakuuñanii. <verse eid="MAT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15" /><char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">Ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char> nkacuk weecukantee wa ewwa náahine wa, nkási epuuk ya ti kaaceeceekool ti hank ha hiti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya: “Hosanna! Umúlaa Añii ya ati <char style="w">Dawid</char>!” Inseeñii, <verse eid="MAT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16" />nkasok Yéesu: “Fo áasiyaasi eeha epuuk ya payenke nkayem ha ti hisoku?” Naañahanii: “Ee, fo nitaapala nikalaŋ heekiicee ha ti hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa nii:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:16">
    <char style="qt">'Aáhinaahin hímulu ha hitii hípifulii ti putum epuuk niŋ miñii meeyem ti káacuu.'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:16 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 8:2">Kícimu 8:2</ref>
      </char>
    </note>”<verse eid="MAT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17" />Fiye naatahii toko, náaful ti saatee ya, naakaay ti cisaatee ca citi Betani, naaŋot toko.<verse eid="MAT 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu niŋ enuun sootoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18" />Eti kacom eteyyo mpucom mic, Yéesu naayeno puñoho <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, peep mpucokoo. <verse eid="MAT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19" />Naacuk enuun sootoo pukol pítin pa, naakaay teyyo pale acukut teyyo waah niŋ neetaat pahatal lamma. Fiye naasok yo: “Alímaati timpi nene puk múk!” Tokotoko enuun sootoo ya neesuucan.<verse eid="MAT 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20" />Ta pinapana pa nkacuke ta eehuu, ínnimii nkacakanoo: “Puume enuun sootoo ya neesuucane fiye mpacas?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, niŋ nitaakaa káyinan peetaakut kunuu kúsupak, éfiniyini íhinu eeha inci ínhine ha ti enuun sootoo ya. Apan eehuu lamma tom, pale éfiniyini hisoku tíntiŋ eyye, 'Lúpinoolo, incaawant faŋi ti kaatii,' efihitaako. <verse eid="MAT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22" />Niŋ níyinanaa ti Pútuun pa, éfipihin waah óo waah ewwa inniluume ti kaluum.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kacakan ka kiti kayine ka kiti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23" />Púful toko, Yéesu naanako ti hank ha hiti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>, naayeno kakalaŋan. Fiye <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakati pakan paka nkákey teyoo, nkacakanoo: “Awe yem ayme heewune áayemi ti íhinu eehuu? Ayme asokuu hín ho?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Inci lompo taakaataak ti aluu kacakan koonool. Niŋ niñahanaam, inci fasok aluu eesokaam ya hín eehe. <verse eid="MAT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25" />Nisokam, <char style="w">pátise</char> ya eti <char style="w">Saŋ</char>, ti ayme néefulii, ti Pútuun pa fo ti pakan paka?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Fiye nkayeno piteŋenool ti pututayii, nkasokoolo: “Niŋ unaa usokaa, ti Pútuun pa néefulii, afaasok unaa, ooto weyme uwune níyinanutoo? <verse eid="MAT 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26" />Pale niŋ usokaa, ti pakan paka néefulii, ufeyetanaa eeha pakan paka éfikahin ha, kaatuko poko púlooŋ kacokaacok Saŋ nii <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char>.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27" />Fiye nkañahan Yéesu: “Unii úmiit.” Naañahanii: “Inci lompo etisok aluu eesokaam ya hín eehe.”<verse eid="MAT 21:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu hiti pikampaani pákasupak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28" />Yéesu nene asok: “Eeheyme ínnimiiloole ti eehe? Taakaataak akee áyiin eetaake pikampaani pákasupak, naakaay ti áyaañ a naasokoo: 'Añiinam, fíyooy kaay páhin ti kaakit ka.' <verse eid="MAT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29" />Añii ya naañahanoo: 'Haani, inci etikaay,' pale po hátikin naawatanoolo naakaay. <verse eid="MAT 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30" />Paapaa ya naakaay ti ásupiyenu ya, naasokoo hoonool huu. Naañahanoo: 'Ee, paapaa inci fakaay,' pale akaayut.<verse eid="MAT 21:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31" />“Ti payenke t’ésupakii, ayme áhine eeha paapaa ateyoo náalafiye ha?” <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">Ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakati pakan paka nkañahanoo: “Ayáañ a.” Yéesu naasokii: “Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, <char style="w" lemma="Asayoola kúncoo">pisayoola kúncoo</char> ya niŋ pakaal paka pihaañiya pa éfikatikin aluu pinako ti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>. <verse eid="MAT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32" />Kaatuko <char style="w">Saŋ</char>-Patis ákeyyookey ti aluu náayisan aluu pítin pa piti <char style="w">pucoonool</char> pa; níyinanutoo pale pisayoola kúncoo ya niŋ pakaal paka pihaañiya pa nkáyinanoo. Háati ta innicuke ta eehuu ti pitaako, po hátikin niwatanooliit kati níyinanoo.”<verse eid="MAT 21:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu hiti púluwaasa keekance</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33" />Yéesu nene asok: “Nísiitan nene hikee hícantiitu. Taakaataak akee áyiin eesuke kaakitoo kiti wiiñ, náakink ko, naawak toko ékaacuma wiiñ, naalut la efinkasiiŋo kápuwasum kaakit ka. Fiye náaluwaas kaakit ka ti pakakee píhina, naakaay kaakaawool ti mikee mah. <verse eid="MAT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34" />Ta hisaatu ha níhituuniye ta, naapoñ pimiikan pa pakateyoo ti púluwaasa pa kati kawufanoo putum pa piteyoo ti pasaatal pa. <verse eid="MAT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35" />Pale púluwaasa pa nkacok pimiikan pa pakateyoo, nkasap akee ya, nkamuk akee ya, <char style="w" lemma="Kaanunkal">nkanunkal</char> akee ya.<verse eid="MAT 21:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36" />“Fiye, ati kaakit ka nene apoñ teyii pakakee pimiikan keehaŋe pameeŋ pákayaañ paka. Púluwaasa pa nkáhinii moonool muu.<verse eid="MAT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37" />“Ti pikelan, ati kaakit ka naapoñ teyii añiinoo, naasokoolo: 'Efíkatuul añiinam.' <verse eid="MAT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38" />Pale ta púluwaasa pa nkacuke ta añii ya, nkasokool: 'Aha aŋa akaakaay ya hitoonu kaakit ka. Níkey, umukoo ancuk kaakit ka kiyeniyaa kutuunaa.' <verse eid="MAT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39" />Fiye nkacokoo, nkawantoo tíkitaaŋ kaakit ka, nkamukoo.”<verse eid="MAT 21:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40" />Fiye, Yéesu naasok: “Ooto niŋ ati kaakit ka ákeyyoo, puume naakaakaay íhinu púluwaasa pa payenkuu?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41" />
    <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">Ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakati pakan paka nkañahanoo: “Afaamuk pikanca pa payenkuu púŋooti. Fiye náaluwaas kaakit ka pakakee píhina payenka efikawufanoo putum pa piteyoo ti papukal pa niŋ hisaatu ha hítuuniyaa.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42" />Yéesu naasokii: “Fo nitaapala nikalaŋ heekiicee ha ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> nii:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="qt">'Enánkiin ya eyya puluta pa nkawante ya</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="qt">éyenoonii énankiin ya eehaŋe ya hitaaku nafaa.</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="qt">Eehe <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa áhine ho,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 21:42">
    <char style="qt">níhisuum kaasincan meemak'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:42 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Kícimu 118:22-23</ref>
      </char>
    </note>?”<verse eid="MAT 21:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43" />Yéesu nene asok: “Ekina ewune inci insok aluu nii, <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> eficisayee ti aluu inciwufanee pakan payenka ammeya nii, eloŋ ya eteyii efeetaak papukal péesuume Pútuun pa. <verse eid="MAT 21:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44" />An óo an eenowe ti énankiin eyyuu afaahumaloolee; an óo an aŋa neenowe teyoo afaatuncaloolee.”<verse eid="MAT 21:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45" />Ta ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa nkásiye ta kícantiitu ka kiteyoo, nkámeyi nii Yéesu kiteyii naayeniye hisoku. <verse eid="MAT 21:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46" />Nkálafiyoo hicoku, pale nkafe kayoŋ ka kamma pakan paka nkacoke Yéesu nii <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char>.<verse eid="MAT 21:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22" />
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu hiti keeyonkalee pahaaño piti esa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1" />Púful toko, Yéesu nene ákup niŋ kícantiitu, naasok: <verse eid="MAT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2" />“<char style="w">Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> cinakoolaa-nakool nii amansa eesiiŋane pahaaño esa ya eti akampaani ya ateyoo, naamemanool waah óo waah. <verse eid="MAT 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3" />Naapoñ pimiikan pa pakateyoo kapica kásokii keeyonkalee ka pahaaño pa kati kákey, pale nkapook ékey.<verse eid="MAT 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4" />“Nene apoñ pakakee ti pimiikan pa pakateyoo kapusok keeyonkalee ka nii: 'Nisincan, pahaaño pa pucolaa, káciim ka nkimemanoolee. Kíciin ka kutoom kitaaŋeetaaŋ, niŋ lompo síis sa seenonke sa. Waah óo waah nuumemanoolee. Níkey pahaaño pa.'<verse eid="MAT 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5" />“Pale kapaaliitii nkakaay haaciyii: pakakee ti ukit, pakakee paka kaanooman. <verse eid="MAT 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6" />Pakakee paka nkacok pimiikan pa pakateyoo nkakallanii nkamukii. <verse eid="MAT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7" />Amansa ya náañiken. Naapoñ pusoocaali pa pakateyoo kapumukal pumukala pa payenkuu, nkasowan saatee ya eteyii.<verse eid="MAT 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8" />“Fiye naasok pimiikan pa pakateyoo: 'Pahaaño pa pucolaa, pale payenka inci iyyonkale ka kaneetaat keeñaŋee kaayonkal. <verse eid="MAT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9" />Fiye nikaay ti ñítin ña ínniyonkalii an óo an aŋa innicuke ápikey pahaaño pa.' <verse eid="MAT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10" />Pimiikan pa nkakaay ti ñítin ña nkaconcenool pakan paka payenka nkacuke ka púlooŋ, keenape ka niŋ keenaput ka. Ekáap ya eti pahaaño pa neemeeŋ pakan.<verse eid="MAT 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11" />“Pale ta amansa ya naanakiye ta kati asincan kéeyonkaliyee ka, naacuk toko akee áyiin eewasiit wañ weeñaŋee puwaso ti esa. <verse eid="MAT 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12" />Naacakanoo: 'Awíyam, puume ayyina énakoonii le aapeewasiit wañ uti esa?' Pale áyiin a naafatan. <verse eid="MAT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13" />Fiye amansa ya naasok píhina pa: 'Nicenk sipeesoo niŋ wootoo, inniwantoo tíkitaaŋ pati énimaan ya, toko efitaak pukooŋ niŋ kaafincool úŋiiŋ.'”<verse eid="MAT 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14" />Yéesu nene asok: “Kaatuko keeyonkalee ka kameeŋaameeŋ, pale keemamalee ka kameeŋut.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kacakan ka kiti cooy kúncoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15" />Púful toko, pakakee <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa nkáful nkaconcoolo kapiteŋenool fa efikakuuc Yéesu ti pákupaloo. <verse eid="MAT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16" />Nkapoñ teyoo pinapana pa pakateyii niŋ pakakee ti kayoŋ ka kiti ati hikaw ha <char style="w">Helot</char>, nkasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, unii úmeyimeyi nii awe asoka tooñaa, apan ti pánipani ya ankalaŋan pítin pa piti Pútuun pa. Aapaaliyantoo eeha an afaasok kaatuko aasincanantoo ti sicaw. <verse eid="MAT 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17" />Fiye, sok unii, eeheyme ámmiiloole ti eehe: Fo cooneecoon fo coonutee upucooy kúncoo ya amansa ya enfakat a ati <char style="w">Room</char>?” <verse eid="MAT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18" />Pale Yéesu náameyi heenaput eeha nkáninkoole ha, naasokii: “Aluu ñícuf! Weyme inniyem ti hiŋes hikuucuyam? <verse eid="MAT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19" />Níyisanam mañ emma innicooy ma nemmo kúncoo ya.” Nkácoopiyoo mañ. <verse eid="MAT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20" />Naacakanii: “Puhooŋu niŋ caacaw ayme kayem toko?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21" />Nkañahanoo: “Piti amansa ya enfakat a.” Fiye naasokii: “Ooto, niwufan amansa ya waah wa uteyoo, inniwufan Pútuun pa waah etempo.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22" />Ta nkásiye ta eehuu, nkaŋaŋo, nkakatanoo nkakaay.<verse eid="MAT 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pusatusaay pa niŋ pilito pa ti eket ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23" />Ti oom hinoom, pakakee <char style="w" lemma="Asatusaay">Pusatusaay</char> nkákey ti Yéesu. Pusatusaay pa káyinanut ti élitoonii ya eti keekete ka. Nkacakanoo: <verse eid="MAT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24" />“Ahámpaatiin, <char style="w">Móyiis</char> akiicaakiic ti <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> nii: niŋ áyiin asayaa aal naaket peetaakut añii, atuwoo añaŋaa hitoonu aal a, naataak neyoo epuuk pakati púnuwoo eekete ya kati ataak cánkut.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5-6">Kakaman 25:5-6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25" />Fiye, intaako hínum le toonii ti miin moonool pákayiin isak niŋ pákasupak. Ayáañ a naasa naaket peetaakut añii, atuwoo naatoon aal a. <verse eid="MAT 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26" />Hoonool huu nihitaako ásupiyenu ya niŋ áhaaciyenu ya, pikaay fo ti eewase ya isak niŋ pákasupak. <verse eid="MAT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27" />Ti pikelan, aal a naaket. <verse eid="MAT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28" />Fiye, hinak ti pilito pa ti eket ya, aal a aŋuu ati ayme, páawoo isak ya niŋ pákasupak paka púlooŋ kasayoo?”<verse eid="MAT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Aluu nicaakoolaa-caakool faŋ aluu kamma ínnimiit <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> niŋ fotom sempe etempo. <verse eid="MAT 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30" />Ti hinoom ha ta keekete ka nkakaakaayee ta élitaniyee ti eket ya, etikasa, etikanimo, pale efikaloŋ samat nii <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">pumaleekoo</char> pa peeyem pa alacana. <verse eid="MAT 22:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31" />Pale kiti élitoonii ya ti eket ya: fo nikalaŋut eeha Pútuun pa mpusoke ha aluu, pusok: <verse eid="MAT 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32" /><char style="qt">'Inci yem Pútuun pa piti <char style="w">Abraham</char>, Pútuun pa piti <char style="w">Isaak</char> niŋ Pútuun pa piti <char style="w">Jakob</char>.'</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Efúlii 3:6</ref></char></note> Pútuun pa pineetaat piti keekete ka pale piti keeloŋe ka.”<verse eid="MAT 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33" />Ta kayoŋ ka nkísiye ta eehuu, ínnimii ti kakalaŋan ka kiteyoo.<verse eid="MAT 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kacakan ka kiti hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha heehaŋe ha hitaaku nafaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34" />Fiye, ta <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa nkásiye ta nii Yéesu acotaacot ñutum <char style="w" lemma="Asatusaay">Pusatusaay</char> pa, nkaconcoolo nkakaay teyoo. <verse eid="MAT 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35" />Akee teyii, áhampaatiin ati <char style="w">hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char>, naaŋes hikuucuyoo niŋ kacakan enke: <verse eid="MAT 22:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36" />“Ahámpaatiin, ti hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha, eeheyme hilim hihaŋe hitaaku nafaa?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37-38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37-38" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Hilim ha híyaañ ha nihihaŋ hitaaku nafaa hiyem: <char style="qt">Láfi <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa pitii ti himuumi púlooŋ, ti kunuuwi púlooŋ, ti yaani púlooŋ</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37-38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">Kakaman 6:5</ref></char></note> niŋ ti ecohatoyi púlooŋ. <verse eid="MAT 22:37-38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39" />Hísupiyenu ha heetaake ha nafaa nihicuk nii híyaañ ha, hiyem: <char style="qt">Láfi akinooli samat nii fa állafiye fa faŋi.</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lewitik 19:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="MAT 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40" />Hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha púlooŋ niŋ kilim ka kiti <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa ti kilim kúsupak enke nkínintooliye.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eenucee ya ati Pútuun pa, añii ati ayme?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41" />Fiye, páawoo <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa kaconcoolaa-concoolo toko, Yéesu naacakanii: <verse eid="MAT 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42" />“Weyme ínnimiiloole kiti <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa? Añii ati miin ma miti ayme?” Nkañahanoo: “Añii ya ati <char style="w">Dawid</char>.” <verse eid="MAT 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43" />Yéesu naasokii: “Ooto weyme uwune ta infiyye <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char> nkútunk Dawid apiyonkaloo 'Ateeteyo'? Kaatuko asok:<verse eid="MAT 22:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44" />
    <char style="qt">'<char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa púkupaakup niŋ Ateeteyo atoom ti hisoku:</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 22:44">
    <char style="qt">Kéy yeniyam epees yáali,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 22:44">
    <char style="qt">fo ta inci fatah ta pikamooli ti wooti ayyeno amansa ya ateyii.'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:44 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 110:1">Kícimu 110:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="MAT 22:44" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45" />“Dawid himuumoo nayonkal Eenucee ya 'Ateeteyo', puume akina áfaayini piyeno añii ati Dawid.” <verse eid="MAT 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46" />An ayinaatoo kañahan háati hilim hoonool. Písik ti hinoom eehuu, an áhaañiyantoo nene kacakanoo.<verse eid="MAT 22:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23" />
  <para style="s">Káwasum pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha niŋ Pufalisaay pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1" />Fiye Yéesu naasok kayoŋ ka niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo: <verse eid="MAT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2" />“<char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char> niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa, páhinii piyem káacenkin hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha hiti Móyiis. <verse eid="MAT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3" />Ooto niñaŋaa hítuulu ínnihin eeha púlooŋ nkasok ha aluu, pale timpi níyipenan pawenalii. Kaatuko káhinantoo eeha nkátuunan ha. <verse eid="MAT 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4" />Nkacenkcenk pitiyo peenapa líŋ nkanaŋ po ti úpantu pakan paka, pale kálafiyantoo káaseepin háati cisiik coonool kapiyankananii ti pitiyo pa.<verse eid="MAT 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5" />“Waah óo waah ewwa nkáhin uti éyisanoolo nii kacokaacok ti Pútuun pa. Mikeesoo ma miteyii miti <char style="w" lemma="Hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa">pakiical pa piti Pútuun pa</char>, emma nkacenk ma ti píyitii niŋ ti sipeesii, nkáhinhin miteyii ma mipihaŋ pafom miti pakakee paka. Ñípin ña ñeelenteŋale ña ñiti kúsool ka kenfakat ka kiteyii nkáhinhin ño ñipihaŋ pahaan ñiti pakakee paka. <figure style="fig" file="HK00274B.TIF" size="col" ref="23:5">Nkacenk ti píyitii mikeesoo meetaake páhantuwa etemmo pakiical pa piti Pútuun pa.</figure> <verse eid="MAT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6" />Poko nkálafi piyeno ti kúkon ka keenape ka ti hili ha henfakat ha niŋ ti <char style="w" lemma="Elúumuma">púluumuma</char> pa. <verse eid="MAT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7" />Nkálafi lompo kapinkakicanee pinapnap ti kíliŋ ka, nkálafi pakan paka kati nkayonkalii 'Rabi'.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ekina eyem: Akalaŋana eemaka ati hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha hiti Móyiis</char></note><verse eid="MAT 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8" />“Pale aluu, timpi nikat kapinkayonkal aluu 'Rabi', kaatuko aluu Akalaŋana oonool lamma innitaake, apan aluu púlooŋ pakoonool ti káyinan. <verse eid="MAT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9" />Timpi niyonkal an ti etaam eyye 'Paapaa', kaatuko Paapaa oonool lamma innitaake, aŋa eeyem a alacana. <verse eid="MAT 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10" />Timpi nikat kapinkayonkal aluu lompo 'Ñíhampaatiin', kaatuko aluu Ahámpaatiin oonool lamma innitaake, akina ayem <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa. <verse eid="MAT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11" />Eemaka ya ti aluu añaŋaa piyeno áhina ya ataaluu. <verse eid="MAT 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12" />An óo an eesilanooliye áfaawananiyee, an óo an eewananooliye afaasilanee.”<verse eid="MAT 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kúnuul isak niŋ kúsupak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13" />Fiye Yéesu nene asok: “Kúnuul efikiyeno ti aluu <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char> niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa. Aluu ñícuf! Kaatuko innipankpank hunkut ha hiti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char>. Aluu faŋ aluu ninakiit lupo, nikatanut kéelafiye ka pinako.” <verse eid="MAT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14" />[<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">An ámiit man Máciya lompo akiice fiye: Kúnuul efikiyeno ti aluu pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha niŋ Pufalisaay pa. Aluu ñícuf! Kamma aluu innicaakool piyaaŋat pa payenka pákayiinii keekete ka, kati nicoop waah wa uteyii púlooŋ. Apan niŋ niyeniyaa kaluum innifiyo kati kacok aluu nii pakan keenape. Pútuun pa efipisap aluu pihaŋ pakakee paka.</char></note>]<verse eid="MAT 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15" />“Kúnuul efikiyeno ti aluu pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha niŋ Pufalisaay pa. Aluu ñícuf! Kaatuko innikaawool-kaawool etaam ya niŋ kaatii ka kati nitaak an oonool eenanfe ti pítin pa piti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa. Niŋ nitaakoo, ínnihinoo an eeñaŋe pikaayu ti seemak pihaŋ aluu fo ñésupak.<verse eid="MAT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16" />“Kúnuul efikiyeno ti aluu kéefuume ka keeyem ka ti kátintiŋan pakakee paka! Kaatuko innisoksok: 'Niŋ an asintooliyaa ti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>, cokantoo, pale niŋ an asintooliyaa ti sanoo ya eti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya, cokaacok.' <verse eid="MAT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17" />Aluu pusoŋ kéefuume! Weyme uhaŋe nafaa, fo sanoo ya, niŋ fotom ekumpaan ya enfakat ya éehine ya sanoo ya episampanee? <verse eid="MAT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18" />Innisoksok lompo: 'Niŋ an asintooliyaa ti <char style="w">kaaciin</char> ka, cokantoo, pale niŋ an asintooliyaa ti kaawaaseen ka keeyem ka ti kaaciin ka, cokaacok.' <verse eid="MAT 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19" />Aluu ñúfuumafuum! Weyme uhaŋe nafaa, fo kaawaaseen ka, niŋ fotom kaaciin ka kéehine ka kaawaaseen ka kipisampanee? <verse eid="MAT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20" />An óo an eesintooliye ti kaaciin ka, asintoolaa-sintoolo ti kaaciin ka niŋ ti waah óo waah weeyem tenko. <verse eid="MAT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21" />An óo an eesintooliye ti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya, asintoolaa-sintoolo ti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya niŋ ti Pútuun pa peekine pa toko. <verse eid="MAT 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22" />An óo an eesintooliye ti alacana, asintoolaa-sintoolo ti <char style="w">elemeyu</char> ya eti Pútuun pa niŋ ti Pútuun pa peeyeniye pa teyyo.<verse eid="MAT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23" />“Kúnuul efikiyeno ti aluu pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha niŋ Pufalisaay pa. Aluu ñícuf! Kaatuko inniwufanufan Pútuun pa himpaac ha heewase ha ŋaasuwan ti waah wa wenkilis wa, samat nii naanaa, micempanu niŋ típaapikeen. Pale innikat weehaŋe wa hitaaku nafaa ti hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha: niñaŋaa íhinu kíiti <char style="w">pucoonool</char>, innitaak paket hikaw apan innicok piliit<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: innitaak káyinan</char></note> ti Pútuun pa. Eehuu inniñaŋe íhinu peekatut ukee wa. <verse eid="MAT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24" />Aluu kéefuume ka keeyem ka ti kátintiŋan pakakee paka, innisinteel man ma nípifulanii epuk pale innimelan ñonkomoo!<verse eid="MAT 23:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25" />“Kúnuul efikiyeno ti aluu pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha niŋ Pufalisaay pa. Aluu ñícuf! Kaatuko innikuulan-kuulan tíkitaaŋ elontoŋ ya niŋ epulaatu ya, pale páhantuwa etempo immeeŋ niŋ waah ewwa innilame wa ti kincaakool pakan niŋ ti káacocokanooliyaati aluu. <verse eid="MAT 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26" />Awe Afalisaay éefuume! Tíkin kuulan weeyem wa páhantuwa elontoŋ ya niŋ epulaatu ya ancuk tíkitaaŋ lompo kuulaa.<verse eid="MAT 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27" />“Kúnuul efikiyeno ti aluu pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha niŋ Pufalisaay pa. Aluu ñícuf! Kaatuko inninakool-nakool nii kiyaak kéehiiniyanee niŋ pentuloo. Nkúwalli tíkitaaŋ pale páhantuwa immeeŋ niŋ picec puhunuŋ niŋ waah óo waah weekuulut. <verse eid="MAT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28" />Fiyuu lompo innicuke, tíkitaaŋ inninakool-nakool nii pakan keecoonoole apan páhantuwa aluu innimeeŋ niŋ écufato niŋ pakanc.<verse eid="MAT 23:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29" />“Kúnuul efikiyeno ti aluu pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha niŋ Pufalisaay pa. Aluu ñícuf! Kaatuko innilutlut kiyaak ka kiti <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa, ínniwalliyanool kiyaak ka kiti keecoonoole ka, <verse eid="MAT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30" />innisok: 'Niŋ unii utantake caanak ca citi ñífaaf unii, utuunaŋo teyii upuniis hísim piyaamakoola pa.' <verse eid="MAT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31" />Fiyuu aluu faŋ aluu inniyem ti káyisan nii aluu niyem epuuk keemuke ka piyaamakoola pa. <verse eid="MAT 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32" />Aca! Nihankan eeha ñífaaf aluu nkáyaañe ha!<verse eid="MAT 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33" />“Aluu pupululoola! Aluu mifepa emmuu! Puume inniyina hifaku kúnuul ka kiti seemak sa? <verse eid="MAT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34" />Ooto nísiitan! Eehuu ewune inci inkaakaay époñii aluu piyaamakoola, keecohatiye niŋ pikalaŋana. Aluu efinimuk pakakee paka, innipempeŋ pakakee paka ti <char style="w">kuluwaa</char>, pakakee paka innisapii niŋ kisawut ti púluumuma pa pitaaluu, inniwawantanii ti saatee óo saatee. <verse eid="MAT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35" />Fiyuu hísim ha hiti keecoonoole ka heeniisiye ha ti etaam ya efihinaŋee ti aluu. Písikii ti hísim ha hiti <char style="w">Abel</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 4:8">Púcook 4:8</ref></char></note> eecoonoole ya fo ti hísim ha hiti Sakaliya,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:20-22">2 Heetaakiye 24:20-22</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 1:1">Sakaliya 1:1</ref></char></note> Palaki añiinoo, aŋa innimuke ya ti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya, ti pututa la haŋee la kaasampan niŋ kaaciin ka. <verse eid="MAT 23:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36" />Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, eehuu fiye púlooŋ efihinaŋee ti hikaw <char style="w">ekaay</char> eyye.<verse eid="MAT 23:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37" />“Oo <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, Jerusalem, aluu payenka innimukal ka piyaamakoola pa <char style="w" lemma="Kaanunkal">inninunkal</char> payenka Pútuun pa mpúpoñii ka ti aluu, ñiyema puume íllafiye kati concenool epuuk aluu nantoonool samat nii fa ekutoon neconcenool fa mufuun eteyyo ti úpitu eteyyo. Pale nicoonut. <verse eid="MAT 23:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38" />Nísiitan, ekumpaan ya etaaluu efeekatanee ñaanii. <verse eid="MAT 23:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39" />Kaatuko inci pusok aluu, etinene nicukam fo hinak ta efinisok ta: 'Alímaati <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa pisampan éekeyii ya ti caacaw etempo.'”<verse eid="MAT 23:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24" />
  <para style="s">Yéesu kakaman ka kiteyoo kiti heekaakaay ékey</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1" />Púful toko, Yéesu náaful ti hank ha hiti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char> apiyeno pikaayu, pinapana pa pakateyoo nkalohoo nkáyisanoo palutal pa piti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya. <verse eid="MAT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2" />Pale naasokii: “Nicukaacuk kiniŋ enkuu púlooŋ? Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, an atacuk énankiin eenaŋiye ti ekee, efipitahalee púlooŋ.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3" />Púful toko, Yéesu naayeno ti cítintiŋ ca enca nkasok ca Olif, pinapana pa pakateyoo nkakaay teyoo lamayii nkasokoo: “Sok unii, eehuu, teyme nihikaakaay pitaako? Weyme efuuyeno píyisan pa piti ékey ya etii niŋ piti pikelan caanak ence?”<verse eid="MAT 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Nisiiŋo púsooni, an timpi acaakool aluu. <verse eid="MAT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5" />Kaatuko hícump pakan éfikakey ti caacawam kapusok: 'Inci yem <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa!' Efikacaakool hícump pakan. <verse eid="MAT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6" />Efínisi kiti kikam niŋ káacamutool kikam, pale timpi niliim kaatuko eehuu hiñaŋaa pitaako, pale pikelan caanak ence puloot púcolii. <verse eid="MAT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7" />Mah éfimitaakoolan mah, cáwii íncitaakoolan cáwii. Efitaako púpankul niŋ páyiyiŋanal etaam pan óo pan. <verse eid="MAT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8" />Pale eehuu púlooŋ hicukaacuk nii púcook ñíseeña ñiti hipuku.<verse eid="MAT 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9" />“Ti oom caanak, pakan paka púlooŋ efikanat aluu kamma inci. Efikacok aluu, nkakallan aluu, nkamuk aluu. <verse eid="MAT 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10" />Fiye, hícump pakan éfikaful ti káyinan ka kiteyii, nkáful ti pakakee paka, nkanatool. <verse eid="MAT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11" />Hícump keeneetaat ka <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pánipani éfikafulii nkacaakool hícump pakan. <verse eid="MAT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12" />Heenaput ha efihihaŋ toko, ekina ewune pálafi pa piti pakan keemeeŋe mpikaakaay ékaasino. <verse eid="MAT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13" />Pale, an óo an eemukute fo ti pikelan afaafakanee. <verse eid="MAT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14" />Ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eyye eti <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> éfeetuunanee ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> púlooŋ, ancuk pakan paka púlooŋ kásiyaa yo. Tempo, pikelan caanak ence éfipikey.<verse eid="MAT 24:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15" />“Ta infiyye, ayaamakoola ya Dañel naasoke nii waah weenaput efuusiiŋanee la sampanee la, ewwa efuuwun ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa néeful ti pakuul eteyyo.” (Eekalaŋe eehe añaŋaa hísiyu!) “Niŋ nicukaa eehuu, <verse eid="MAT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16" />keeyem ka ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Judaay</char> kañaŋaa katey pati pítintiŋ pa. <verse eid="MAT 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17" />Aŋa eeyem patiila piteefu ekumpaan timpi áwanoonii apinako páhantuwa hicoopu waah. <verse eid="MAT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18" />Aŋa eekaaye piya, añaŋut puñoho t’enuuf hicoopu hísool ha hiteyoo henfakat ha. <verse eid="MAT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19" />Kunoom enkuu efikiyeno keeseeñe ti pakaal paka keeyem ka niŋ munow niŋ keeyem ka ti káacuuwan! <verse eid="MAT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20" />Niluum Pútuun pa katey ka kitaaluu timpi hitaako ti caanak citi pamon niŋ fotom <char style="w">hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</char>. <verse eid="MAT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21" />Kaatuko ti oom caanak efitaak kúnuul kenfakat keetaapala kitaako kápiliŋ púcook púlunta pa fo fíyooy. Apan etinene hitaako. <verse eid="MAT 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22" />Niŋ Pútuun pa pucoonut hínum káakaasin kunoom enkuu, an atafak, pale kunoom enkuu éfikikaasinee kamma payenka mpimamale ka. <verse eid="MAT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23" />Ti oom caanak, timpi níyinan an eesoke aluu 'Nisincan, ehe Eenucee ya ati Pútuun pa!' niŋ fotom, 'Ahaayoo pa!' <verse eid="MAT 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24" />Kaatuko pakakee éfikakey kapucokoolo nii Eenucee ya niŋ fotom piyaamakoola, éfikahin píyisan niŋ weecukantee kati kacaakool háati keemamalee ka, niŋ éfihiyini pitaako. <verse eid="MAT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25" />Nisincan, sokaasok ho aluu le niŋ efihitaako.<verse eid="MAT 24:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26" />“Fiye, niŋ an asokaa aluu: 'Aha Eenucee ya pati <char style="w">káahaaŋ ka tes</char>,' timpi nikaay po, niŋ fotom 'Eheeyoo le ti ékaap ye,' timpi níyinan ho. <verse eid="MAT 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27" />Kaatuko inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, éfikey samat nii fa pamaliñoolal etiil námaliñoolii fa pa caanak ca íncifulii pa fo pa incinow pa. <verse eid="MAT 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28" />Lan óo lan la ehunuŋ neeyem, toko píketul pa mpuconcool.<verse eid="MAT 24:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29" />“Emma kúnuul ka kiti kunoom enkuu efikipa ma,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">
    <char style="qt">caanak ca éficiniman,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">
    <char style="qt">hiim ha etihicaaŋ;</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 24:29">
    <char style="qt">picaaŋaŋ pa éfipunowii púpufulii patiila,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 24:29">
    <char style="qt">sempe óo sempe siti patiila ínsiyiyiŋan.</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:29 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 13:10">Esayi 13:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 34:4">34:4</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Sowel 2:10</ref></char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="MAT 24:29" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30" />“Tempo, píyisan pa piti inci, Añii An, éfipufulii patiila. Fiye písii pa púlooŋ piti púlunta pa efipiyeno esampoolo. Efipucuk inci, Añii An, ti éfulii ti útiŋu wa uti patiila niŋ sempe niŋ hamake henfakat. <verse eid="MAT 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31" />Kámpiis kenfakat efikusok, inci ímpoñii <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">pumaleekoo</char> pa putoom ti púlunta pa púlooŋ, mpuconcoolan payenka inci immamale ka písik ti kaapii koonool kiti púlunta pa fo ti kikee kaapii.<verse eid="MAT 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32" />“Fiye, nikalaŋ ti enuun sootoo ya: innicukaa unaay wa núucepenii, ínnimeyi nii etiil ya élohaniyoo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: pasowe pa púlohaniyoo</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 24:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33" />Fo lompo incuke, innicukaa eehe púlooŋ ti pitaako, ínnimeyi nii ékey ya eti inci, Añii An, élohanii<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: caanak ca cílohiyooloh</char></note> tokofiye. <verse eid="MAT 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34" />Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, <char style="w">ekaay</char> eyye etepa eket ekina peecukut enke fiye púlooŋ nkitaakiye. <verse eid="MAT 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35" />Patiila niŋ t’etaam éfikacim, pale kilim ka kutoom étikicim.<verse eid="MAT 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36" />“Pale kiti hinoom eehuu niŋ waati ya an ámiit ho, háati <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">pumaleekoo</char> pa peeyem pa alacana, focaa inci Añii ya, pale Paapaa ya lamma ameya.<verse eid="MAT 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37" />“Samat nii fa intaakiye fa ti caanak ca citi Nowe,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 6-9">Púcook 6–9</ref></char></note> fo lompo inkaakaay pitaako ti ékey ya eti inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>. <verse eid="MAT 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38" />Kaatuko ti kunoom enkuu le niŋ kaahootan ka, pakan paka nkayeno hili, pálaani, esa niŋ pinimo fo ti hinoom eeha Nowe náayuukiye ha ti piteen pa penfakat pa; <verse eid="MAT 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39" />kámiit heekaakaay ha pitaako fo ta kaahootan ka nkíkeyii ta nkucoopii púlooŋ. Fo lompo facuk ti ékey ya eti inci, Añii An.<verse eid="MAT 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40" />“Tempo pákayiin pákasupak efikayeno ti kaakit; oonool áfaaseepinee, akee ya naakatee toko. <verse eid="MAT 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41" />Pakaal pákasupak efikayeno pútuum ti ésiken yoonool; oonool áfaaseepinee, akee ya naakatee toko.<verse eid="MAT 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42" />“Ooto nitowo ti kaasincan, kamma ínnimiit hinoom eeha <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> ataaluu áfaakey. <verse eid="MAT 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43" />Pale nímeyi eehe: niŋ ati ekumpaan ya ameya teyme álipa ya naakaakaay ékey hánant, anti atowo ti kaasincan atakat ekumpaan ya eteyoo epihaatee. <verse eid="MAT 24:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44" />Ekina ewune aluu lompo nisiiŋo púsooni kaatuko inci, Añii An, éfikey ti waati eyya étinininkoolam.<verse eid="MAT 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45" />“Ooto, ayme ayem amiikan a eehintiyee ya, naacohato, aŋa áhampaatiin a naañomane páhin pa piti ekumpaan ya kati ápaacinool paliyal pa pakakee pimiikan pa niŋ caanak ca cítuuniyaa? <verse eid="MAT 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46" />Amiikan a aŋuu, niŋ áhampaatiin a áñohooniyoo, náatookiyoo ti oom páhin, áfaanapiyanee. <verse eid="MAT 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47" />Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, afaañomanoo hitaaku ha hiteyoo púlooŋ. <verse eid="MAT 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48" />Pale niŋ amiikan a eenaput a aŋuu asokooliyaa, 'Ahámpaatiin a atoom áfiyooniyoo,' <verse eid="MAT 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49" />fiye náayaañ hisapu pákawiyoo pimiikan, naayeno hili niŋ pálaani niŋ ñúkumana. <verse eid="MAT 24:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50" />Ahámpaatiin a ati amiikan a aŋuu áfaañohoonii ti hinoom eeha náaninkoolutee ha niŋ ti waati eyya náamiit. <verse eid="MAT 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51" />Afaakallan meemak amiikan a aŋuu, naayenanoo pati ñícuf ña, la efiyeno pukooŋ niŋ kaafincool úŋiiŋ.”<verse eid="MAT 24:51" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25" />
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu hiti púmaacul ŋaasuwan pítiŋana amaañoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1" />Yéesu nene asok: “Tempo, <char style="w">cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> eficinakool nii púmaacul ŋaasuwan keeyem ti kátiŋan amaañoo, keecoope pilampi pa piteyii nkáful kapuwant kapaakoolan asaya ya. <verse eid="MAT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2" />Teyii intaako isak keesoŋatiye niŋ isak keecohatiye. <verse eid="MAT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3" />Isak ya keesoŋatiye ka nkacoop pilampi pa piteyii pale kacoopoolut kálasiina.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Yéesu asok: lúuliin olif. Ti caanak ca citi Yéesu, lúuliin olif immicaaŋan pilampi pa piteyii.</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4" />Isak ya keecohatiye ka nkacoopool kálasiina niŋ pilampi pa piteyii. <verse eid="MAT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5" />Asaya ya náafiyoonii, fiye poko púlooŋ nkaŋoyal nkalam hiŋotu.<verse eid="MAT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6" />“Mpisit pa akee náaceekii: 'Ehe asaya ya! Nífulii kapaakoolanoo!' <verse eid="MAT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7" />Fiye púmaacul pa ŋaasuwan ya nkáyiyo nkamemanool pilampi pa piteyii. <verse eid="MAT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8" />Isak ya keesoŋatiye ka nkasok isak ya keecohatiye ka: 'Niwun unii ti kálasiina ya etaaluu; pilampi pa putoonii umpa ti puhoko.' <verse eid="MAT 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9" />Pale keecohatiye ka nkañahanii: 'Haani! Etifom unaa púlooŋ. Nikaay pati punoomana pa ínninoomii faŋ aluu.' <verse eid="MAT 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10" />Isak ya keesoŋatiye ka nkakaay hinoom kálasiina ya, asaya ya náacolii pusonii. Isak ya keepaye ka ememanoolo nkanako neyoo lati pahaaño pa piti pinimo pa, hunkut ha nihipankee. <verse eid="MAT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11" />Po hátikin, isak ya keesoŋatiye ka nkácolii, nkasok: 'Ahámpaatiin, Ahámpaatiin, pánkin unii!' <verse eid="MAT 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12" />Pale naañahanii: 'Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, inci míit aluu.'”<verse eid="MAT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13" />Yéesu nene asokii: “Fiye, aluu lompo nitowo ti kaasincan, kamma ínnimiit hinoom ha niŋ fotom waati ya eyya inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, inkaakaay ya ékey.”<verse eid="MAT 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hícantiitu hiti pimiikan pákahaaciil</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14" />Yéesu nene asok: “<char style="w">Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa</char> eficinakool nii áyiin eeyem ti pítinoo piti kaakaawool, naayonkal pimiikan pa pakateyoo naañomanii hisaanumate ha hiteyoo. <verse eid="MAT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15" />Naawufan an óo an teyii ti waah ewwa naayina newwo páhin: áyaañ a sipootak sanoo isak, ásupiyenu ya sipootak sanoo súsupak, áhaaciyenu ya epootak sanoo yoonool. Fiye naakaay kaakaawool ka kiteyoo. <verse eid="MAT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16" />Ayíin a eewufanee ya sipootak sanoo isak, naakaay mpacas apiyesanool pisanoo pa, naataak sikee sipootak isak. <verse eid="MAT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17" />Eewufanee ya lompo sipootak sanoo súsupak, naayesanool so naataak sikee súsupak. <verse eid="MAT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18" />Pale áyiin a eewufanee ya epootak sanoo yoonool, naakaay naacaawak kaayeen ti etaam ya naayol epootak sanoo ya eti áhampaatiin a ateyoo.<verse eid="MAT 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19" />“Ta infiyye po hátikin, áhampaatiin a ati pimiikan pa payenkuu náañohoonii naacakanii puume nkáhine pisanoo pa piteyoo. <verse eid="MAT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20" />Ayíin a eewufanee ya sipootak sanoo isak náakey, náacoopii sikee sipootak sanoo isak. Naasokoo: 'Ahámpaatiin, sipootak sanoo isak aññomanaam. Sincan, inci taakaataak sikee isak.' <verse eid="MAT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21" />Ahámpaatiin a ateyoo naañahanoo: 'Aáhinaa kata, awe amiikan eenape eehintiyee! Aacoonoolaa-coonool niŋ waah wenkilis; inci fañomani hícump waah. Kéy páacinool ti pásuuma pa putoom.'<verse eid="MAT 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22" />“Ayíin a eewufanee ya sipootak sanoo súsupak lompo náakey, naasokoo: 'Ahámpaatiin, sipootak sanoo súsupak aññomanaam. Sincan, inci taakaataak sikee súsupak.' <verse eid="MAT 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23" />Ahámpaatiin a ateyoo naañahanoo: 'Aáhinaa kata, awe amiikan eenape eehintiyee! Aacoonoolaa-coonool niŋ waah wenkilis; inci fañomani hícump waah. Kéy páacinool ti pásuuma pa putoom.'<verse eid="MAT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24" />“Fiye, áyiin a eewufanee ya epootak sanoo yoonool náakey, naasok: 'Ahámpaatiin, inci méyimeyi nii awe áyiin eefete, ammaañmaañ la ansukut, apan inconcenool pamaañal empa awwiisut. <verse eid="MAT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25" />Inci feyaafe inkaay picaayol epootak sanoo ya etii ti etaam ya. Sincan, ehe sanoo ya etii.' <verse eid="MAT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26" />Ahámpaatiin a ateyoo naañahanoo: 'Awe amiikan eenaput inkuuñ! Iyyoo! Aámeyimeyi nii inci immaañmaañ la inci insukut, inconcenool pamaañal empa uwwiisut? <verse eid="MAT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27" />Ooto aañaŋaañaŋ himanku sanoo ya etoom ti émankuma mañ, ancuk niŋ inci ñóhooniyoo, insa yo niŋ waah weenanfe teyyo.'<verse eid="MAT 25:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28" />“Fiye naasok: 'Nicoop epootak sanoo ya eteyoo inniwufan yo aŋa eetaake ya sipootak ŋaasuwan. <verse eid="MAT 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29" />Kaatuko an óo an eetaake, afaapenanee, naataak fo muus. Pale, an óo an eetaakut, háati caahinkilis ya eyya naataake ya efeesayee teyoo. <verse eid="MAT 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30" />Fiye, niwant amiikan a aŋuu eetaakut a nafaa tíkitaaŋ ti énimaan ya, la efiyeno pukooŋ niŋ kaafincool úŋiiŋ.'”<verse eid="MAT 25:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kíiti ya ekelan ya.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31" />Yéesu nene asok: “Niŋ inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, kéyyoo ti hamakeyam, <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">pumaleekoo</char> pa púlooŋ niŋ inci, fayeno look ti <char style="w">elemeyu</char> ya etoom eemaka ya. <verse eid="MAT 25:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32" />Pakan paka púlooŋ pakati <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> efikaconcoolanee hátikinam, ínkatinool pakan paka samat nii fa afaasa nákatinool fa písaacii pa niŋ pifil pa. <verse eid="MAT 25:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33" />Fasiiŋan písaacii pa ti epeesam yáali, insiiŋan pifil pa ti epeesam yaamay.<verse eid="MAT 25:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34" />“Fiye inci Amansa ya fasok keeyem ka ti epeesam yáali: 'Aluu payenka Paapaa atoom naasampane ka, níkey innisa <char style="w" lemma="Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa">cáwii</char> ca ceememanoolee ca hak aluu kápiliŋ ta púlunta pa mpiliilee ta. <verse eid="MAT 25:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35" />Kaatuko peep pucokaamcok inniwunam pili, pálaani mpucokam inniwunam pilaan. Inci yenaayeno <char style="w">akaawoola</char>, inniwananam ti punuuf aluu. <verse eid="MAT 25:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36" />Iyyeno ñáfalfali ínnisoolam, ínkuuñ innimankoolam, iyyeno ti ékuluma ínnikeyyam hiyoop.'<verse eid="MAT 25:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37" />“Fiye, <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">keecoonoole</char> ka efikañahanam kapusok: 'Ateeteyo, teyme nuucukuu ti peep núukuumani, niŋ fotom pálaani mpucoki nuuwuni aapilaan? <verse eid="MAT 25:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38" />Teyme nuucukuu ayyeniye akaawoola nuuwanani ti punuuf unii, niŋ fotom ñáfalfali núusooli? <verse eid="MAT 25:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39" />Teyme nuucukuu ánkuuñe niŋ fotom ti ékuluma nuukaayi hiyoop?'<verse eid="MAT 25:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40" />“Inci Amansa ya fañahanii insokii: 'Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, waah óo waah ewwa ínnihine ti eehaŋe ya káataakaati nafaa ti pakanam, inci ínnihine wo.'<verse eid="MAT 25:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41" />“Fiye, fasok keeyem ka ti epeesam yaamay: 'Níful hátikinam, aluu keeñanee ka, nikaay ti seemak sa siti cancowiyaaw, seememanoolee sa hak <char style="w">Seetaani</char> ya niŋ pumaleekoo eteyyo. <verse eid="MAT 25:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42" />Kaatuko peep pucokaamcok niwunutam pili, pálaani mpucokam niwunutam pilaan. <verse eid="MAT 25:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43" />Inci yenaayeno akaawoola niwananutam ti punuuf aluu, iyyeno ñáfalfali nísoolutam, ínkuuñ iyyeno ti ékuluma niyankananutam.'<verse eid="MAT 25:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44" />“Fiye, efikañahanam nkasok: 'Ateeteyo, teyme nuucukuu ti peep niŋ fotom pálaani mpucoki niŋ fotom akaawoola niŋ fotom ñáfalfali niŋ fotom ti káakuuñu niŋ fotom ti ékuluma, uyankananuti?'<verse eid="MAT 25:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45" />“Inci Amansa ya fañahanii: 'Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, waah óo waah ewwa innipooke íhinu ti eehaŋe ya káataakaati nafaa, inci innipook wo íhinu.'<verse eid="MAT 25:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46" />“Fiye, efikakaay pa efikasiiŋanee ti pisiya fo cancowiyaaw, pale keecoonoole ka nkakaay ti eloŋ ya eepayantoo ya.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26" />
  <para style="s">Piteŋenool himuku Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1" />Ta Yéesu naapaye ta hisoku kilim enke púlooŋ, naasok pinapana pa pakateyoo: <verse eid="MAT 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2" />“Nímeyimeyi nii kunoom kúsupak kutowiye le niŋ pahaaño pa piti <char style="w">Himuusu ha</char>. Tempo, inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, fawufanee kati pempeŋee ti <char style="w">kuluwaa</char>.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3" />Ti oom waati lompo, <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakati pakan paka nkaconcoolo lati hank ha hiti awaaseena ya enfakat a aŋa nkasok a Kayif. <verse eid="MAT 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4" />Nkásiyool kati kacok Yéesu ti piyolo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: ti kincaakool</char></note> nkamukoo. <verse eid="MAT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5" />Pale nkasok: “Uñaŋutoo hicoku ti pahaaño pa piti Himuusu ha, ancuk pakan paka timpi kawen ti káñiken.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hinucuyee ha hiti Yéesu Betani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6" />Fiye, Yéesu naakaay ti cisaatee ca citi Betani. Naayeno ti ekumpaan ya eti Simon aŋa mpaataak ya <char style="w">kanuk</char> ka. <verse eid="MAT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7" />Yéesu naayeno hili ti taapul ya niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo. Ta nkayeniye ta toko, akee aal náakey teyoo niŋ cílumpa ceewalla kaameeŋ munucu méesuume haaw méeciita hinoom, naaniis mo ti hikaw Yéesu. <verse eid="MAT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8" />Ta pinapana pa nkacuke ta eehuu, inseeñii nkasok: “Káapucalool puume unke? <verse eid="MAT 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9" />Munucu emme anti munoomanee hícump mañ, oom mañ ummuwufanee keeleke ka.”<verse eid="MAT 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10" />Yéesu náameyi eeha nkayeniye ha hisoku, naasokii: “Weyme inniyem ti kayokan aal a aŋe? Heenape náahinaam. <verse eid="MAT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11" />Keeleke ka efikayeno niŋ aluu tan óo tan, pale inci etinitaakam tan óo tan. <verse eid="MAT 26:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12" />Aniisaaniis munucu emme ti eniinam kati amemanool ehok ya etoom. <verse eid="MAT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13" />Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, pan óo pan pa ekooŋan ya éesuume ya eyye néetuunanee ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> púlooŋ, eeha náahine ha efihisokee ancuk náanawuniyee.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judas hicoonu ha hiteyoo hífulu ti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14" />Púful toko, akee ti pupoñapoñ pa ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka, aŋa nkasok a Judas Iskaliyot, naakaay pati <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char>. <verse eid="MAT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15" />Naacakanii: “Niŋ inci ufanaa aluu Yéesu, weyme efiniwufanam?” Fiye, nkafin síkotifoloo siyema áwii niŋ ŋaasuwan (30), nkacooyoo. <verse eid="MAT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16" />Písik ti oom waati, Judas naayeno hiŋes káasiiŋuma keenape kati awufanii Yéesu.<verse eid="MAT 26:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káciim ka kiti Himuusu ha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17" />Hinoom ha híyaañ ha hiti pahaaño pa piti Kúmpuul ka keetaakut ka leweñoo, pinapana pa nkákey ti Yéesu, nkacakanoo: “Peyme állafiye upumemanool aakati li káciim ka kiti pahaaño pa piti <char style="w">Himuusu ha</char>?” <verse eid="MAT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18" />Naañahanii: “Nikaay ti saatee ya ti akee áyiin innisokoo, 'Ahámpaatiin a asok nii: caanak ca citoom cílohaniyoo. Inci fali káciim ka kiti Himuusu ha niŋ pinapana pa pakatoom ti ekumpaan ya etii.'” <verse eid="MAT 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19" />Fiye pinapana pa nkakaay, nkáhin eeha Yéesu naasokii ha, nkamemanool káciim ka kiti Himuusu ha.<verse eid="MAT 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20" />Ta ínciniimiye ta, Yéesu naayeno ti taapul ya niŋ pupoñapoñ pa ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka. <verse eid="MAT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21" />Poko ti hili naasokii: “Inci pusok aluu pánipani ya, akee ti aluu áfaaful ti inci.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22" />Pinapana pa ínciitiyii meemak, nkáyaañoo kacakan oonool oonool: “Ahámpaatiin, pale malla inci?” <verse eid="MAT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23" />Yéesu naañahanii: “Akee ti aluu eeliye ya niŋ inci ti púus pa áfaaful ti inci. <verse eid="MAT 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24" />Inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, faket samat nii fa inkiicee fa kutoom ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char>. Pale kúnuul efikiyeno ti aŋa éefule ya ti inci, Añii An! Efifisak fala ti áyiin a aŋuu niŋ apukutee.”<verse eid="MAT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25" />Fiye Judas, eekaakaay ya hífulu teyoo naasok: “Rabi, pale malla inci?” Yéesu naañahanoo: “Awe soke ho.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26" />Poko ti hili, Yéesu naacoop hímpuul, naasampan ho, naafiit ho, naawufan ho pinapana pa pakateyoo, naasok: “Nicoop nili, aŋe eyem eniinam.” <verse eid="MAT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27" />Fiye, naacoop elontoŋ eti elaan wiiñ, naasok Pútuun pa apalaka kiteyyo, naawufanii yo naasok: “Nilaan teyyo, aluu púlooŋ. <verse eid="MAT 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28" />Kaatuko aŋe hísimam héeyisane ha <char style="w">písiyool</char> pa piti Pútuun pa niŋ pakan etempo, heeniisee ha hak hícump pakan umuuyen wa uteyii kati uponketee. <verse eid="MAT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29" />Inci pusok aluu, etinene laan elaan wiiñ eyye fo ti hinoom ha ta inci inkaakaay ta pálaani éeyeeni niŋ aluu ti <char style="w" lemma="Cáwii ca citi Pútuun pa">cáwii</char> ca citi Paapaa atoom.” <verse eid="MAT 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30" />Fiye nkacook hícimu, nkáful kapikaay pati cítintiŋ ca enca nkasok ca Olif.<verse eid="MAT 26:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakaman ka kiti Yéesu pilaaco pa piti Piyeer</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31" />Púful toko, Yéesu naasok pinapana pa pakateyoo: “Heekaakaayam ha pitaako hánant eehe efihiwun, aluu púlooŋ efinikatanam. Kaatuko kiiceekiic ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> nii:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MAT 26:31">
    <char style="qt">'Inci famuk Afaasa ya,</char>
  </para>
  <para style="q2" vid="MAT 26:31">
    <char style="qt">písaacii pa piti koolee ya mpihancaloolo.'</char>
    <note caller="+" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">26:31 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Sakaliya 13:7</ref>
      </char>
    </note>
    <verse eid="MAT 26:31" />
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32" />“Pale niŋ inci lítaniyee ti eket ya, fátikin aluu <char style="w">Galilee</char>.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33" />
    <char style="w">Piyeer</char> naasokoo: “Háati an óo an naakatani, inci etikatani múk.” <verse eid="MAT 26:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Inci pusoki pánipani ya, hánant eehe, káayiin ekutoon kúlookum, áafalaacin fo ñáhaaciil nii áameyiyam-méyi.” <verse eid="MAT 26:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35" />Pale Piyeer naañahanoo: “Háati inci faket niŋ awe, inci étilaacini.” Pakakee pinapana pa púlooŋ nkasok moonool-moonool muu.<verse eid="MAT 26:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaluum ka kiti Yéesu Ketsemane</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36" />Púful toko, Yéesu naakaay niŋ pinapana pa pakateyoo la nkasok la Ketsemane, naasokii: “Niyeno le, inci inkaay paayee kaluum.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37" />Naacoopool <char style="w">Piyeer</char> niŋ <char style="w">Saak</char> niŋ <char style="w">Saŋ</char>, Sepete epuukoo pákasupak paka. Náayaañ hitaaku kúnuul niŋ páciite penfakat. <verse eid="MAT 26:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38" />Fiye naasokii: “Yaanam yoopiya emeeŋe niŋ kúnuul fo ti putum eket. Niyeno le ti kaasincan niŋ inci.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39" />Naateeŋo caahinkiŋ ápilaaŋii, náakilipo puhooŋuyoo t’etaam naaluum: “Paapaa atoom, niŋ eficoon, fúlan elontoŋ ya eti kúnuul enke ti inci, apan timpi yeno ti pálafi pa putoom, pale ti pitii pa.” <verse eid="MAT 26:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40" />Fiye náañohoonii peti pinapana pa pakateyoo, náatookiyii ti hiŋotu. Naasok Piyeer: “Fo niyinaat putowo ti kaasincan niŋ inci fo waati yoonool? <verse eid="MAT 26:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41" />Nisincan inniluum ancuk timpi ninow ti híluuŋu. Kunuu ka kílafilafi, pale enii ya néelakum.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42" />Naakaay púsupiyenu naaluum: “Paapaa atoom, niŋ coonut elontoŋ eyye kati éfulanee ti inci, fo taamanta inci laanut yo, álimaati eeha állafiye ha hitaako.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43" />Fiye, nene áñohoonii, naatookii ti hiŋotu, kamma ñíkinii iññinapa.<verse eid="MAT 26:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44" />Yéesu naakatanii, naakaay nene, naaluum píhaaciyenu, nene asok moonool muu. <verse eid="MAT 26:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45" />Fiye, naañoho pati pinapana pa, naasokii: “Nitowo luu ti hiŋotu niŋ éyekunoolo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: fo niloŋaa ti hiŋotu niŋ éyekunoolo?</char></note> Nisincan, waati ya écoliyoo, inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, ufanee ti sipees pumuuyena pa. <verse eid="MAT 26:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46" />Nilito! Ukaayaa! Ehe aŋa éefule ya ti inci, ácoliyoo!”<verse eid="MAT 26:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hicokuyee ha hiti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47" />Yéesu ti káakup, Judas, akee ti pupoñapoñ pa ŋaasuwan niŋ pákasupak paka, náacolii niŋ kayoŋ kenfakat kéeyekanii úkuntu niŋ kifiin. Payenkuu, <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakati pakan paka kápoñiyii. <verse eid="MAT 26:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48" />Judas, eekaakaay ya hífulu ti Yéesu, asokiisok nii: “Aŋa inci inkaakaay ya kaasumpool akina, nicokoo.” <verse eid="MAT 26:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49" />Judas naacoonool ciit pati Yéesu, naasokoo: “Rabi, kásuumaay!” Naasumpooloo. <verse eid="MAT 26:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Awíyam, hín eeha ánkeyii ha íhinu.” Fiye pakan paka nkákey ti Yéesu, nkacokoo. <verse eid="MAT 26:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51" />Tokotoko, akee ti keeyeniye ka niŋ Yéesu náañakii káakuntu ka kiteyoo, naafiit cat kaanuu amiikan a ati awaaseena ya enfakat a.<verse eid="MAT 26:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52" />Fiye, Yéesu naasokoo: “Ñahan káakuntu ka kitii la nkúfulii la, kaatuko an óo an aŋa nátaakool niŋ káakuntu, káakuntu lompo efikumukoo. <verse eid="MAT 26:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53" />Fo cukuucuk nii inci yinaat kaluum Paapaa atoom ápupoñiyam mpacas <char style="w" lemma="Maleekoo">pumaleekoo</char> púwuli? <verse eid="MAT 26:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54" />Pale niŋ eehuu hitaakiyaa, puume heekiicee ha ti <char style="w">hilim ha hiti Pútuun pa</char> efihitaako? Hisok nii: fo hitaako samat nii fiye.”<verse eid="MAT 26:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55" />Fiye, Yéesu naasok kayoŋ ka: “Fo inci akanca? Weyme ínnikeyii hicokuyam niŋ úkuntu niŋ kifiin? Hinak óo hinak inci iyyeno kakalaŋan ti hank ha hiti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>, nicokutam. <verse eid="MAT 26:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56" />Pale eehe púlooŋ hitaakaataako ancuk eeha <char style="w" lemma="Ayaamakoola">piyaamakoola</char> pa nkakiice ha hitaakiyaa.” Fiye pinapana pa púlooŋ nkakatanoo nkatey.<verse eid="MAT 26:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu hátikin awaaseena ya enfakat a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57" />Púful toko, keecoke ka Yéesu nkacoopoo pati Kayif, <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">awaaseena ya enfakat a ati Pútuun pa</char>, la <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char> niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakati pakan paka nkaconcooliye la. <verse eid="MAT 26:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58" /><char style="w">Piyeer</char> ti pílaaŋ naayeniye kanapan Yéesu, fo lati hank ha hiti awaaseena ya enfakat a. Naanako naayeno niŋ pufaasa pa kati acuk heekaakaay ha pitaako.<verse eid="MAT 26:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59" />Ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa niŋ ñíhampaatiin píhina kíiti ya púlooŋ nkálafi himuku Yéesu. Fiye, nkaŋes keetantake payenka efikacaam kapunookoo. <verse eid="MAT 26:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60" />Pale kayinaat hitaaku la éfikatii, háati fa hícump nkákeyii fa kapicaam. Ti pikelan, pákasupak nkákey, <verse eid="MAT 26:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61" />nkasok: “Ayíin a aŋe asok: 'Inci yíniyini kaahancalool <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>, illut yo ti kunoom kíhaaciil.'”<verse eid="MAT 26:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62" />Fiye awaaseena ya enfakat ya naalito naasok Yéesu: “Fo aataakut eeha aafañahan? Weyme ankaakaay hisoku ti eeha nkanookuu ha?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63" />Pale Yéesu naafatan. Awaaseena ya enfakat a naasokoo: “Sintoolo ti Pútuun pa peeyem pa kaloŋa, sok unii man awe yem <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa, Añii ya ati Pútuun pa.” <verse eid="MAT 26:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64" />Yéesu naañahanoo: “Awe soke ho. Pale inci pusok aluu, písik fíyooy efinicuk inci, <char style="w">Añii An</char>, iyyeniye ti epees yáali eti Pútuun pa piti sempe sa, iyyeno éfulii ti útiŋu wa uti patiila.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:64 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: iyyeno pikaayu patiila niŋ útiŋu wa</char></note>”<verse eid="MAT 26:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65" />Fiye, awaaseena ya enfakat a naahaac hísool ha hiteyoo ápiyisan nii seeñooseeñ. Naasok pákawiyoo ñíhampaatiin: “Ateñalaa Pútuun pa! Usoolahutaa hísiyu hiti akee eetantake! Nisincan, fiye nísiyaasi kateñal ka. <verse eid="MAT 26:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66" />Eeheyme innicoke?” Nkañahanoo: “Añaŋee himuku!” <verse eid="MAT 26:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67" />Fiye, nkafaac ti puhooŋuyoo nkapaaŋaloo púcunki, pakakee paka nkahankaloo upaatuk. <verse eid="MAT 26:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68" />Nkasokoo: “Eenucee ya, yaamakool! Sok unii ayme ayemuu ti hisapu?”<verse eid="MAT 26:68" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káalaacin ka kiti Piyeer kameye Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69" />Tempo, <char style="w">Piyeer</char> naayeno ti hank ha, amiikan aal náakey teyoo naasokoo: “Awe lompo oonool ti keeyeniye ka niŋ Yéesu ati <char style="w">Galilee</char>.” <verse eid="MAT 26:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70" />Pale Piyeer naalaaco hátikinii púlooŋ, naasok: “Inci míit eeha ayyem ti hisoku.”<verse eid="MAT 26:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71" />Fiye, naakaay pati putum pa, akee amiikan aal naacukoo, naasok pakan paka keeyem ka toko: “Ayíin a aŋe ayenaayeno niŋ Yéesu ati Naasalet.” <verse eid="MAT 26:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72" />Piyeer nene alaaco niŋ esintoolo: “Inci míit áyiin a aŋuu!”<verse eid="MAT 26:72" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73" />Fiyiit, keesiiŋiye ka toko nkaloh Piyeer, nkasokoo: “Pánipani awe oonool teyii, kaatuko pákupali pinakoolaa-nakool niŋ piteyii pa.” <verse eid="MAT 26:73" /><verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74" />Fiye Piyeer naasintoolo apusok: “Ñanee, niŋ kincaam inci iyyaake, míit áyiin a aŋuu!” Tokotoko káayiin ekutoon nkúlookii. <verse eid="MAT 26:74" /><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75" />Fiye Piyeer náanawuno hilim eeha Yéesu naasokoo ha: “Káayiin ekutoon kúlookum, áafalaacin fo ñáhaaciil nii áameyiyaam-méyi.” Náaful tíkitaaŋ, naakooŋ meemak niŋ kúnuul.<verse eid="MAT 26:75" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27" />
  <para style="s">Hicoopuyee ha hiti Yéesu pati Pilaat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1" />Eti kacom eteyyo mpucom mic, <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> púlooŋ niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakati pakan paka, nkateŋenool kati kamuk Yéesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2" />Fiye nkacenkoo, nkacoopoo nkawufanoo <char style="w">Pilaat</char>, ati hikaw ha ati <char style="w">Judaay</char>, aŋa amansa ya enfakat a ati <char style="w">Room</char> naasiiŋane ya toko.<verse eid="MAT 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ewaŋoolo ya eti Judas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3" />Púful toko, Judas, éefule ya ti Yéesu, náapannum nii Yéesu áhineehin kíiti, fiye towiit waah fo himukuyoo, naawatanoolo. Naañoho kati añahan <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakati pakan paka síkotifoloo áwii niŋ ŋaasuwan ya (30) ensa nkacooyoo sa ápuful ti Yéesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4" />Naasok: “Inci muuyenaamuuyen, kaatuko fúlaaful ti áyiin éehinut waah kati amukee!” Pale nkasokoo: “Putum unii pineetaat toko. Eehuu hitii.” <verse eid="MAT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5" />Fiye Judas naawant mañ ma ti hank ha hiti <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char>, naakaay naacaawaŋ faŋoo.<verse eid="MAT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6" />Fiye, ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa nkayes mañ ma nkasok: “<char style="w">Hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hicoonut hicoopu mañ emmuu mipimankee ti émankuma ya eti ekumpaan ya enfakat ya kaatuko mañ miti hísim.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7" />Fiye nkateŋenool, nkásiyool nkacoop mañ ma kapunoom kaakit ka kiti ateefa pipala pa, ancuk kati káhin ko íhokuma <char style="w" lemma="Akaawoola">ekaawoola</char>. <verse eid="MAT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8" />Ekina ewune kaakit enkuu nkusokee fo fíyooy “Kaakit kiti hísim.” <verse eid="MAT 27:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9" />Fiyuu eeha <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya Jeremiya naasoke ha nihitaakiye, asok: <char style="qt">“Nkacoop síkotifoloo áwii niŋ ŋaasuwan ya (30), cooy eyya pakati <char style="w">Israyel</char> nkacoone ya kati kacooy hak akina.</char> <verse eid="MAT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10" /><char style="qt">Nkacoop so kapunoom kaakit ka kiti ateefa pipala pa, samat nii fa <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> Pútuun pa mpusokaam fa.”</char><note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 32:6-9">Jeremiya 32:6-9</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 11:12-13">Sakaliya 11:12-13</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yéesu hátikin Pilaat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11" />Fiye, Yéesu naasiiŋo hátikin <char style="w">Pilaat</char>, ati hikaw ha ati <char style="w">Judaay</char>. Pilaat naacakanoo: “Fo awe yem amansa ya ati <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa?” Yéesu naañahanoo: “Awe soke ho.” <verse eid="MAT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12" /><char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">Ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakati pakan paka nkanook Yéesu pale asokut waah. <verse eid="MAT 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13" />Fiye, Pilaat naasokoo: “Fo áasiit eeha púlooŋ nkayemuu ha ti hinooku?” <verse eid="MAT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14" />Pale Yéesu añahanutoo háati poonool ti eeha nkanookoo ha, Pilaat ínnimoo meemak.<verse eid="MAT 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15" />Etiil óo etiil ti pahaaño pa piti <char style="w">Himuusu ha</char>, Pilaat asalaasal kakatan oonool ti keekulee ka aŋa pakan paka nkálafiye. <verse eid="MAT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16" />Ti oom waati intaako eekulee aŋa éesiyye, aŋa nkasok Palapas.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Niŋ ekina tom: Yéesu Palapas</char></note> <verse eid="MAT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17" />Fiye ta kayoŋ ka nkuconcooliye ta, Pilaat naacakanii: “Fo ayme ínnilafiye pikatan aluu? Palapas, fo Yéesu aŋa nkasok a <char style="w">Eenucee ya</char> ati Pútuun pa?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18" />Pilaat ámeyimeyi nii ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakati pakan paka kawufanoowufan Yéesu kamma paheeka.<verse eid="MAT 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19" />Ta Pilaat naayeniye ta ti híkon ha hiti éhinuma kíiti ya, aaloo naapoñ teyoo an niŋ hilim eehe: “Ayíin aŋuu <char style="w" lemma="Pucoonool">eecoonoole</char>, timpi hínoo waah, kaatuko fíyooy inci kallaakallo meemak ti éyawut kamma akina.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20" />Pale ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakati pakan paka nkáluuŋ kayoŋ ka kupusok Pilaat akatan Palapas, Yéesu naamukee. <verse eid="MAT 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21" />Pilaat naacakan kayoŋ ka: “Ti payenke t’ésupakii, ayme ínnilafiye pikatan aluu?” Nkiñahanoo: “Palapas!” <verse eid="MAT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22" />Pilaat naasokii: “Ooto puume inci fáhin Yéesu aŋa nkasok a Eenucee ya?” Poko púlooŋ nkasok: “Apempeŋee ti <char style="w">kuluwaa</char>!” <verse eid="MAT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23" />Pilaat naañahanii: “Weyme uwune? Eeheyme heenaput náahine?” Pale nkahaŋ nkaceeke kapusok: “Apempeŋee ti kuluwaa!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24" />Ta Pilaat naacuke ta nii átayini íhinu waah, kayoŋ ka nkutowotowo ti pahampanane, naacoop man, naañow sipeesoo hátikin kayoŋ ka naasok: “Inci kuulanoolaa-kuulanoolo ti hísim áyiin a aŋe. Eehuu hitaaluu!” <verse eid="MAT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25" />Pakan paka púlooŋ nkañahanoo: “Hísimoo hínowii toonii niŋ ti epuuk unii!” <verse eid="MAT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26" />Fiye Pilaat naakatanii Palapas. Pale náahin kapisap Yéesu niŋ kisawut, naawufanoo pusoocaali pa kati apempeŋee ti kuluwaa.<verse eid="MAT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Káapalahool kiti pusoocaali pa Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27" />Fiye, pusoocaali pa pakati <char style="w">Pilaat</char>, ati hikaw ha ati <char style="w">Judaay</char>, nkacoop Yéesu pati ékinuma ya eti Pilaat, nkaconcenool pusoocaali pa púlooŋ keeyem ka ti kayoŋ ka kiteyii kápikiipooloo. <verse eid="MAT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28" />Nkawaat wañ wa uteyoo, nkásooloo hísool henfakat héecunke samat nii amansa. <verse eid="MAT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29" />Nkacoop mífiitiin miti pícankun nkaliil mo samat nii éwuulu eti amansa, nkasoof yo ti hikaw Yéesu. Nkanaŋ hikasap ti epeesoo yáali. Nkákilipo hátikinoo nkayeniyoo káapalahool kapusok: “Ukicanuu, awe amansa ya ati <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30" />Nkafaac teyoo, nkacoop hikasap ha nkayeniyoo hisapu ti hikaw. <verse eid="MAT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31" />Ta nkapayoo ta káapalahool, nkawaat hísool ha henfakat ha, nkásooloo wañ wa uteyoo. Fiye nkacoopoo kati kapempeŋoo ti <char style="w">kuluwaa</char>.<verse eid="MAT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaapempeŋee ka kiti Yéesu ti kuluwaa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32" />Fiye, ta pusoocaali pa nkayeniye ta hicoopu Yéesu tíkitaaŋ saatee ya, nkapaakool niŋ áyiin aŋa nkasok Simon, eeyem ya cosaanoo Silen. Nkáhinoo ti sempe apikanto <char style="w">kuluwaa</char> ya eti Yéesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33" />Nkacol la nkasok la Golgota, ekina eyem “Esent.” <verse eid="MAT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34" />Nkawufanoo wiiñ eenakanoolee niŋ waah weesampa apilaan, pale ta naasiikane yo ta, naapook yo pálaani. <verse eid="MAT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35" />Fiye, nkapempeŋoo ti kuluwaa ya. Pusoocaali pa nkañak kaakaaw kápipaacinool wañ wa uteyoo. <verse eid="MAT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36" />Fiye nkayeno toko look kapifaasoo. <verse eid="MAT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37" />Patiila hikawoo nkawas pakiical pa péeyisane pa heewune ha naamukee, pusok: <char style="sc">Aŋe Yéesu, Amansa Ya Ati <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> Pa.</char><verse eid="MAT 27:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38" />Toko lompo pikanca pákasupak nkapempeŋee neyoo, akee ti epeesoo yáali akee ti epeesoo yaamay. <verse eid="MAT 27:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39" />Pumuusa pa nkamukoo niŋ pisaan, nkasap kikawii. <verse eid="MAT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40" />Nkasok: “Awe eesoke ya nii aafahancalool <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char> illut yo ti kunoom kíhaaciil, fiye fakanoolo! Wánoonii ti kuluwaa ya, niŋ awe yem Añii ya ati Pútuun pa!” <verse eid="MAT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41" />Moonool-moonool muu, <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Akalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha">pikalaŋana hilim ha heesiiŋanee ha</char> hiti <char style="w">Móyiis</char> niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakati pakan paka nkápalahooloo, nkasok: <verse eid="MAT 27:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42" />“Pakakee pakan naafakane, pale ayinaat kafakan faŋoo! Niŋ pánipani akina ayem amansa ya ati <char style="w">Israyel</char>, áwanoonii féefiye ti kuluwaa ya, fiye núuyinanaa teyoo. <verse eid="MAT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43" />Pútuun pa naahintiye. Fiye Pútuun pa pifakanoo niŋ pílafiyoolafi, kaatuko asok, 'Inci yem Añii ya ati Pútuun pa.'” <verse eid="MAT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44" />Moonool-moonool muu, pikanca pa pákasupak paka keepempeŋee ka neyoo, nkamukoo lompo niŋ pisaan.<verse eid="MAT 27:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eket ya eti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45" />Kápiliŋ máamun caanak ca ti hikaw, énimaan neeyeno ti mah ma púlooŋ fo sitalaŋ síhaaciil. <verse eid="MAT 27:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46" />Máamun sitalaŋ síhaaciil, Yéesu náaceekii niŋ kaawiiluyoo apusok: “Eli, eli, lema sapaktani?” ekina eyem “Pútuun pa putoom, Pútuun pa putoom, weyme uwune ankatanam?”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">27:46 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:1">Kícimu 22:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="MAT 27:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47" />Ta pakakee keesiiŋiye ka toko nkásiye ta eehuu nkasok: “Oopa ti kaayonkal <char style="w">ayaamakoola</char> ya <char style="w" lemma="Elí ayaamakoola ya">Elí</char>!” <verse eid="MAT 27:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48" />Tokotoko, akee teyii naatey ápucoopii cífiitiin epons. Náapuuc co ti wiiñ eesipe, naacenk co ti hikasap apuwufan Yéesu kati alaan. <verse eid="MAT 27:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49" />Pakakee paka nkasok: “Túul! Usincanaa man ayaamakoola ya Elí áfaakey apifakanoo.” <verse eid="MAT 27:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50" />Yéesu nene áceekii niŋ kaawiiluyoo, naasuuŋut pikelan.<verse eid="MAT 27:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51" />Ti oom káasiiŋuma, kahuuy ka kenfakat ka keeyem ka páhantuwa <char style="w">ekumpaan ya enfakat ya eti Pútuun pa</char> nkihaaco ti upii úsupak kápiliŋ patiila fo t’etaam. Etaam ya néeyiyiŋan, pínankiin pa mpífecuto, <verse eid="MAT 27:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52" />kiyaak ka nkípankino. Hícump puhunuŋ piti <char style="w">keesampanee ka pakati Pútuun pa</char> mpílitaniyee ti eket. <verse eid="MAT 27:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53" />Pamuusal élitaniyee ya eti Yéesu ti eket ya, nkáfulii ti kiyaak ka nkanako <char style="w">Jerusalem</char>, saatee ya eesampanee ya, nkáyisanoolo ti hícump pakan.<verse eid="MAT 27:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54" />Ahámpaatiin asoocaali ya niŋ keeyem ka neyoo ti efaas Yéesu kapucuk páyiyiŋanal etaam ya niŋ heetaakiye ha púlooŋ, nkafe meemak nkasok: “Pánipani, aŋe Añii Pútuun!”<verse eid="MAT 27:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55" />Intaako toko hícump pakaal kéenapoolii niŋ Yéesu kápiliŋ <char style="w">Galilee</char> kati kamankooloo. Fiye, nkayeno ésincanii pállaaŋe. <verse eid="MAT 27:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56" />Teyii intaak <char style="w">Mari</char> ati saatee ya eti Makatala, Mari íññaa ya ati <char style="w">Saak</char> niŋ Josef, niŋ íññaa ya ati Sepete epuukoo pákayiin pákasupak paka.<verse eid="MAT 27:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ehok ya eti Yéesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57" />Púful toko, máamun nkániim, intaak usaanum ati saatee ya eti Alimataay, caacawoo <char style="w">Josef</char>, éeyenoonii lompo anapana ati Yéesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58" />Naakaay pati <char style="w">Pilaat</char> naacakanoo ehunuŋ ya eti Yéesu. Fiye Pilaat naasok kawufanoo yo. <verse eid="MAT 27:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59" />Josef naacoop ehunuŋ ya, naakuup yo niŋ kahuuy keekuule kiti ehok. <verse eid="MAT 27:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60" />Naahok yo ti hiyaak héeyeeni eeha naawake ha hak akina ti kawuŋ énankiin. Náapalinkan énankiin enfakat ti putum hiyaak ha, naakaay. <verse eid="MAT 27:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61" /><char style="w">Mari</char> ati saatee ya eti Makatala niŋ akee Mari ya nkayeno toko look púcoonool hiyaak ha.<verse eid="MAT 27:61" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hifaasuyee ha hiti hiyaak ha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62" />Eti kacom eteyyo, <char style="w">hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</char>, <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> niŋ <char style="w" lemma="Afalisaay">Pufalisaay</char> pa nkakaay ti coonool pati <char style="w">Pilaat</char>. <verse eid="MAT 27:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63" />Nkasokoo: “Ahámpaatiin, únawunaanawuno nii ta naayeniye ta kaloŋa, acaakoola ya aŋuu asok, 'Pamuusal kunoom kíhaaciil inci fálitaniyee ti eket ya.' <verse eid="MAT 27:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64" />Káluma, ufan hilim nii, hiyaak ha hifaasee fo kunoom kíhaaciil. Ancuk pinapana pa pakateyoo timpi kakaay kápilip ehunuŋ ya eteyoo nkasok pakan paka nii alitaalito ti eket ya. Kincaam ka kikelan enke efikumuus kíyaañ ka.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65" />Pilaat naañahanii: “Nicoop pufaasa, nikaay innifaas hiyaak ha meemak fa inniyina fa.” <verse eid="MAT 27:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66" />Fiye nkakaay, nkamincan hiyaak ha, nkacotal énankiin ya eepanke ya putum hiyaak ha, nkasiiŋan pufaasa kapifaas ho.<verse eid="MAT 27:66" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28" />
  <para style="s">Pilito pa piti Yéesu ti eket ya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1" />Pamuusal <char style="w">hinoom ha hiti kayeno ka</char>, Timaas ya nuulap, <char style="w">Mari</char> ati saatee ya eti Makatala niŋ akee Mari ya nkakaay kaasincan hiyaak ha hiti Yéesu. <verse eid="MAT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2" />Tokotoko, etaam ya néeyiyiŋan meemak, kaatuko <char style="w">maleekoo</char> eti <char style="w">Ateeteyo</char> éwanoonii épufulii alacana, neekaay néepalinkan énankiin ya eepantane ya hiyaak ha, neeyeno teyyo. <verse eid="MAT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3" />Pacuk eteyyo mpucuk nii pamaliñoolal, wañ eteyyo núuhiini nii pelekaanoo. <verse eid="MAT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4" />Pufaasa pa nkaket niŋ ewatate ta nkacuke yo ta, nkakikilan nkalamo pucuk fiye nii keekete.<verse eid="MAT 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5" />Fiye, maleekoo ya neesok pakaal paka: “Timpi nife, kaatuko inci méyimeyi nii Yéesu eepempeŋee ya ti <char style="w">kuluwaa</char> ya inniyem ti hiŋes. <verse eid="MAT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6" />Aneetaat le, alitaneelitan ti keekete ka samat nii fa naasoke fa. Níkey nisincan la ehunuŋoo neehintanee la. <verse eid="MAT 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7" />Fiye nihiliikan canisok pinapana pa pakateyoo: 'Alitaneelitan ti keekete ka, nísiitan oopa ti pikaay ti mah ma miti <char style="w">Galilee</char> hátikin aluu. Po efinicukoo.' Eehe inci ínkeyii aluu hisoku.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8" />Fiye pakaal paka nkahiliikan kápuful ti hiyaak ha, ti ewatate pale nkameeŋ pásuuma, nkatey kapica kakaman eehuu pinapana pa pakateyoo. <verse eid="MAT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9" />Tokotoko, Yéesu naapaakoolanii naasokii: “Kásuumaay!” Nkákey teyoo nkacok wootoo nkámuloo. <verse eid="MAT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10" />Fiye, Yéesu naasokii: “Timpi nife, nikaay canisok pakanam ti káyinan kakaay Galilee, po efikacukam.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakaman ka kiti pufaasa pa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11" />Púful toko, pakaal paka ti pikaayu pa pati pinapana pa, pakakee ti pufaasa pa keeyeniye ka efaas hiyaak ha nkakaay ti saatee ya. Nkakaman <char style="w" lemma="Awaaseena ati Pútuun pa">ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa pakati Pútuun pa</char> heetaakiye ha púlooŋ. <verse eid="MAT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12" />Ñíhampaatiin puwaaseena pa nkaconcoolo niŋ ñíhampaatiin ña pakati pakan paka nkateŋenool eeha éfikahin. Nkawufan pusoocaali pa hícump mañ. <verse eid="MAT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13" />Nkasokii: “Niñaŋaa hisoku eehe nii, pinapana pa pakateyoo kákeyii níhanant, nkálip ehunuŋ ya eteyoo aluu ti hiŋotu. <verse eid="MAT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14" />Niŋ <char style="w">Pilaat</char>, ati hikaw ha ati <char style="w">Judaay</char>, ásiyaa eehuu, unii éfuukup neyoo, etinitaak kúnuul.” <verse eid="MAT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15" />Fiye pusoocaali pa nkacoop mañ ma, nkáhin eeha nkasokee ha. Hilim eehuu nihihancaloolo meemak ti <char style="w" lemma="Asuwif">Pusuwif</char> pa háati fo fíyooy.<verse eid="MAT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kúmpoña ka keemaka ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16" />Púful toko, pinapana pa ŋaasuwan niŋ oonool a nkakaay <char style="w">Galilee</char>, ti tíntiŋ ya eyya Yéesu naasokii ya kakaay. <verse eid="MAT 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17" />Po nkacuke Yéesu, nkámuloo, pale pakakee nkataak kunuu kúsupak. <verse eid="MAT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18" />Yéesu naalohii naasokii: “Inci ufaneewufan sempe sa púlooŋ siti alacana niŋ t’etaam. <verse eid="MAT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19" />Ooto nikaay ti <char style="w">púlunta pa</char> púlooŋ, innitaak pinapana ti pakan paka púlooŋ; ínnihinii <char style="w">pátise</char> ti caacaw ca citi Paapaa ya, citi Añii ya niŋ citi <char style="w">Kunuu ka keenape ka</char>, <verse eid="MAT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20" />ínnikalaŋanii káputuul waah óo waah ewwa inci insoke wa aluu. Pánipani, inci oopa niŋ aluu tan óo tan fo ti pikelan caanak ence.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28" />
</usx>